	file.0000000000000001.title: "Infinity Legacy II"
	quest.001193061B6363C1.quest_desc: ["Those enormous chickens can be often found in plains."]
	quest.00588B2FDB99874D.quest_desc: ["&bApotheosis&r adds a new type of crafting system accessible via the normally-useless &eFletching Table&r. This Fletching system allows for &6higher yields&r when making arrows, and is required to craft certain types of &dexclusive arrows&r. There are currently four new types of arrows: &7Broadhead Arrows&r, Obsid&5ian&r Arrows, &6Explosive&r Arrows, and &bMining&r Arrows."]
	quest.00654F576522DDCA.quest_desc: [
		"A gearbox with shafts on all 6 sides."
		"Top and bottom spin at half speed."
	]
	quest.006A26D253D4D1C2.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Jetpack&r is an item that allows the player to fly, equippable in the chestplate slot."
		""
		"It uses &3Hydrogen&r gas as a fuel, of which it can store up to &o&b24,000mB&r."
	]
	quest.00A3AD4BD4EE0FC7.quest_desc: [
		"The Guard Tower will employ and house one Guard to protect your colony. Your citizens will appreciate a well guarded colony. A general rule of thumb is two guards for every three citizens."
		""
		"Guards sleep in guard dowers, freeing up the bed they previously occupied in a residence or tavern allowing you to recruit new colonists. "
		""
		"Tip: You can expand your colony border by building and leveling up guard towers."
	]
	quest.00A3AD4BD4EE0FC7.quest_subtitle: "Build a Guard Tower and Hire a Guard"
	quest.00ACD837E30165B3.quest_desc: ["Generates rotational energy from FE. Enables bridging between electrical mods and Create's kinetic systems."]
	quest.00B8F3AE04BF9027.quest_desc: ["Drain is a specialized Ender IO component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its alloy, capacitor, side, conduit or inventory contract and a safe blocked or disconnected state; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.00C65DA0590BF5CA.quest_desc: ["Familiar Wixie is a summoning, familiar or magical automation component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify summoning prerequisite, entity ownership, working area, valid targets, output policy and unique-drop exclusion; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.00C88180C14B1A91.quest_desc: ["Used with &6Spatial IO Port&r to store spatial regions."]
	quest.00D11748B75CDABC.quest_desc: ["Inferium Essence is a tier or resource essence. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify upgrade and downgrade direction, infusion-crystal durability, batch ratios and prevention of recursive conversion or EMC loops; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.00D11748B75CDABC.title: "Inferium Essence — Renewable Production Acceptance"
	quest.00D6F365E1D3D46F.quest_desc: ["Furnator Starter is a Starter solid-fuel generator in the Powah energy chain. Its tier is meaningful only when the upstream energizing materials and the downstream machine or network can operate at the same sustained rate.","Acceptance: verify fuel quality, feed rate and clean shutdown; run a representative load without manual inventory correction, record input/output rate and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this tier early."]
	quest.00E49393B6B2DB11.quest_desc: ["Absolute Thermodynamic Conductor is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.00EFC7B327E79076.quest_desc: ["Pellet Antimatter is a SPS, antimatter or nucleosynthesis component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify polonium input, SPS energy pulse, coil count, antimatter output rate, containment buffer, recipe authority and prohibition of simulated antimatter; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0104893F8F3458DA.quest_subtitle: "Right click steel casings with a heavy plate."
	quest.012148BBA9DA43A0.quest_desc: ["Material Stonework Factory is a multi-recipe processing factory. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify recipe locking, shared-input contamination, byproducts, energy demand and full-output shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.0149B3F7F08D7E35.quest_subtitle: "Crafting ingredient"
	quest.014BB7CA85D14532.quest_desc: ["Enchanters Mirror is a specialized Ars Nouveau component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify its Source, spell, ritual, entity or automation contract and a safe invalid-input or interrupted state; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.0152C49AB74B9D32.quest_desc: ["Fusion Reactor Controller / Fusion Reactor Frame / Fusion Reactor Port / Reactor Glass is a fusion-reactor ignition or structure component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify D-T fuel production, laser charge, ignition sequence, injection rate, passive and active output, coolant loop and restart after flameout; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0152C49AB74B9D32.quest_subtitle: "The best power source you can get"
	quest.0152C49AB74B9D32.title: "Fusion Reactor Controller / Fusion Reactor Frame / Fusion Reactor Port / Reactor Glass — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.0158F70E9E7F6ED7.quest_desc: ["The 16384k Storage Disk can store 16384000 items."]
	quest.019D5A05A2134C7E.quest_desc: ["Made from a &8Metallurgic Infuser&r this item is used in a few crafting recipes. Can also be found in &9loot crates&r."]
	quest.01A250921FB4E8EA.quest_desc: ["Enhancement Core is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.01B7A0376B792788.quest_desc: ["After completing the &aSpelunking table&r puzzle &ethree times in a row&r, you will acquire the &6Forlorn Hollows cave codex&r, which is used in crafting a &amap&r to the &6Forlorn Hollows&r or &lRight-Clicking&r for &binformation&r on the &acaves.&r"]
	quest.01C3B23461807007.quest_desc: ["A better tier of pipe with more storage."]
	quest.01C3B23461807007.title: "&dUltimate Mechanical Pipe"
	quest.01E0820861BE3E93.quest_desc: ["The ultimate drilling tool, forged from powerful Netherite for unmatched strength and endurance. It tears through the hardest blocks with ease, offering top-tier performance for advanced automation and late-game mining setups."]
	quest.01EFE05083181909.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crafting&r in &ePackagedAuto&r is handled using"
		"the &ePackage Crafter&r."
		""
		"Instead of crafting items directly in a crafting table, recipes are processed using &6packages&r, making automation easier and more reliable."
		""
		"• Crafting recipes are executed by the &ePackage Crafter&r"
		"• It supports all recipes normally craftable"
		"  in a &6Crafting Table&r"
		"• The Package Crafter &crequires power&r to operate"
		""
		"By default, crafted items are &ejected&r into adjacent inventories."
		""
		"The &ePackage Crafter&r does &cNOT&r work without power."
		""
		"Make sure it is supplied with energy either directly or via the &3ME Network&r."
	]
	quest.01EFE05083181909.title: "&eCrafting&r"
	quest.01F18150EC923482.quest_desc: ["&9Refined Storage&r is a mass storage mod that offers a network-based storage system. \\\\n \\\\n To get started with the mod, you'll want to make the &6Controller&r. \\\\n \\\\n The Controller is the 'Core' of your storage network. When provided with power, it gives life to all RS components connected. Each network can only have one Controller."]
	quest.01F18150EC923482.quest_subtitle: "Getting Started"
	quest.01F18150EC923482.title: "&dRefined Storage"
	quest.01F6171999948717.quest_desc: ["Energizing Orb is a Untiered energizing process controller in the Powah energy chain. Its tier is meaningful only when the upstream energizing materials and the downstream machine or network can operate at the same sustained rate.","Acceptance: verify recipe isolation, input buffering and controlled energy delivery; run a representative load without manual inventory correction, record input/output rate and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this tier early."]
	quest.01F6171999948717.title: "Energizing Orb — Tier and System Acceptance"
	quest.01FB8D69E655FED3.quest_desc: ["Wyvern Core is a tier-defining draconic material or core in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify material origin, previous-tier core, awakening or Chaos prerequisite, batch size and reusable progression permissions; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0203D270DDDC7E84.quest_subtitle: "Made by spouting creosote oil in planks."
	quest.020781DCBCE5AA49.quest_desc: ["Chests can be converter into shulker by right clicking them using 2 shells"]
	quest.0219BA01C1F9A0DE.quest_desc: ["Ah the dragonforge, pride of the Obsidian Kingdom. They discovered that if you let dragon breath into a forge, while there is iron inside, the outcome is dragonsteel. Each type of dragon requires its own forge. "]
	quest.0219BA01C1F9A0DE.title: "Lightning Dragonforge"
	quest.0221FE72F998600E.quest_subtitle: "A Create mod add-on adding quality-of-life blocks that you wish existed in Create."
	quest.02272D430F08B1DC.quest_desc: ["Large Tank / Large Tank Hatch / Steel Machine Casing is a large industrial multiblock component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify structure validity, hatch tiers, parallel recipes, heat or pressure requirement, maintenance access and recovery after interruption; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.024ECF6DAC3691FD.quest_desc: ["Similar to the &7Dark matter armor&r, though this set has more&6 knockback resistance&r. All of the armor &dnever breaks&r."]
	quest.025861E0BD7CC285.quest_desc: ["Supreme Mechanical Pipe is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.025A2610DEFC8C99.quest_subtitle: "Essential in every modpack."
	quest.02643BAD1AE747C6.quest_desc: ["Advanced Liquid Compressor is a compressed-air generation component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify fuel or energy input, heat production, maximum pressure, air output and safe unload behaviour; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.027084AE2DF5EBA6.quest_desc: [
		"The &cThermal Evaporation Plant&r multi-block produces &eBrine&r based on the internal temperature."
		""
		"There are several methods to increase the temperature of the plant, including building them in a desert!"
		""
		"The &aFuelwood Heater&r burns buckets of &6Lava&r, which can them be piped in using a pipe that transfers heat."
		""
		"The &eResistive Heater&r uses &cRF/FE&r to produce heat, and can be set to use whatever &cRF/FE&r you want it to use."
	]
	quest.027B95599926AC64.quest_desc: ["Item Wyvern Shield Capacity is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.027E771CE7C66EAC.quest_desc: ["You will find &epillars of neodymium&r throughout the &dmagnetic caves&r, the &cscarlet version&r has the ability to &apull you&r while holding or wearing &dmagnetic items&r."]
	quest.028BAE69E167F3C0.quest_desc: ["A &bdetailed map&r that reveals the &6primordial cave biomes&r, and the borders of &anearby biomes&r. is crafted from &ecodex's.&r"]
	quest.029986AB191B2173.quest_desc: ["Ritual Wilden Summon is a ritual execution component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify activation reagent, area, duration, Source demand, world side effects and safe cancellation; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.02C61505B5649304.quest_desc: ["Awakened Core is a tier-defining draconic material or core in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify material origin, previous-tier core, awakening or Chaos prerequisite, batch size and reusable progression permissions; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.02D05B1D0B266578.quest_desc: ["Once you have steel, you might choose to speed up your blast furnace by making these reinforcing walls for it."]
	quest.02FE307E10DEACA5.quest_desc: ["The 256k Storage Disk can store 256000 items."]
	quest.0318AF961DA821CA.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Culinary is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.0328346D53437756.quest_desc: [
		"Obviously, the modpack isn't just that; this questline only served to guide you from the early game to what I hope you're at now &6the midgame&r. "
		""
		"Now it's up to you to choose how you'll progress, with your goal still being the &4Heart of the Void&r. Base your progress on the other questlines and crafting the items needed for the &4Heart of the Void&r. Everything you need now is in the questlines and the JEI."
		""
		"&2If you still have any questions, our Discord server is always open for questions and suggestions!&r"
	]
	quest.032867F83089732B.quest_desc: ["Screen Controller is a monitoring and display component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify module source, displayed value, refresh cost, range, stale-data indication and diagnostic usefulness; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0359F741EACB7578.quest_desc: ["Soularium Ingot is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.037A36EA33EE666D.quest_subtitle: "Not a black hole"
	quest.037B8971900F3840.quest_desc: [
		"The Factory Must Grow (TFMG for short) is an addon to the Create mod. The mod adds factory-style structures, processes, and items like Crude Oil, Steel Blasting, and various Electric Components."
		""
		"TFMG adds more processes that extend Create's Steampunk style to a more industrial, diesel-punk stage of advancement. "
		""
		"Processes that this mod adds are Oil Distillation by boiling Crude Oil into various oil products (more commonly known as \"fractions\") like Diesel and Gasoline. You can use your Diesel to power a easy-scalable Diesel Engine or further refine your Naphtha into Ethylene and Propylene for Plastic and Coolant Liquid. Make Napalm Bombs out of Gasoline, Sulfuric Acid, and Aluminum to \"prank\" your friends, but don't try this at home!"
	]
	quest.03C78165C5CBD9E1.quest_desc: ["The 16k Storage Disk can store 16000 items."]
	quest.03C78165C5CBD9E1.title: "&a16k Storage Part&r"
	quest.03DB20CF345324D5.quest_subtitle: "Crush some Pulsar Fragment Ingots."
	quest.03E7D73433AB6B7C.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.03E7D73433AB6B7C.title: "Mundabitur Dust"
	quest.041A1C64A8468087.quest_desc: ["Suspended high in the sky, this arrowhead-shaped airship drifts on a massive aft propeller. Boarding is perilous, but those who succeed will witness its strange and fearsome inhabitants riding boar-like beasts, their eyeless faces obscured by ominous cages. Danger and mystery ride with them across the clouds."]
	quest.041A1C64A8468087.quest_subtitle: "Find a Heavenly Rider"
	quest.042165DED0816E00.quest_desc: ["&6AllTheModium&r adds a few new &aores,&r each with its own set of &cgear&r and &eitems.&r"]
	quest.045B1DF7F39940DF.quest_desc: ["Vibrant Alloy Ingot is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0462CF00D2373233.quest_subtitle: "Upgrade your space suit!"
	quest.04770ED4ACF276A8.quest_desc: ["To obtain the rainbow coal simply blow up a rainbow furnace."]
	quest.0488989FD7F5AF42.quest_desc: ["Obtained by putting an Iron Ingot in a Rolling Mill."]
	quest.0488989FD7F5AF42.quest_subtitle: "Crafting component."
	quest.048E545ED70D577F.quest_desc: ["Volcanic Sourcelink is a Source generation or storage component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify input legality, Source per cycle, jar routing, generation radius, renewable boundary and overflow; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.0490AEBD08511F15.quest_desc: [
		"&cRockets&r need &efuel&r to fly! Fill your &crocket&r with &efuel&r using a Fuel Loader or Auto Fuel Loader before launch."
		""
		"You can find &6oil&r inside the ground in &boceans&r which can be refined into &efuel&r within a &bFuel Refinery&r. To use a refinery, you power it by &atransporting power&r from another mod or with &6steel cables&r connected to a &8coal generater&r. Then just put a oil bucket in the left slot to give the &6machine oil&r, then put an empty bucket in the right slot to gather the &efuel.&r"
	]
	quest.0490AEBD08511F15.title: "Fuel"
	quest.0498A578D0EC3254.quest_desc: ["Made from a &8Metallurgic Infuser&r this item is used in a few crafting recipes."]
	quest.049C9E235C4BDAC1.quest_desc: ["Unlike&6 ATM tools&r, these are crafted in a &esmithing table&r. These have even &abetter stats&r then &6ATM&r and are &cindestructible.&r"]
	quest.04A69DE982F47E64.quest_desc: ["Hv Steam Turbine is a steam-generation or conversion component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify water reserve, fuel or heat input, steam output, pressure-safe buffer, turbine demand and clean shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.04A7299079141D52.quest_desc: [
		"In Applied Energistics 2, presses are used with the Inscriber to create key components for the ME system. There are four types:"
		""
		"- &eLogic Press&r – for logic processors (gold)"
		"- &fCalculation Press&r – for calculation processors (pure Certus Quartz)"
		"- &bEngineering Press&r – for engineering processors (diamond)"
		"- &8Silicon Press&r – for printed silicon"
		""
		"These presses are typically found in meteorites scattered around the world (&2Lost Cities&r)."
	]
	quest.04B3B99637C7E275.quest_desc: ["Tritium Bucket is a specialized advanced Mekanism component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify its power, chemical, heat, radiation, transport, modular or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or interrupted state; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.04B3B99637C7E275.title: "Tritium Bucket — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.04E2D539E33B7B0F.quest_desc: [
		"The Chemical Infuser combines two gases to create another gas. The gas gauges on the left and right side of its GUI are the input tanks, and correspond to correspond with the left and right sides of the machine. The gauge in the middle is for the resulting gas, which likewise is output through the front of the machine. The input and output sides can be changed in the UI of the machine."
		""
		"Without any upgrades, it operates using 200 J/t and operates once per tick (according to the recipe's cost and output). Notably, each speed upgrade doubles the operation speed of this machine, for 256 operations/t production rate at maximum upgrades."
	]
	quest.04E552E69695756D.quest_desc: ["Infinity is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.04F456B8F4DF695D.quest_subtitle: "2 RPM roughly"
	quest.05157ADC0E37127D.quest_desc: [
		"The amount of &cpower&r you hold in &eyour hands&r is &dimmense&r."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Its a &dnuke&r that&c blows up&r, what would you expect."
	]
	quest.05157ADC0E37127D.quest_subtitle: "you have become death, destroyer of worlds."
	quest.052DDFB3F5EF8504.quest_desc: ["Basic Io Crystal / Basic Relay Crystal / Basic Wireless Crystal is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.05567D628EF8D1FF.quest_desc: ["Supreme Thermodynamic Conductor is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.05618FE80F2E0372.quest_desc: ["Inferium Crystal is a cross-mod crop or integration requirement. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify the original encounter or machine path, the declared stage and whether agriculture is allowed only after first legitimate acquisition; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.0565F76E9C66AAA9.quest_desc: ["Controller is a cross-mod RFTools integration component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, data or inventory ownership, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
