	quest.05C97F07DA5B7ACF.quest_desc: ["Magmator Starter is a Starter fluid-fuel generator in the Powah energy chain. Its tier is meaningful only when the upstream energizing materials and the downstream machine or network can operate at the same sustained rate.","Acceptance: verify lava logistics, tank reserve and safe backpressure; run a representative load without manual inventory correction, record input/output rate and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this tier early."]
	quest.05D20B506213A449.quest_desc: ["Turbine Rotor / Rotational Complex / Pressure Disperser / Turbine Blade is a large heat, steam or turbine multiblock component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify valid structure, steam or heat input, coolant return, rotor and coil balance, output limit, condensate recovery and safe spin-down; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
