	quest.08FBA6F89454D23D.quest_subtitle: "Move with the weight of neutronium and the speed of starlight."
	quest.0921CCD3C66B3750.quest_desc: ["Blazing Generator is a specialized RFTools ecosystem component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify its module or card configuration, power contract, area or network ownership and a safe invalid or disconnected state; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.09230E15B7C02F85.quest_desc: ["Block Breaker is a world interaction machine. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify area ownership, tool or block supply, protected blocks, unloaded chunks and item collection; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.09335D2AE7F0E044.quest_desc: ["Item Wyvern Proj Penetration is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0933E0EF37133C32.quest_desc: [
		"Using the Circuit Table, you can create much smaller logic circuits. To do so, you will need a backplane, some vacuum tubes and some solder like blead or copper wires. The table also needs to be supplied with energy through the input at its back."
		""
		"Using the various components, you then select the pattern of circuit you want to make and decide the input values, as well as the designated output. The available in and outputs are the 16 colored channels of a Redstone wire, as well as 8 \"Registers\"."
	]
	quest.09408C6DCAC90318.quest_desc: [
		"An &4Energy Cube&r is an advanced type of battery that is compatible with multiple energy systems."
		""
		"&cEnergy&r can be input from &o&b5&r sides, and output on &o&b1&r side. The output side has a special marking which looks like a &nsmall panel&r."
		""
		"Rotate the Cube by &eright-clicking&r with a &awrench&r."
		""
		"&4Energy Cubes&r can be transported by &ashift-right-clicking&r with a &ewrench&r. This will “break” the Cube, but all its energy will be &nsafely stored inside&r."
		""
		"When the Cube is in your &einventory&r, &nholding shift&r will display additional data about the Cube’s energy level."
	]
	quest.0942C0CC13ABAF70.quest_desc: ["Chest / Drive is a digital storage component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify type limits, byte capacity, partition policy, overflow destination and safe cell migration; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.0942C0CC13ABAF70.title: "Chest / Drive — Network Acceptance"
	quest.094F221EA84BF301.quest_desc: ["&aArmor&r almost identical to Netherite, though crafted from Dark matter. All of the armor &dnever breaks&r."]
	quest.095E1C928584FAAC.quest_desc: [
		"&9Free Runners&r are an item that allows players to ascend 1-block inclines automatically (like the Horse), as well as preventing &cfall damage&r as long as they are charged. A fall will reduce the item's charge, depending on how far the fall was."
		""
		"&9Free Runners&r can be charged inside of various power-related generators or storage devices, like the &aAdvanced Solar Generator&r or the &2Energy Cube&r."
	]
	quest.096767E4292E6892.quest_desc: ["Fires off a beam of &eirradiation&r while using &auranium rods&r as fuel, "]
	quest.096D7F5CBB5BCA9B.quest_desc: ["Ensouled Chassis is a specialized Ender IO component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its alloy, capacitor, side, conduit or inventory contract and a safe blocked or disconnected state; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0992D0E2A65857F4.quest_desc: ["Wilden Tribute is a summoning, familiar or magical automation component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify summoning prerequisite, entity ownership, working area, valid targets, output policy and unique-drop exclusion; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.09994EF9059206FD.quest_desc: ["This ancient tome has expanded once more... The Candy Cavity now shimmers on its pages, revealing secrets coated in sugar and madness."]
	quest.09BE3D92053AE1F8.quest_desc: ["Mechanical Roller is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.09C334C044BC464F.quest_desc: [
		"Pipe out the CO2 or it will clog up. You can make it taller than two blocks but it has no effect."
		""
		"Air is collected from air intakes, which need rotation to start collecting. They can be 1x1, 2x2, or 3x3 multiblock. They take zero power, so speed them up all you like."
		""
		"Fuel (creosote or furnace gas) is piped into the bottom face."
		""
		"Air (collected from air intakes) is piped into the side of the bottom block."
		""
		"CO2 is extracted from the sides of the bottom block."
		""
		"Hot air is extracted from the top face of the tower."
	]
	quest.09C334C044BC464F.title: "Blast Stove"
	quest.09CCC797BF15ADFC.quest_desc: ["When killing mobs with it with a test tube in your inventory, it will also collect blood."]
	quest.09D97507A2027B57.quest_desc: [
		"Iron/Gold/Diamond Chests: Use the upgraded chests for more space."
		""
		"Storage Drawers: This mod is FANTASTIC for the early game. "
		"Use drawers to store items in bulk. "
		"Connect them with a controller and you can deposit and retrieve items from a single block. "
		"It's the best way to organize before moving on to a more robust system."
	]
	quest.09D97507A2027B57.quest_subtitle: "In the beginning, simplicity reigns."
	quest.09D97507A2027B57.title: "Sophisticated Storage"
	quest.0A0D08D0032BAF5B.quest_desc: ["The reinforced furnace converts steel production from a manual milestone into an automatable industrial line.","Acceptance: automate input and both outputs, prevent slag backpressure, provide maintenance access, and demonstrate a sixteen-ingot batch without intervention."]
	quest.0A0D08D0032BAF5B.title: "Reinforced Blast Furnace — Continuous Steel"
	quest.0A34FD02D54EA6A2.quest_desc: ["Crafting Monitor is a network access and operator interface in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify access scope, crafting visibility, permission boundary, search behaviour and disconnected-state clarity; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.0A34FD02D54EA6A2.title: "Crafting Monitor — Network Acceptance"
	quest.0A5C03A114ABF62D.quest_desc: [
		"In the silent pulse between universes, there exists a presence that defies reason."
		"A creature shaped not by nature, but by the quiet gravity of forgotten worlds."
		"From its shadow comes this fragment a small, unassuming relic, yet heavy with the weight of cosmic mystery."
		""
		"Those who hold it swear they can hear a faint echo, like a heartbeat in the dark…"
		"A reminder that even the simplest beings may carry the essence of infinity."
	]
	quest.0A5C03A114ABF62D.quest_subtitle: "A reward wouldn't be useful enough for those who have made it this far..."
	quest.0A7940B06E7A3A56.quest_desc: [
		"This mod adds 7 new containers that function as both storage, and backpacks and so much more. These will be called danks from now on for the sake of brevity."
		""
		"These aren't your typical storage containers because each slot can hold much more than a normal stack and gets larger with each tier."
		""
		"Each tier can have it's stacksize and listed on the tooltip. Colors provide a visual means of determining the tier at a glance."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"To start off with, there are 2 modes: Construction and Bag. They can be switched between by toggling the usetype keybind with a dank in hand."
		""
		"In addition, there is also a block called a Dock that can be used to hold danks and allow them to interact with hoppers and other storage systems"
		""
		"Dock:"
		"They have the ItemHandler capability so they can be inserted/extracted with any form of item transport, and is compatible with Simple Storage Network and RS/AE2. as of 1.11, this also holds true for the item form as well."
		""
		"They can be harvested with anything, but break faster with a pickaxe and can be picked up instantly with a wrench "
		""
		"(Note: this mod does not use any wrenches and opts for datapack support (tag: items:forge:wrenches) because there's already 20 different mods that add their own wrenches and it only adds to JEI/inventory clutter)."
		""
		"Bag Mode:"
		"In bag mode, the dank acts like a backpack."
		""
		"Sneaking while hovering the tooltip will show contained items (limited to 10 since it crowds the screen) and the currently assigned keybinds."
	]
	quest.0A7940B06E7A3A56.title: "Dank Storage"
	quest.0A912B2E2BE34920.quest_desc: ["Gas Lift / Drill Pipe / Seismic Sensor is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0AA074D4F7CBCED1.quest_desc: [
		"Use this table to &crefine weaker Gems&r into &d more powerful socketable items&r. Precision matters higher cutting quality means better stats. Basically, it's gem surgery."
		""
		"You need two &dgems&r of the same &etype&r and &elevel,&r &bgemdust&r, and &drarity ingredients&r of the same tier."
		""
		"&oYou can sometimes use materials of a lower rarity but you will need more.&r"
	]
	quest.0AA72D6706542CA6.quest_desc: ["Charger is a crystal and network-material production step in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify crystal source, charging or growth time, batch buffer and contamination-free conversion; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.0AA72D6706542CA6.title: "Charger — Network Acceptance"
	quest.0ABDED0707E01F06.quest_desc: [
		"The Sack of Sating must be fed by right-clicking edible items into it, similar to storing items in a Bundle. When fed, it irreversibly stores the hunger value of the items within itself. If fed food contained in Bowls or Bottles, the Sack of Sating will return the Bowl or Bottle."
		""
		"When the player becomes hungry, the Sack of Sating will passively feed them, replenishing 1 (🍗) hunger every 5 seconds (100 ticks). This effect will stack if the player has multiple Sack of Sating in their inventory."
		""
		"&4Feeding the Sack of Sating certain items (like the Eternal Steak from the Artifacts mod) will cause it and the item to explode, creating an effect similar to a Nuclear Bomb, but pink and smaller. Be warned that this explosion may harm or kill the player."
	]
	quest.0ABDED0707E01F06.quest_subtitle: "Freaky ahh sack"
	quest.0AC7D844C55119E1.quest_desc: ["Wrench is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0ACCCC1B217D98D0.quest_desc: ["Quantum Structure is a cross-mod AE2 integration component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, component data and the absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.0AD6897A8AB1CC5D.quest_desc: ["Use to check how much oil a deposit has."]
	quest.0ADA2391DDE7466E.quest_desc: ["An advanced control unit that manages engine performance and power output. It optimizes efficiency, regulates speed, and ensures smooth operation of complex machinery systems."]
	quest.0ADEFF34AAA0D7C7.quest_subtitle: "Used to make a Printed Dimensional Processor"
	quest.0AE0E5AA8FB69FE2.quest_subtitle: "Gadgets for all situations"
	quest.0AE0E5AA8FB69FE2.title: "Welcome to Create:Connected"
	quest.0AE4B0BD9B765D60.quest_desc: [
		"Place the Surface Scanner atop the Machine Input and supply it with power."
		""
		"The 25 lights above indicate the 25 chunks closest to the scanner, with the center light marking the chunk it occupies. A light will illuminate if at least one Oil Deposit is detected in that chunk."
		""
		"That's all the guidance it provides time to start digging!"
	]
	quest.0AEAEA976ED0C470.quest_desc: ["Charging Station is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0AEDFC064B84C877.quest_desc: [
		"Autocrafting is one of the primary functions of AE2. Instead of manually having to craft the correct number of each sub-ingredient and labor away like some sort of plebian, you can ask your ME system to do it for you. Or automatically craft items and export them somewhere. Or automatically keep certain amounts of items in stock through clever emergent behavior. It also works with fluids, and, if you have certain addons for extra mod material types, like Mekanism gasses, those materials too. It's pretty great."
		""
		"It is quite a complex topic, so strap in and let's go."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"An autocrafting setup consists of 3 things:"
		""
		"The thing sending the crafting request"
		"The crafting CPU"
		"The ME Pattern Provider."
		"Here is what happens:"
		""
		"Something creates a crafting request. This can be you in the terminal clicking on something autocraftable, or an export bus or interface with a crafting card requesting one of the item they're set to export/stock."
		"(IMPORTANT: use whatever you have bound to \"pick block\" (usually middle-mouse) to request crafts of something you already have in stock, this can conflict with inventory sorting mods),"
		"The ME system calculates the required ingredients and prerequisite crafting steps to fulfill the request, and stores them in the selected crafting CPU"
		""
		"The ME Pattern Provider with the relevant pattern pushes the ingredients specified in the pattern to any adjacent inventory. In the case of a crafting table recipe (a \"crafting pattern\") this will be a Molecular Assembler. In the case of a non-crafting recipe (a \"processing pattern\") this will be some other block or machine or elaborate redstone-controlled setup."
		""
		"The result of the craft is returned to the system somehow, be it by import bus, interface, or pushing the result back into a pattern provider. Note that an \"item entering system\" event must occur, you can't just pipe the result into a chest with a ME Storage Bus on it."
		""
		"If that craft is a prerequisite for another craft in the request, the items are stored in that crafting CPU and then used in that craft."
	]
	quest.0AEDFC064B84C877.title: "Auto-Crafting"
	quest.0AFFE685B5B34A56.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is the ME Packaging Provider?&r"
		""
		"The &eME Packaging Provider&r is a powerful all-in-one machine that combines the functionality of a &ePackager&r and an &eUnpackager&r."
		""
		"It is designed to work &aexclusively&r with an &3ME Network&r and requires an AE2 channel."
		""
		"&eHow It Works&r"
		""
		"• Insert an encoded &ePackage Recipe Holder&r"
		"• The provider reads all stored recipes"
		"• Recipes are exposed directly to the ME Network"
		"• Requires an &3AE2&r channel"
		""
		"Depending on its configuration, the provider can handle packaging, unpackaging, or both automatically."
		""
		"&eProviding Modes&r"
		""
		"The ME Packaging Provider supports three different providing modes:"
		""
		"• &eDirect&r"
		"  – Provides a single large processing recipe"
		"  – Skips both packaging and unpackaging steps"
		""
		"• &ePackaging&r"
		"  – Provides packaging recipes"
		"  – Works like a normal &ePackager&r"
		""
		"• &eUnpackaging&r"
		"  – Provides unpackaging recipes"
		"  – Works like a normal &eUnpackager&r"
		""
		"&eWhy Use the ME Packaging Provider?&r"
		""
		"• Combines Packager and Unpackager in one block"
		"• Reduces machine count and wiring"
		"• Fully integrated into &3AE2&r autocrafting"
		"• Ideal for compact, high-performance setups"
	]
	quest.0AFFE685B5B34A56.title: "&eME Packaging Provider&r"
	quest.0B009391E3F76D6E.quest_desc: [
		"The fisher is an excellent source of early game food for your citizens. Hopefully you have a decent resource for string. With any luck the fisherman will also get some some extra loot. "
		""
		"If your colony lacks a natural water source like an ocean or river, you can make do with a 6x6x1 area of water. "
	]
	quest.0B1DF8A040826D87.quest_desc: [
		"Now that you have &4Rossinite&r, you can mix it with &bBenitoite&r to create &6Insanite Ingots&r."
		""
		"&bBenitoite Ore&r can be found in the &cNether&r."
	]
	quest.0B281C34E455EE72.quest_desc: ["Just a larger pumpjack."]
	quest.0B2DF0B5F4247A3F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Items can be input into the Fermenter via the 2 hatches at the back that are marked with blue dots. The hatch with the orange dot serves as an item output and the block below it to output fluids. Applying a redstone signal to the control panel at the front will halt the machine's process, this behavior can be inverted by use of the Engineer's Screwdriver."
	]
	quest.0B2DF0B5F4247A3F.title: "Fermenter"
	quest.0B2FF8169FD3812D.quest_desc: ["Steel Item Output Hatch / Steel Item Input Hatch / Steel Fluid Input Hatch is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0B3EA604C5172D98.quest_desc: [
		"For us to specify which &c&mDemon&r &9Friend&r we want to summon, we'll need to make a specific &bBook of Binding&r."
		""
		"To make this, you'll need to purify some Black Dye in &dSpiritfire&r to get Purified Ink. With this, we're going to make our first Book of Binding which will summon a &aFoliot&r Demon."
	]
	quest.0B3EA604C5172D98.title: "&bBooks of&r &dBinding&r"
	quest.0B561068C56FBB32.quest_desc: ["Shows you the &ctemperature,&r &agravity,&r and &boxygen&r levels of the space around you."]
	quest.0B5A46562DA0FFBC.quest_desc: ["It plays &bmusic&r from&l IRL&r &eradio channels&r, simply &lRight-Click&r on the &eradio&r then choose the &astation&r you want to listen to."]
	quest.0B5A46562DA0FFBC.quest_subtitle: "Somehow this works"
	quest.0B68E3C046C82860.title: "&6Deorum Ingots"
	quest.0B6A6B50D338546B.quest_desc: [
		"Jupiter Info:"
		"&aGravity:&r 24.714 m/s"
		"&bOxygen:&r none"
		"&cTemperature:&r -126 °C"
	]
	quest.0B6B6601CB180BAA.quest_desc: ["Basic Fluid Filter is a multi-service conduit or routing component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify service type, insert-extract direction, filter exactness, channel priority, redstone mode and loop prevention; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0B7FFB9FF90F10CF.quest_subtitle: "Yummers"
	quest.0B8148DAF5CC9DF1.quest_desc: ["High current"]
	quest.0B88116C06EDF9D2.quest_desc: ["Energetic Alloy Ingot is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0B89EB36AC565461.quest_desc: ["Deep within this subterranean city, the heat of molten lava and the hum of industry dominate the air. The Nether’s influence is strong here, fueling forges and animating Forge Sentinels that patrol every corridor. Only those prepared for fire and steel will survive, and claim the treasures forged within."]
	quest.0B89EB36AC565461.quest_subtitle: "Find a Foundry"
	quest.0BBE6CADED48A971.quest_desc: ["Stock Ticker is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0BFE9E9F4EF6C9C7.quest_desc: [
		"&0Relays&r also have &cMultiple tiers&r and will move &eEMC&r from &ecollectors&r attached to them into &6Condensers&r also attached to the &0relay.&r"
		""
		"&0Relays&r can also &edrain EMC&r from items to then input into nearby &6condensers.&r"
	]
	quest.0C0D0B80B3FA26F2.quest_desc: ["An upgrade to the &bElite Fluid Tank&r."]
	quest.0C0DF208C802277E.quest_desc: [
		"There are two types of &6Energy condensers&r, &aMk1&r and &bMk2.&r"
		""
		"&aMk1:&r &eConverts items&r in the &astorage area&r into the item placed in the &6top slot&r by the &eyellow bar&r."
		""
		"&bMk2:&r Similar to the &aMk1,&r however this chest will&e convert items&r in the &aleft side&r to the item in the &6top slot&r which will be placed in the &bright slot&r and can be extracted with &cMekanism pipes&r."
	]
	quest.0C0DF208C802277E.quest_subtitle: "Obsidian is a pain to mine, have some compensation"
	quest.0C110E8F2F0509EC.quest_desc: ["Infinity Elytra is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.0C15462C836B4C7B.quest_desc: ["Crafted with &biron&r and &cscarlet neodymium&r, this is the base for some &6crafting recipes&r."]
	quest.0C596CB7C7C24615.quest_desc: ["Boosts &aEterna&r and &cQuanta&r with a good Max."]
	quest.0C6719D81DE5A614.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The Forge requires 4 different items to be powered: Aureal, Souls, Blood, and Experience."
		""
		"To learn more, follow the corner quests."
	]
	quest.0C6D0B1C1AF75292.quest_desc: ["Chemical Reactor is a single-block industrial processing machine in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify recipe lock, input and output buffers, fluid or tool requirements, power tier, byproducts and full-output shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0C6D669301F8655A.quest_desc: ["Fluid Sieving Machine is a Industrial Foregoing production component. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify its exact work area, input contract, power or fluid demand, output routing and safe shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.0C8F501F6BDFFB92.quest_desc: ["Obtained by putting a Gold Ingot in a Rolling Mill."]
	quest.0C8F501F6BDFFB92.quest_subtitle: "Crafting component."
	quest.0CB1D02EA360398E.quest_desc: ["Machine Infuser is a specialized RFTools ecosystem component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify its module or card configuration, power contract, area or network ownership and a safe invalid or disconnected state; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0CE497493208E8AC.quest_desc: ["Also dropped from the &dunderzealot&r, you will &6craft&r with this."]
	quest.0CE50A7F4F1A0E4D.quest_desc: ["ladder stretches skyward, disappearing into the clouds. At its top floats a strange, floating vessel. What secrets or dangers await above, none can say… except that the view alone is enough to make even the bravest adventurer’s stomach turn."]
	quest.0CE50A7F4F1A0E4D.quest_subtitle: "Find a Small Blimp"
	quest.0CF441CB162B62B2.quest_desc: ["Sewage Composter is a animal or biological processing machine. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify entity limits, breeding inputs, waste handling, welfare spacing and output separation; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.0D158BAE5A38798A.quest_desc: ["Allows the player to fly, move and swim faster. Works with water"]
	quest.0D2F5CC96269F9E3.quest_desc: ["Etching Tank is a printed-circuit manufacturing component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify plastic preparation, UV exposure, etching time, acid handling, board yield and prevention of early PCB rewards; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0D31CD79BE6CC8D2.quest_desc: ["Yeast Culture Bucket is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0D5015B8FF482D0A.quest_desc: ["Amadron Tablet is a remote trading component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify offer source, payment and delivery inventory, unavailable-offer handling, stage restrictions and duplication prevention; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0D6D45DBA64E612D.quest_desc: ["&b-10 Min Spawn Delay&r - Quicker spawns."]
	quest.0D6E099A1A242153.quest_desc: [
		"The &bBuild Tool&r is one of the most important tools in the mod. It's how you will place all building from now on. Right+click any solid item to open the build preview GUI. On the right are controls for moving, rotating, raising, and lowering your building. "
		""
		"Place your &bTown Hall&r block and register your colony. However, the first building to be constructed is the builders hut. Your Town Hall cannot be built until you have a completed builders hut."
		""
		""
		"{image:minecolonies:textures/quests/hc_build_tool.png width:190 height:100 align:1}"
	]
	quest.0D9F327D30321040.quest_desc: ["End Crafting Table is a crafting-infrastructure tier in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify previous-table ancestry, matrix size, automation interface, recipe authority and prevention of lower-table substitutes; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.0DA65A502C57261C.quest_desc: ["Just like any other create contraption, you can superglue basically anything to a pumpjack, with the stipulation that the main arm is complete."]
	quest.0DA972D85BB3C86C.quest_desc: ["The coke oven produces both coke and creosote; either blocked output can stop the entire process.","Acceptance: form the complete oven, route creosote into controlled storage, provide solid-output space, and complete three batches without manual clearing."]
	quest.0DA972D85BB3C86C.quest_subtitle: "Hot Topic!"
	quest.0DA972D85BB3C86C.title: "Coke Oven — Two-Product Process"
	quest.0DCFCBCFB363C921.quest_desc: ["Your whole farm is now in 1 block."]
	quest.0DCFCBCFB363C921.quest_subtitle: "Can't be easier than that"
	quest.0DD9575CCAD78266.quest_desc: ["Machine Frame Pity is a machine-frame tier. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify frame ancestry, previous-tier consumption and authoritative recipe replacement; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.0DDC8C4F4BE5788D.quest_desc: ["Wyvern Chestpiece is a modular defensive capability item in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify shield capacity, recharge demand, flight or movement modules, damage bypass interactions and replacement after loss; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0E01D082BFC07BF4.quest_desc: ["&eInfinite chemical storage&r at your fingertips."]
	quest.0E02CE4469FCA4C9.quest_desc: ["&cRedstone Control&r - Only spawns mobs if powered."]
	quest.0E2A7FD65EF7EFFE.quest_desc: ["Item Wyvern Proj Damage is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0E44E5C58D943786.quest_desc: [
		"Sirens are sailors' worst nightmare and for good reasons. They singing causes mind control, they lure their prey and deliver a final blow. "
		"Sirens can be found in the open seas on small rock formations."
	]
	quest.0E547F2503A07ACE.quest_desc: ["A sturdy mechanical drill made of iron, designed for efficient mining and material processing. It delivers reliable power and durability, perfect for automating excavation tasks and breaking tough blocks with ease."]
	quest.0E580153F1936699.quest_desc: ["A powerful machine that converts excess energy or items into stored matter. It’s essential for producing singularities and other high-tier materials used in advanced storage and automation systems."]
	quest.0E5FC39E6C71A872.quest_desc: ["Shaft is a kinetic transmission component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify rotation direction, RPM ratio, stress capacity, branch isolation, reverse state and visible diagnostics; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0E5FC39E6C71A872.title: "Shaft — Kinetic Acceptance"
	quest.0E63C1AD9074987E.quest_desc: ["Melt quartz in the blast furnace and cast the resulting liquid silicon."]
	quest.0E72EF13D91DF064.quest_desc: [
		"The first step in &dspace exploration&r."
		"The &bMoon&r has valuable resources like &6Desh&r. (and &echeese&r, yumm)"
		""
		"Moon Info:"
		"&aGravity:&r 1.625 m/s"
		"&bOxygen:&r None"
		"&cTemperature:&r -160.0 °C"
		""
		"To get to the &dmoon&r, you need &nthree&r buckets of &efuel,&r and your &areturn journey&r also needs &nthree&r."
	]
	quest.0E72EF13D91DF064.title: "The moon"
	quest.0E7B5DB74C3C9ACB.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Magma is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.0E7C77B6B57340E6.quest_desc: ["Cosmic Mechanical Pipe is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0E8F0E3589291140.quest_desc: ["Logs is a cross-mod storage integration component in the portable and stationary storage ecosystem. Its value depends on controlled inventory ownership, routing, finite capacity and recoverable configuration rather than on possessing one container or upgrade.","Acceptance: verify the external inventory or item contract, transfer direction, component-sensitive matching and absence of a cheaper duplication or nesting route; run a representative input and extraction cycle, test empty input and full destination, record capacity and priorities, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, duplication, nested-container and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0E9258C07CDD7385.quest_desc: [
		"A Wrench made of Certus Quartz Crystal or Nether Quartz."
		""
		"Useful for rotating blocks, and removing individual parts from Cables."
	]
	quest.0E9F3510205FE096.quest_desc: ["Speeds up the growth of the plant."]
	quest.0E9F3510205FE096.quest_subtitle: "Improved Growth"
	quest.0EB2BB5FA8BED1B7.quest_desc: [
		"&5Left click&r - &4shears&r the &aanimal&r."
		""
		"&6Right click&r on a tree - &9Breaks&r all wood blocks in the &aarea&r of the right-clicked block."
		""
		"&6Right click&r on leaves - &4Shears&r all &2leaf&r blocks in the &barea&r of the right-clicked block, &3dropping&r them as items."
		""
		"&6Right click&r on grass - &8Tills&r all &edirt&r in the area of &9effect&r."
		""
		"&dPressing&r [&4Change Mode&r] will execute a &eattack&r that will insta &0kill&r most &2mob&r/&cbosses&r"
		""
		"&dPressing&r the [&4Change Mode&r] button will &9change&r the mode of the &0death&r swing between Slay-All and Slay-Agro."
	]
	quest.0EB2BB5FA8BED1B7.quest_subtitle: "Good luck killing the Chaos Dragon to make this"
	quest.0EB5B926E1FBAF0E.quest_desc: ["This upgraded &dEnchanting Table&r unlocks the real magic. &6Higher level caps&r, new enchantments, and full control over outcomes &bno more RNG&r rage. Just make sure your library setup is &etop tier&r."]
	quest.0EBB4E5195610A82.quest_desc: [
		"The Sawmill is where the Carpenter will craft any items made of at least 75% wood. This is the point where the colony really starts to feel like it’s running on its own. Be sure to set up important recipes for items your builder regularly needs. While the sawmill starts with a paltry 10 recipes, the number of recipes you can teach the Sawmill doubles per building level."
		""
		"Tip: Be sure to give your carpenter a &ebuild tool&r as some recipes require it. "
	]
	quest.0EBB4E5195610A82.quest_subtitle: "Build a Sawmill"
	quest.0ECD78BDD6FABA7C.quest_desc: ["AE2 Network Checkpoint BA7C is a network design checkpoint in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify documented topology, channel budget, power reserve, storage overflow and a restart procedure; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.0ECD78BDD6FABA7C.title: "AE2 Network Checkpoint BA7C — Network Acceptance"
	quest.0ED1670F8AEB8077.quest_desc: ["Has 6 slots for Constructing."]
	quest.0ED4263270D37EF6.quest_desc: ["Diesel Mining Drill / Diesel Jetpack / Diesel Chainsaw is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0EE2E9EB6DC01E34.quest_subtitle: "Crafting ingredient"
	quest.0EEA8C33BC327CCA.quest_desc: ["The Pattern Access Terminal serves to solve a specific issue: in a dense tower of ME Pattern Providers and Molecular Assemblers, you can't physically access the providers to insert new patterns. Additionally, perhaps you're lazy and don't want to walk across your base to insert a pattern. The pattern access terminal allows access to all pattern providers on the network."]
	quest.0EF4982211D87606.quest_desc: [
		"To increase the &aMorgan&r’s damage cap, you now need to toss &bMithril Weaves&r into the lake instead of &3Nether Stars&r."
		"                      This"
		"{image:supplementaries:block/cannon_arrow width:15 height:15 align:center}"
		""
		"{image:irons_spellbooks:item/mithril_weave width:15 height:15 align:center}"
	]
	quest.0F00BBDF3618B3BA.quest_desc: ["This lets you access your storage, but with a crafting table! \\n \\nLet's be honest, no one just uses regular Grids."]
	quest.0F00BBDF3618B3BA.title: "Crafting Grid"
	quest.0F031E62E5235251.quest_desc: ["Insanium Block is a Insanium Mystical Agriculture component. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify its actual production role, legal first acquisition, sustained input and output rates and every renewable-resource bypass it could introduce; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.0F11F9D74E9F54E3.quest_desc: ["Item Wyvern Flight is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0F2B26C04A3593A9.quest_desc: ["Electric Simulation Chamber is a powered prediction simulator. Neural simulation is repeat-production infrastructure, not a substitute for discovering, fighting and understanding the represented creature for the first time.","Acceptance: verify energy reserve, matrix supply, model tier, cycle time, failed-input quarantine and a hard stop when output storage is full; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy, consumables, time and output, and prove that random rewards, model swapping, trades, EMC, Woot, spawners or loot-table shortcuts cannot produce restricted drops early."]
	quest.0F2DC52E03408D83.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting on a stick let's you craft items without the need to place a crafting table on the ground."
		""
		"This mod adds multiple workbenches on a stick:"
		"Crafting Table"
		"Anvil"
		"Loom"
		"Grindstone"
		"Cartography Table"
		"Stonecutter"
		"Smithing Table"
		""
		"You can use these items in hand to access the workbenches."
	]
	quest.0F2DC52E03408D83.title: "Crafting on a stick"
	quest.0F409DACBEB7BBF8.quest_desc: ["Depending on the pack style you choose, supply ships may need to be placed in water, or in the air. Clear an area large enough to fit your supply ship. This may include digging under water, depending on where you place your ship. The supply ship will not place if there are objects in the way. Right clicking the supply ship on the ground will show a 3D preview of the camp. Using the placement controls arrows, position the ship in your clearing, then click the green checkmark to finalize the placement. If it won’t place, then the terrain is in the way, and you may need to clear the area more. Red lines will appear showing you the areas that need to be cleared."]
	quest.0F4A8482026EE4BD.quest_subtitle: "Used in most of the Endgame Crafts!"
	quest.0F56F31F2751A477.quest_desc: ["An amazing form of &btransport&r on the planets. &lRight-Click&r to enter &lShift&r to exit and &lShift-Right-Click&r to open its &einvertory.&r"]
	quest.0F5EC96CAAA5302B.quest_desc: ["Impulse Hopper is a specialized Ender IO component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its alloy, capacitor, side, conduit or inventory contract and a safe blocked or disconnected state; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0F740C8970428753.quest_desc: ["Crafted from &eferroslime,&r these boots &bprevent fall damage&r, and make you &abouncy!&r"]
	quest.0F75D7B9F4FF2459.quest_desc: ["&rThe Building Gadgets 2 mod speeds up building by letting players quickly place or remove large areas of blocks."]
	quest.0F75D7B9F4FF2459.title: "Building Gadget"
	quest.0F77A9AD1F422537.quest_desc: ["A generaly good &6Bookshelf,&r however these shelves have a &aaverage Max&r &aEterna,&r so get ready for stronger shelves in your setup with this one."]
	quest.0F89BFD4A3F63A48.quest_desc: ["&6Ignores Light&r - Light dose not effect spawns."]
	quest.0F9B3AD28BA138CA.quest_desc: ["Use in a &aSmithing table&r with an item to add a &esocket&r to that item so it can hold more &dGems.&r"]
	quest.0FA2D721EFBA7DC0.quest_desc: ["Enchantment Sorter is a experience or enchantment processor. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify XP ownership, fluid conversion, enchantment extraction, invalid-input quarantine and duplication prevention; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.0FCD5DFA1F96F41D.quest_desc: ["Factory Checkpoint F41D is a factory planning checkpoint. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify documented inputs, outputs, ownership, failure state and restart procedure; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.0FCD5DFA1F96F41D.title: "Factory Checkpoint F41D — Production Acceptance"
	quest.0FD54A3728F4D93E.quest_desc: ["The very best &dSpell book&r with many &espell slots&r and a &6low cooldown&r."]
	quest.0FF49F7DD4D172CF.quest_desc: ["Book is a cross-mod arcane integration component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, data-bearing state and absence of a cheaper parallel route; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.0FF49F7DD4D172CF.title: "Book — Arcane Acceptance"
	quest.0FF852DE33E41C90.quest_desc: [
		"If we want to create massive amounts of &4Power&r, we'll need a way to store all of it, and those &aEnergy Cubes&r just won't cut it."
		""
		"We're going to create a customizable multiblock used to store large amounts of power, but first, we need to make some &3Lithium Dust&r!"
		""
		"You should have some &eBrine&r being made from a previous quest using the &cThermal Evaporation Plants&r."
		""
		"Run the &eBrine&r through another &cThermal Evaporation Plant&r to get &7Lithium&r, then through a &9Chemical Crystallizer&r to get &aLithium Dust&r."
	]
	quest.0FF852DE33E41C90.title: "Advanced Power Storage"
	quest.0FFFAB42C8994C3B.quest_desc: ["Scribes Table is a spell component or inscription system in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify glyph prerequisites, reagent cost, compatible forms and augments, inscription ownership and test-cast safety; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.1002F4E426C36598.quest_desc: ["Fermentation Station is a multi-recipe processing factory. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify recipe locking, shared-input contamination, byproducts, energy demand and full-output shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.1031061467ECD680.quest_desc: ["You will find &epillars of neodymium&r throughout the &dmagnetic caves&r, the &9Azure version&r has the ability to &apush you&r while holding or wearing &dmagnetic items&r."]
	quest.104EBBC08B4733F5.quest_desc: ["Sim Chamber is a powered prediction simulator. Neural simulation is repeat-production infrastructure, not a substitute for discovering, fighting and understanding the represented creature for the first time.","Acceptance: verify energy reserve, matrix supply, model tier, cycle time, failed-input quarantine and a hard stop when output storage is full; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy, consumables, time and output, and prove that random rewards, model swapping, trades, EMC, Woot, spawners or loot-table shortcuts cannot produce restricted drops early."]
	quest.1065B5980FAF5937.quest_desc: [
		"Pipe crude oil into the Distillation Controller and collect products from each output."
		""
		"Blaze Burner heating is required. Steel tanks can be 1x1, 2x2, or 3x3, with larger sizes allowing more heating, which can increase the distilling rate."
		""
		"The minimum height tower has three outputs and produces Heavy Oil, Diesel, and Gasoline."
		""
		"Adding two more outputs allows production of LPG and Kerosene."
		""
		"Adding one more output lets you extract Naphtha."
		""
		"Outputs can be configured to void excess fluid or stop refining when full to prevent wasting oil."
	]
	quest.1070E5EB5869C5DB.title: "&eElite Crafting&r"
	quest.1081BFCAB3F07FFF.quest_desc: ["Large Steam Boiler / Bronze Plated Bricks / Heatproof Machine Casing / Bronze Machine Casing Pipe is a steam-generation or conversion component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify water reserve, fuel or heat input, steam output, pressure-safe buffer, turbine demand and clean shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1081BFCAB3F07FFF.title: "Large Steam Boiler / Bronze Plated Bricks / Heatproof Machine Casing / Bronze Machine Casing Pipe — Factory Acceptance"
	quest.1094111FB9512D75.quest_desc: ["Mv Diesel Generator is a voltage-tier electrical component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify voltage tier, amperage or EU demand, cable loss, transformer boundary, overvoltage protection and reserve capacity; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.109AD73F016D576B.quest_desc: [
		"Productive Bees has excellent JEI integration, so you can learn a lot about bees by looking them up in JEI. They all have “bee” in the name, so they’re easy to search for. "
		""
		"Once you find the bee you want, left-clicking will give you information about how to get the bee (what nest type it likes, or what other bees you need to interbreed, or the like), while right-clicking will show you information about what the bee does once you have it what food it needs, what resources it produces, what blocks (if any) it can destroy/alter, and what other bee species can be bred from it. There’s usually also an “info” tab (marked with a 🛈) with general information."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"This also works for most non-bee things; for example, left-clicking on a nest will give you its recipe, while right-clicking on it will tell you what biomes it supports and what sorts of bees it can attract."
		""
		"If you’re already familiar with JEI, these are the “recipe for” and “uses of” views."
	]
	quest.109AD73F016D576B.title: "Learning about bees"
	quest.10A4748598F5EE60.quest_desc: ["Super Cell Component 1K is a cross-mod AE2 integration component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, component data and the absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.10B3C9982C378951.quest_desc: ["Item Wyvern Auto Fire is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.10B7BB5203B5E615.quest_desc: ["Apply special upgrades to your gear using &6sigils of Enhancement&r. Insert Sigil → &aboost&r or &creroll&r existing powerful &bpassive bonuses&r. Simple, elegant, and a core part of late game optimization."]
	quest.10C527C66EE4E95A.quest_desc: ["Has an &aamazing max&r with crazy &dstat buffs&r plus extra &eRectifaction&r."]
	quest.10EF77AB8EF3EEF7.quest_desc: ["Item Storage Cell 1K is a digital storage component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify type limits, byte capacity, partition policy, overflow destination and safe cell migration; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.10F23B659055346C.quest_desc: ["UFO™ is not responsible if the user ascends to a higher plane."]
	quest.10F556BBB559E13F.quest_desc: ["Infinity Hoe is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.10F556BBB559E13F.quest_subtitle: "Planets would grow from this, if you let them."
	quest.1104AA174B3ADFA6.quest_desc: ["Stirling Generator is a Ender IO power-generation component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify fuel or daylight condition, coolant or byproduct, output rate, buffer, shutdown and comparison with the current energy stage; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1112E4E2CCEB2467.quest_desc: [
		"So now, you should have 5 machines ready to go to process your Ores. "
		""
		"Your factory should be something like this:"
		"Chemical Injection Chamber to Purifying Chamber to Crusher to Enrichment Chamber to Smelter."
	]
	quest.1112E4E2CCEB2467.title: "Ore Factory: Tier 3"
	quest.1118F827D5CCFB65.quest_desc: ["Xpsolidifier / Solid Xp Mould Baby is a specialized mob-farm component in Mob Grinding Utils. A valid farm must be bounded, recoverable and restricted to creatures and drops that are legal after the corresponding first encounter.","Acceptance: verify its capture, spawning, movement, killing or collection role, bounded operating area, overflow response and restricted-target policy; run a controlled batch, record spawn rate, kill rate, power or consumables, collection capacity and shutdown behaviour, then close boss, unique-drop, reward, trade, EMC, Woot and neural-simulation bypasses."]
	quest.113E1D3C37C63088.quest_desc: ["Obtained by putting a Gold Sheet in a Rolling Mill."]
	quest.113E1D3C37C63088.quest_subtitle: "Crafting component."
	quest.114A296C740C26F8.quest_desc: ["This is the&6 normal progression&r of the shelves to reach &llevel 50&r. There is not much to describe. Just follow the quests, choosing whichever is easiest, starting with &chellshelves&r or &bseashelves.&r You do not need to use both together."]
	quest.1162544BA1B2B0F3.quest_desc: ["An upgrade to the &aBasic Chemical tank&r."]
	quest.11832E837D9EBCDA.quest_desc: [
		"You can’t breathe in space! Use &bOxygen&r &bloader&r for your &asuit,&r and &6Tanks.&r"
		""
		""
		"Place &9water&r in the left slot which will turn it into &boxygen&r which is collected via a &6gas&r &6tank&r or &bsuit&r in the right slot."
	]
	quest.11832E837D9EBCDA.title: "Loading oxygen"
	quest.118714D6A53388D1.quest_subtitle: "Even poseidon himself fears whoever holds this trident."
	quest.1188D57C76DBD215.quest_desc: [
		"Potentiometers allow a percentage of the input voltage to pass to the output side. Unlike in real life, they do not waste power."
		""
		"For example, if your base is wired at 3 kV but your lights only require 150 V, you can set a potentiometer for the lights at 5%. This way, they don’t consume several kW for no benefit."
	]
	quest.119CB7DC2A3AD8B6.quest_desc: ["Drop &5Quantum Foam&r in &2Overworld&r at y coordinate above &c1000.&r"]
	quest.119CB7DC2A3AD8B6.quest_subtitle: "Heaven"
	quest.11B42EB302FA9DDF.quest_desc: ["Neutron Ingot is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.11B642D71326CB26.quest_desc: ["Sludge Bucket is a Industrial Foregoing production component. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify its exact work area, input contract, power or fluid demand, output routing and safe shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.11C065375DF7AC3E.quest_desc: [
		"To create an Arcane Crystal Obelisk, place down an Arcane Polished Darkstone block, then place two Arcane Crystal Blocks on top of it."
		""
		"Right-click with Mundabitur Dust and you'll create the obelisk."
		""
		"When placed on a Arcane Chiseled Polished Darkstone block on the Hephaestus Forge structure, it will slowly generate Aureal over time."
	]
	quest.11D8E015814D44F8.quest_desc: ["Goes on top of the vat and takes different attachments. Requires rotational power."]
	quest.11E16D072634AAF5.quest_desc: ["Ender Crafter / Ender Alternator is a specialized powered crafting system in Extended Crafting. Its difficulty must come from integrated infrastructure, previous-tier mastery and meaningful material convergence rather than arbitrary manual repetition.","Acceptance: verify power supply, recipe isolation, paired-block topology, cycle rate, input buffer and clean shutdown under insufficient energy; complete one representative recipe with documented inputs, reusable tools and output ownership, then prove that smaller tables, alternate recipes, rewards, EMC, loot or automation aliases cannot bypass the declared tier."]
	quest.11E16D072634AAF5.title: "Ender Crafter / Ender Alternator — Convergence Acceptance"
	quest.120152510AD4B59A.quest_desc: ["While you might think your builder needs glasses sometimes, these goggles won’t help them. The Builders googles are for you. When you put them on your head or in a curio head slot they allow you to preview your buildings at level 5 which is helpful when fitting one building next to another."]
	quest.120152510AD4B59A.quest_subtitle: "It’s A Samsquanch!"
	quest.120B72E8FF699F50.quest_subtitle: "Does not burn!"
	quest.1210C5B720AE249F.quest_subtitle: "Just crush some dirt i guess."
	quest.12282CBB658F1132.quest_desc: ["&6Charms&r give you &dpotion effects&r just by sitting in your inventory. &nNo need to wear them&r just carry and enjoy. Great for stacking niche bonuses or getting utility effects without sacrificing armor slots. You can &lRight-Click&r to turn them on or off."]
	quest.122ADB52566ED255.quest_desc: ["Harvester Pylon is a cross-mod crop or integration requirement. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify the original encounter or machine path, the declared stage and whether agriculture is allowed only after first legitimate acquisition; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.122EDEC12C9A05D2.quest_desc: ["Security Upgrade is a machine or equipment upgrade in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify compatible host, stack limit, additional pressure or air demand, exact capability gain and safe removal; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.123995A28774EFE0.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.124958C6D93E97CC.quest_desc: ["Screen Link is a monitoring and display component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify module source, displayed value, refresh cost, range, stale-data indication and diagnostic usefulness; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.124D0AB2864B4EE8.quest_desc: ["Has 18 filter slots and works 2x faster."]
	quest.128AF83728356D60.quest_desc: ["A mod tha allows you to fly to other planets and make space stations!!!!"]
	quest.128AF83728356D60.title: "Welcome to Stellaris"
	quest.128C850EFE438E33.quest_desc: ["Compressed Crafting Table is a crafting-infrastructure tier in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify previous-table ancestry, matrix size, automation interface, recipe authority and prevention of lower-table substitutes; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.12A43F82FC67A289.quest_desc: ["To store your items, you'll need to create disks that are stored in a &aDisk Drive&r. You can attach this to your network by placing it beside your Controller, or by using pipes. \\\\n \\\\n These have 8 slots for Storage Drives."]
	quest.12A43F82FC67A289.quest_subtitle: "Floppy time!"
	quest.12A43F82FC67A289.title: "Creating Virtual Storage"
	quest.12AA4397C05B59F8.quest_desc: ["Void Vial is a specialized Ender IO component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its alloy, capacitor, side, conduit or inventory contract and a safe blocked or disconnected state; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.12BC85DE4BD4D22D.quest_desc: [
		"This bizarre oven doesn’t bake cookies it brews chaos. Essential for crafting little gingerbread  people that do far more than rot your teeth."
		""
		"&6Gingerbread Men spawned from a Confection Oven are hostile towards any mob, even attacking Gingerbread Men that aren't of the same color - their attack patterns are also more aggressive, as they will not flee after hitting a mob. In addition to this, they will grab any item off the ground, immediately seeking out a Gingerbarrel to deposit their loot if one is within range. Once the Confection Oven that spawned them heats back up after a 15-second cooldown, they will immediately die&f."
	]
	quest.12D271359D48210E.quest_desc: ["Fusion Fuel Bucket is a fusion-reactor ignition or structure component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify D-T fuel production, laser charge, ignition sequence, injection rate, passive and active output, coolant loop and restart after flameout; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.12D271359D48210E.title: "Fusion Fuel Bucket — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.12E132BD1A31FB8D.quest_desc: ["You've &aawakened it&r, now &cdestroy it&r."]
	quest.12EA6EFDCFB18A5C.quest_desc: ["A conductive compound used to craft energy related components. Essential for progressing through Powah’s tech tree."]
	quest.12EA6EFDCFB18A5C.title: "&2The Dielectric Paste"
	quest.12F3B542158E90ED.quest_desc: ["Summoned when the &dunderzealots&r grab a &cVesper&r and &aperform the ritual&r."]
	quest.12F3B542158E90ED.quest_subtitle: "Defeat the forsaken boss"
	quest.12F4980CB3BFCE0D.quest_desc: ["&dEnchanting clues&r is just more info on what you enchant. If you get &l+4&r you can usually see everything you'll get."]
	quest.130E8FC7479E4271.quest_desc: [
		"The Shepherd’s Hut is where the Shepherd will breed and butcher sheep for food and wool. You will have to capture and bring in two sheep to the Shepherd’s Hut, as the Shepherd will not catch and bring in any sheep."
		""
		"The Shepherd will only keep two sheep alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten sheep in their holding pens."
	]
	quest.130FA1CC4CB1E05F.quest_desc: ["Energy Cable Starter is a Starter energy distribution cable in the Powah energy chain. Its tier is meaningful only when the upstream energizing materials and the downstream machine or network can operate at the same sustained rate.","Acceptance: verify throughput, connection topology and bottleneck isolation; run a representative load without manual inventory correction, record input/output rate and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this tier early."]
	quest.131904442C9523F4.quest_desc: [
		"Training a Data Model can be done in one of two ways, with a Deep Learner or with a Simulation Chamber. "
		""
		"The deep learner allows you to store a few data models within, and kills you receive will begin to train the model. "
		""
		"All models start out in the Faulty state, and must be trained up to Basic in the deep learner."
	]
	quest.13297FADD13D3A84.quest_desc: ["Tank is a specialized mob-farm component in Mob Grinding Utils. A valid farm must be bounded, recoverable and restricted to creatures and drops that are legal after the corresponding first encounter.","Acceptance: verify its capture, spawning, movement, killing or collection role, bounded operating area, overflow response and restricted-target policy; run a controlled batch, record spawn rate, kill rate, power or consumables, collection capacity and shutdown behaviour, then close boss, unique-drop, reward, trade, EMC, Woot and neural-simulation bypasses."]
	quest.132AF80A62FFF98D.quest_desc: [
		"Cliches aside, the tavern should be a high priority building in the early game for several reasons. A tavern can house four colonists. Exactly the number that spawned when you created your village. "
		""
		"After completing the tavern, visitors will stop by to hang out in hopes of being recruited into your colony. You can recruit these visitors by giving them the items they request. "
		""
		"You may want to check out their stats before recruiting a visitor because nobody wants to pay too much for a rubbish colonist."
		""
		"&o&8PRO TIP: You can tell a lot about a potential recruit by looking at their boots. Fancy boots, better stats.&r&r"
	]
	quest.132AF80A62FFF98D.title: "You All Meet In a Tavern..."
	quest.132DF9ECEFFB3B71.quest_desc: ["Module Expansion Card is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.132F18F4FDF51813.quest_desc: [
		"&6Multiblock structure&r capable of &4tick-accelerating&r everything enclosed by it."
		"Minimum size of &23x3x3&r. No maximum size."
		"To build the structure, edges and corners are built using &dSakuradite Casings&r. Walls and faces are filled with any &5Sakuradite block&r. "
		"Requires energy input hatch to power the structure."
		"To form the multiblook must click with &eBabylon Key&r."
	]
	quest.132F18F4FDF51813.quest_subtitle: "Warning: May cause severe lag if not used carefully"
	quest.133CCF87F542BEB6.quest_desc: ["Antenna / Antenna Base / Antenna Dish is a cross-mod RFTools integration component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, data or inventory ownership, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1357102EC118E363.quest_subtitle: "Loki?"
	quest.1359A69F4F6B6CF1.quest_desc: ["Data Entangler is a cross-mod AE2 integration component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, component data and the absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.135E27A19B935CD7.quest_desc: ["Package Frogport is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.135FBE79D4415F15.quest_desc: ["Nuke is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.135FBE79D4415F15.quest_subtitle: "WHY CAN'T I BLOW THIS UP?!?"
	quest.137E376E22A64C8D.quest_desc: ["Belt Of Levitation is a specialized Ars Nouveau component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify its Source, spell, ritual, entity or automation contract and a safe invalid-input or interrupted state; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.138404C3E1120F74.quest_desc: ["A tesseract is the four-dimensional (4D) equivalent of a cube, a \"hypercube\" or \"8-cell,\" visualized as a cube within a cube where vertices connect, representing an extension of 3D space into a fourth spatial dimension, containing eight cubical cells, 24 square faces, 32 edges, and 16 vertices."]
	quest.138404C3E1120F74.quest_subtitle: "Fun fact"
	quest.138B96B20044ED12.quest_desc: ["A coil of constantan wire known for its stable electrical resistance. It’s used in crafting electronic components and machinery that require precise power control."]
	quest.13931F57613DCC60.quest_desc: ["Densest Neutron Collector is a neutronium production component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify collector count, passive production rate, chunk availability, buffer capacity and fair scaling without manual waiting; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.13B436AF3BD57E53.quest_subtitle: "Tip: UFO armor to fight Ignis "
	quest.13B495F64F5C9D48.quest_desc: ["A refined fuel made by heating coal without oxygen. It burns hotter and longer than regular coal, making it ideal for powering furnaces, engines, and heavy industrial machinery."]
	quest.13C766B7286C0293.quest_desc: ["Both used to make the &4Blade of the arcane eclipse&f."]
	quest.13C766B7286C0293.title: "Prism"
	quest.13CAA74DEE1F21A3.quest_desc: ["A reinforced container designed to safely hold and process volatile or high-temperature substances. Its heat-resistant structure makes it ideal for chemical reactions, refining, and industrial production."]
	quest.13CCF5BDF2BD03CE.quest_desc: ["Item Wyvern Shield Recovery is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.13D5B942165B8A98.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Pink is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.13E0633592FE5DF0.quest_desc: ["Blow up a rainbow furnace to obtain a rainbow coal"]
	quest.13EDFA9124D60D53.quest_desc: ["Conduit is a multi-service conduit or routing component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify service type, insert-extract direction, filter exactness, channel priority, redstone mode and loop prevention; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
