	quest.14566943B4AE74A9.quest_desc: ["Unlocks travel to &cMars.&r Requires&6 Desh&r to be built."]
	quest.145C8235BCCB9BA8.quest_desc: [
		"No, not that kind."
		""
		"&cAfrit Demons&r are Demons of &cFire&r. They are more advanced Demons, which some are friends and some are....not."
		""
		"If we want to collect all of the Chalks, we'll need to summon a not-so friendly Ifrit. And kill it."
		""
		"This specific Ritual will need a live sacrifice. Once you've placed all of the items needed and the Book of Binding into the Golden Sacrificial Bowl, the Ritual will not start until you sacrifice the living creature nearby it. In this instance, we'll be sacrificing a cow. Sorry again, Betsy."
	]
	quest.145C8235BCCB9BA8.title: "&cHot Demons&r"
	quest.1472CCB84AB8C6AC.quest_desc: ["Enchantment Applicator is a experience or enchantment processor. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify XP ownership, fluid conversion, enchantment extraction, invalid-input quarantine and duplication prevention; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.147FC2959F9FC5F5.quest_desc: ["Railway Casing is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1482F2D45E8F761D.quest_desc: ["Fission Reactor Casing / Reactor Glass is a fission-reactor, radiation or nuclear-fuel component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify reactor structure, fissile fuel rate, coolant and heated output, burn limit, waste route, radiation containment and emergency SCRAM; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
