	quest.14857DBF1DCBF100.quest_desc: ["Cresting the waves like a shadow of the past, this cursed vessel is crewed by skeletons that seem impossible to keep down. Every deck hides danger, every hold whispers of lost treasure and every strike you land may be fleeting. Only the bold (or the foolhardy) dare to face its relentless undead crew."]
	quest.14857DBF1DCBF100.quest_subtitle: "Find an Undead Pirate Ship"
	quest.148DE7A379D310AE.quest_subtitle: "the hard part"
	quest.14B3542ECB59869C.quest_desc: ["Loot Fabricator is a prediction-to-loot fabricator. Neural simulation is repeat-production infrastructure, not a substitute for discovering, fighting and understanding the represented creature for the first time.","Acceptance: verify selected output recipe, prediction ownership, output ratios, unique-drop exclusion and prevention of cross-model recipe contamination; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy, consumables, time and output, and prove that random rewards, model swapping, trades, EMC, Woot, spawners or loot-table shortcuts cannot produce restricted drops early."]
	quest.14D772808D1BEAE2.quest_desc: [
		"The &9Induction Matrix&r allows you to customize how much power you can store and transfer by adding &aCells&r and &eProviders&r inside of the multiblock structure."
		""
		"&aInduction Cells&r increase the total amount of power that can be stored."
		""
		"&eInduction Providers&r increase the total transfer speed both in and out of the &9Matrix&r."
		""
		"You can customize how many you want of each &b&oinside&r of the multiblock, but you will need &b&oat least&r one of each."
		""
		"These also have higher tiers to increase your overall storage and transfer capacity."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/item/induction_inside.png width:200 height:100 align:1}"
	]
	quest.14D772808D1BEAE2.title: "Customizing Power Limits"
	quest.14DE16A40532206D.quest_desc: ["Has 27 more filter slots and is 5x faster than the regular Exporter. Also has the Stack Upgrade integrated."]
	quest.14F6CF9A5F807A51.quest_desc: ["Right click on a tank of lubrication to fill the can. Applying this to engines grant a 30% fuel saving."]
	quest.15057E6D3D02CEA5.quest_desc: ["Familiar Bookwyrm is a summoning, familiar or magical automation component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify summoning prerequisite, entity ownership, working area, valid targets, output policy and unique-drop exclusion; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.155AD7F62D76E812.quest_desc: ["Wyvern Crafting Injector is a fusion-crafting infrastructure component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify injector tier, symmetric placement, recipe energy, ingredient retention and restart after interrupted charging; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.156575F76CAB51A0.quest_desc: ["Replicator is a late matter or quantum-production component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify energy scale, data or matter input, previous circuit tier, cross-mod gate, output rate and prohibition of early replication; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.156E41193C265303.quest_desc: ["Neutron is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.158D1029B64302D6.quest_desc: [
		"Right Click the replicator with the resource you would like to produce."
		""
		"You need a valid storage besides it to work."
	]
	quest.158D1029B64302D6.quest_subtitle: "Can't be easier than that"
	quest.158D1029B64302D6.title: "Replication"
	quest.15A87099A99C029E.quest_desc: ["Another rocket that allows you to reach more planets, made from materials from &eJupiter&r."]
	quest.15B077DEA396BECF.quest_desc: [
		"The recipe of the Altar has been changed so YOU won't be able to craft it in the first day and get all seeds."
		""
		"Check Mystical questline btw"
		""
		"[ { \"text\": \"Click me!\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"6D750A38944E9B68\" } }, \"\" ]"
	]
	quest.15B51FB56A64C303.quest_desc: [
		"Many new buildings and upgrades are locked behind university research so it is worth getting a university built as soon as possible. Researcher will research various upgrades to your colony, and each level unlocks an additional researcher for a total of 5 researchers. Each Researcher can start their own research, but more Researchers does not lower the amount of time each individual research takes."
		""
		"Note: Research time is real-world time spent in-game. However, after level 3, Researchers will sometimes use offline time to work on researches."
	]
	quest.15D764CAF047EA7A.quest_desc: ["Tertium Helmet / Tertium Chestplate / Tertium Leggings / System is a linked agriculture system. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify component ratios, shared catalysts, legal crop tiers, output ownership and unattended completion without duplicating seeds or essences; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.15ECBC8E174FA39B.quest_desc: ["Allows you to access your storage wirelessly."]
	quest.15ECBC8E174FA39B.title: "Wireless Grid"
	quest.15F03A5E7E14C022.quest_desc: ["The stonemason is another key profession in the colony. They craft items commonly required by the builder. The stonemason will craft 3x3 recipes made entirely out of cobblestone, stone, andesite, diorite, granite, quartz, purpur, nether bricks, prismarine, sandstones, blackstone, and basalt. They can also craft end stone from cobblestone and an ender pearl after you complete the research."]
	quest.15F03A5E7E14C022.quest_subtitle: "Build a Stonemason's Hut"
	quest.15F7524D7B3E023C.quest_desc: ["Storage Bus is a network input or output endpoint in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify filter exactness, direction, acceleration, destination capacity and prevention of routing loops; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.1610C8F55F59E82F.quest_desc: [
		"The Quartz Fiber."
		""
		"A part designed to share energy between two ME Networks without sharing anything else, also used to craft Fluix ME Glass Cablr."
	]
	quest.162CE44400A63575.quest_desc: ["The Infuser combines an item stream with a stored infusion type; changing recipes without clearing or separating infusion can contaminate the next batch.","Acceptance: dedicate or positively lock infusion inputs, expose remaining infusion, process sixteen mixed components, and recover safely from a full output without dumping valuable material."]
	quest.162CE44400A63575.quest_subtitle: "The Starting Machine"
	quest.162DD68C3B91FC5E.quest_desc: ["Tin Cable / Copper Cable is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.163BCEEEE08F3898.quest_desc: ["Polarizer is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.164604C02613AA58.quest_desc: [
		"You can change the tool mode and by default your keybinds will look like this:"
		""
		"Auto-Smelt Toggle [K]"
		""
		"Change Tool (Next) [G]"
		""
		"Change Tool (Previous) [H]"
		""
		"Change Tool Mode [C]"
	]
	quest.164604C02613AA58.quest_subtitle: "The best Multitool in this modpack."
	quest.164F4710E109F7F2.quest_desc: ["Ingots Bronze is a cross-mod industrial integration component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material identity, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1651E315517369BD.title: "&fFlux Configurator"
	quest.16665DE6F0921C26.quest_desc: ["A powerful kinetic generator that converts heat into rotational energy. By harnessing temperature differences, it provides a steady power source for your machines and automation systems."]
	quest.166971866A9234C7.quest_desc: ["Made from a &8Metallurgic Infuser&r this item is used in a few crafting recipes."]
	quest.167E1474644C9908.quest_desc: ["Hold it in your &loffhand&r with any of the materials to &crevert&r the change done to the spawner."]
	quest.168187D7A0036A6B.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Disenchantment is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.168ECD28A336F077.quest_desc: ["If you ever thought that there can't be anything worse than a dragon, then you are surely mistaken."]
	quest.1694601100476AF7.quest_desc: ["&bEggs&r are &cbroken&r when &ejumped on&r, and if you place &bice&r or &6amber&r beneath them they will &anot grow up&r."]
	quest.1695706A70AA37E6.quest_desc: ["Mob Duplicator is a mob-processing machine. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify spawn ownership, essence or fluid cost, blacklist policy and unique-drop exclusion; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.16A6C47E35F3B9D0.quest_desc: ["Isotopic Centrifuge is a advanced chemical-processing component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify chemical phase, tank and side configuration, catalyst or secondary input, output separation, radioactive handling and clean purge; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.16A6C47E35F3B9D0.quest_subtitle: "You did it!"
	quest.16A6C47E35F3B9D0.title: "Isotopic Centrifuge — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.16A97D04ED52478A.quest_desc: ["An &6expensive chest&r with a lot of &astorage.&r"]
	quest.16AAEB122CDC1A46.quest_desc: ["Bronze Mixer is a early steam-machine component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify steam supply, input and output separation, recipe duration, exhaust or byproducts and unattended stack processing; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.16C065EA59F9F415.quest_desc: ["Terminal / Crafting Terminal is a network access and operator interface in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify access scope, crafting visibility, permission boundary, search behaviour and disconnected-state clarity; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.16E5B09AA7E6A487.quest_desc: ["Conveyor is a machine-structure or electromechanical component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify previous-tier ancestry, material forms, motor or pump tier, reusable molds and continuous component stocking; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.16EE370FE0789F32.quest_subtitle: "“Even nothing has a heart.”"
	quest.16F081A90848DBB1.quest_subtitle: "You will need A LOT of these trust me."
	quest.171151FF83288178.quest_desc: ["After completing the &eprimordial cave tablet&r puzzle in a &aspelunking table&r three times, you will be given an &6cave codex&r which you can &lRight-Click&r to learn more about this cave and have it added to your &6Cave Compendium&r. Or you can craft a &bmap&r to this cave with the codex."]
	quest.1716ED717CDD90DC.quest_desc: ["Battlemage Robes is a magical equipment tier in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify mana or Source benefit, thread slots, defensive statistics, mobility interaction and repair path; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.172D2A634E849562.quest_desc: [
		"With our ability to harvest &cIesnium&r, we can call upon the Demons to do our bidding in the mines... I mean.... help us gather ores. Definitely not exploiting Demons or anything."
		""
		"For this, we'll need to create a &dDimensional Mineshaft&r to access the Demon Mining World. You'll also need a Mining Demon confined to a lamp, which you'll place inside of the Mineshaft for it to work. While any tier will complete this quest, higher tiers work faster and have a higher chance at mining Iesnium for you."
		""
		"The Mineshafts do not auto-export on their own. You will need to extract the items out using either Hoppers, Transporting Demons, or some other method like Item Pipes. It will void any items over its storage limit."
	]
	quest.172D2A634E849562.title: "&cDemon Mining&r"
	quest.1758D38A1FA881C2.quest_desc: ["Capacitor Basic is a Basic tier capacitor in the Powah energy chain. Its tier is meaningful only when the upstream energizing materials and the downstream machine or network can operate at the same sustained rate.","Acceptance: verify component tier integrity and energizing inputs; run a representative load without manual inventory correction, record input/output rate and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this tier early."]
	quest.176524D0E4475298.quest_desc: ["Distillery is a single-block industrial processing machine in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify recipe lock, input and output buffers, fluid or tool requirements, power tier, byproducts and full-output shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.17709C4D6222244B.quest_desc: ["Connects forge energy compatible blocks with wires to transfer energy, provides light when reciving power."]
	quest.177C0E37A35A14F4.quest_desc: ["Clockwork Bearing is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.17953D4234D44C01.quest_desc: [
		"Place the drilling machine on the ore vein chunk you found and place a drill on it."
		""
		"The ore/fluid will come out in the output of the multiblock."
		""
		"Fluid can be extracted in the copper pipe."
		""
		"The machine requires RPM to work."
	]
	quest.1796CD7D8F3612C1.quest_desc: ["Item Transporter Type is a Industrial Foregoing production component. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify its exact work area, input contract, power or fluid demand, output routing and safe shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.17CA9D80D8EC3EF7.quest_desc: ["Cataclysm Encounter Checkpoint 3EF7 is a boss-encounter planning checkpoint in Cataclysm. Progress must come from discovering the correct structure, preparing for its mechanics and winning the legitimate encounter rather than receiving boss progress from a reward table or simulated drop source.","Acceptance: verify documented structure route, arena preparation, equipment reserve, escape and recovery plan, first-victory evidence and post-victory automation limits; document entry, arena safety, required equipment, failure recovery and first-victory evidence, then prove that Woot, neural simulation, spawners, trades, EMC, loot aliases and quest rewards cannot grant unique or capability-changing drops early."]
	quest.17D6CF535F3B71F5.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crafted&r from different &bingredients&r found throughout these &ecaves&r, you will use this to craft the &bbest&r this cave has to offer."
		"&o(Beside the &cnuke&r)&r"
	]
	quest.180206DDBD6B2D59.quest_desc: [
		"The Pattern Encoding Terminal is similar to a regular terminal, with all the same settings and sections, but with an added pattern encoding interface. It looks similar to a crafting terminal's UI but this crafting grid doesn't actually perform crafts."
		""
		"You should have one of these in addition to a crafting terminal."
	]
	quest.182525B7EDF23BB5.quest_desc: ["Ancient Debris is a cross-mod convergence component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's completed infrastructure, authoritative output, data or container state and absence of a cheaper substitute; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.18289605711FE891.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Ender is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.1837076B0EA3C11A.quest_desc: ["Belt Connector is a item-logistics component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify direction, filter, distribution mode, belt speed, destination capacity, overflow and prevention of recirculation loops; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.184528671B22DDDE.quest_desc: ["Qio Drive Black Hole is a QIO digital-storage or logistics component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify frequency ownership, item and type capacity, importer or exporter filters, remote access, overflow and recovery after frequency loss; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.186593EBCE3FE8D8.quest_desc: ["&a+ 2 Spawn Range&r - can spawn mobs farther away from the spawner."]
	quest.186731580B14F9D2.quest_desc: [
		"The &9Fluid Port&r is used &o&bto insert&r vapors like &3Steam&r, or &o&bextract&r the product of the turbine, like &1Water&r if inputing &7steam.&r Because of this, you'll need &ntwo&r for your &2Turbine&r."
		""
		"The &cPower Tap&r extracts power, and is &nrequired&r to complete the multiblock."
	]
	quest.186731580B14F9D2.title: "Turbine Ports"
	quest.186F257352F2E844.quest_desc: ["Pressurizer / Titanium Machine Casing Pipe / Solid Titanium Machine Casing is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.186F257352F2E844.title: "Pressurizer / Titanium Machine Casing Pipe / Solid Titanium Machine Casing — Factory Acceptance"
	quest.187011CD52066727.quest_desc: [
		"Up to 27 parallel jobs in standard mode"
		"9 parallel jobs while Safe Mode is enabled"
		"Universal multiblock recipe support"
		"AE2 autocrafting integration through the Quantum Pattern Hatch"
		"Direct network pull for ingredients and direct network push for outputs"
		""
		"Pattern Hatch"
		"The Quantum Pattern Hatch stores 72 encoded patterns"
		"It exposes the controller to AE2 as a crafting machine"
		"Patterns reserve free threads instead of forcing single job execution"
		""
		"Factory Chain"
		"Quantum Slicer makes the printed parts"
		"Quantum Processor Assembler turns them into final processors"
		"QMF covers large DMA style matter recipes and other heavy conversions"
	]
	quest.187A3F5B41D1C923.quest_desc: ["Chemical Dissolution Chamber is a advanced chemical-processing component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify chemical phase, tank and side configuration, catalyst or secondary input, output separation, radioactive handling and clean purge; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.187A3F5B41D1C923.title: "Chemical Dissolution Chamber — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.189018F641FBB44E.quest_desc: ["An upgraded crafter that holds more patterns and has an increased crafting speed."]
	quest.189018F641FBB44E.title: "&bDiamond Crafter&r"
	quest.189C3AF8899FBFFE.quest_desc: ["Has 45 more filter slots and is 6.5x faster than the regular Importer. Also has the Stack Upgrade integrated."]
	quest.18A75E664BAC6425.quest_desc: ["Power is output via the three copper looking dots on the top of the multiblock, and the machine can be turned off by applying a redstone signal to the red dot on the front of the machine face. It does not have a GUI, so all input/output must be triggered manually."]
	quest.18A75E664BAC6425.title: "Diesel Generator"
	quest.18BCBC9235B04BE8.quest_subtitle: "“To live forever… at what cost?”"
	quest.18D88932916C7A98.quest_desc: ["Electrolysis creates two gases from one fluid; allowing either gas tank to fill can stop production even when the other gas is urgently needed.","Acceptance: buffer both gases, configure dumping only for a documented surplus, preserve emergency oxygen, and demonstrate continuous operation through one complete upstream batch."]
	quest.18D88932916C7A98.quest_subtitle: "Time to Break It Down"
	quest.18D88932916C7A98.title: "Electrolytic Separator — Gas Balance"
	quest.18DA07CE1ACC69EF.quest_desc: ["Small Adv Pattern Provider / Small Adv Pattern Provider Part / Adv Pattern Provider Upgrade is a cross-mod AE2 integration component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, component data and the absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.18EB86F91CBBCCC6.quest_subtitle: "You can use each eye to find the respective boss dungeon. Or just use the structure compass"
	quest.18FBAD6FAA74B08D.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is the Fluid Package Filler?&r"
		""
		"The &eFluid Package Filler&r is a machine used to create &6Volume Packages&r filled with &bfluids&r."
		""
		"These fluid packages can then be used in &ePackagedAuto&r workflows just like item-based packages."
		""
		"The Fluid Package Filler &crequires power&r to operate."
		""
		"&eHow It Works&r"
		""
		"• Place the Fluid Package Filler next to a &bfluid container&r"
		"• Insert a &etemplate fluid container&r into the machine"
		""
		"• Configure how much fluid the &6Volume Package&r should contain"
		""
		"&eCreating Fluid Packages&r"
		""
		"• Apply a &credstone signal&r to the machine"
		"• The configured amount of fluid is packaged"
		"• The created Volume Package is &eejected&r into adjacent inventories"
		""
		"&eImportant Notes&r"
		""
		"• The machine does &cNOT&r run automatically"
		"• A redstone signal is &erequired&r"
		"• Output is always ejected to adjacent inventories"
		""
		"&eWhy Use the Fluid Package Filler?&r"
		""
		"• Convert fluids into portable packages"
		"• Integrate fluids into PackagedAuto systems"
		"• Enable precise fluid amounts"
		"• Useful for advanced processing chains"
	]
	quest.18FBAD6FAA74B08D.title: "&eFluid Package Filler&r"
	quest.18FCB1DAD9572A00.quest_desc: ["Mob Detector is a Industrial Foregoing production component. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify its exact work area, input contract, power or fluid demand, output routing and safe shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.191A2F855396BDCD.quest_desc: ["Automatically refills gadgets and armor that use fuel."]
	quest.195729280394ABFB.quest_desc: [
		"The Osmium Compressor is used to create Refined Obsidian Ingots from Refined Obsidian Dust and Glowstone Ingots from Glowstone Dust."
		""
		"It fuses liquid Osmium (melted down Osmium Ingots placed in the machine's bottom slot) with the originating materials to create their corresponding ingots."
	]
	quest.195F63EAD8194971.quest_desc: ["&6Rugged legwear&r from &aprimitive times&r. As strong as &6leather.&r"]
	quest.196E55B64667AE35.quest_desc: ["Place at the bottom of the Beehive and place inside it the item required for the respective bee start \"pollinating\" and producing combs."]
	quest.196FD91EC6A7B73A.quest_desc: ["Same as the other rock&cets,&r except it is crafted with &cCalorite,&r lets you travel to more planets,"]
	quest.19754AE8C11A6317.quest_desc: ["Deployer is a kinetic processing machine in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify required RPM and stress, recipe isolation, input and output buffer, heat or fluid condition, byproducts and full-output shutdown; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.197AB0E07A40512F.quest_desc: ["Water Wheel / Large Water Wheel is a kinetic power source in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify environmental input, generated stress capacity, RPM, startup condition, reserve margin and safe shutdown; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1987DF7742136DC4.quest_desc: ["Distillation Tower / Clean Stainless Steel Machine Casing / Stainless Steel Machine Casing Pipe is a large industrial multiblock component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify structure validity, hatch tiers, parallel recipes, heat or pressure requirement, maintenance access and recovery after interruption; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.19936E26E71B5F68.quest_desc: ["Energy is input through the bottom face and output from the top. "]
	quest.199B092BC9116A0A.quest_desc: ["Sorcerer Boots is a magical equipment tier in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify mana or Source benefit, thread slots, defensive statistics, mobility interaction and repair path; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.199B092BC9116A0A.quest_subtitle: "shoes"
	quest.19A9DA93FF046BD9.quest_desc: ["A sturdy yet lightweight frame used to encase and protect mechanical or electrical components. Its durability and resistance make it perfect for building advanced industrial machinery."]
	quest.19B5CFD1781BE157.quest_desc: [
		"This advanced material is used for crafting strong and durable components."
		" It's made using plant oil and plastic high-tech meets eco-friendly."
	]
	quest.19BAE924E8965920.quest_desc: [
		"Make a &5Obsidian Nest&r and place in the End Dimension use a &dDragon's Breath&r to attract a draconic bee to it and start harvesting draconic dust."
