	quest.1AC3485AB2EA13E5.quest_desc: ["Prudentium Watering Can is a Prudentium watering tool. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify manual learning use, area of effect, automation restrictions and the point at which the task must move to bounded infrastructure; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.1AC6F14C218DD46A.quest_desc: ["Auto Stock Card is a cross-mod AE2 integration component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, component data and the absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.1AD87CB3226ED224.quest_desc: ["Silent"]
