	quest.1B0028B5F47CB5F1.quest_desc: ["Combine &bLiquid Starlight&r, &7White Dwarf Fragment&r, &5nether star&r and &6obsidian matrix&r to obtain the &1Neutron Star Fragment&r."]
	quest.1B04A295850D0F00.quest_desc: ["Track Observer is a railway and train-system component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify track continuity, station ownership, schedule order, signal blocks, loading time, unloaded chunks and recovery from obstruction; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
