	quest.1B2DE63560613385.title: "Magebloom — Arcane Acceptance"
	quest.1B4B29415499CE8E.quest_desc: ["Filter Module is a specialized RFTools ecosystem component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify its module or card configuration, power contract, area or network ownership and a safe invalid or disconnected state; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1B4ED65C614B102F.quest_desc: ["Cataclysm Encounter Checkpoint 102F is a boss-encounter planning checkpoint in Cataclysm. Progress must come from discovering the correct structure, preparing for its mechanics and winning the legitimate encounter rather than receiving boss progress from a reward table or simulated drop source.","Acceptance: verify documented structure route, arena preparation, equipment reserve, escape and recovery plan, first-victory evidence and post-victory automation limits; document entry, arena safety, required equipment, failure recovery and first-victory evidence, then prove that Woot, neural simulation, spawners, trades, EMC, loot aliases and quest rewards cannot grant unique or capability-changing drops early."]
	quest.1B5177A774FCEF64.quest_desc: [
		"Before we start enlisting the help of our Demon friends, we will need to create the most important item needed for Rituals: &aChalk&r."
		""
		"There are several colors of chalk needed, with higher level Rituals requiring several to activate. To start with, &bWhite Chalk&r is the easiest to get."
		""
		"Start by tossing Otherstone in a furnace, and tossing Otherworld Logs into &dSpiritfire&r. With the items you create, you'll be able to make the Impure White Chalk."
		""
		"To purify any piece of Chalk, simply throw it into &dSpiritfire&r to cleanse it. Using the Purified Chalk on the ground will draw &mdemonic&r pretty symbols on the ground. These are a pain to remove, unless of course, you make yourself the &aChalk Brush&r. Do it, it's worth it."
	]
	quest.1B5177A774FCEF64.title: "Preparing for a Ritual: &eChalk&r"
	quest.1B5B02B717D10175.quest_subtitle: "Summons the Extreme Wither"
	quest.1B60491EDE73447B.quest_desc: [
		"Used to Store Energy in the network"
		""
		"Energy Capacity: 2,000,000 FE"
	]
	quest.1B60491EDE73447B.quest_subtitle: "Tier 1"
	quest.1B60491EDE73447B.title: "&fFlux Storage"
	quest.1B65E8BE91A087DA.quest_desc: ["Chain Conveyor is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1B79F794EDAA810A.quest_desc: [
		"This Block is an Alternative to In-World Bee Breeding, and is entirely optional. The Breeding Chamber Requires the Parent Bee's Breeding items to function. Typically this is Flowers, but there are notable outliers. Check by Clicking \"U\" on a bee in Jei!"
		""
		"Not All bees can be Bred! This is usually reserved for bees whos combs are used for valuable resources."
	]
	quest.1B7A6E394D17A5F9.quest_desc: ["Infinity Helmet is a creative-adjacent armor capability in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify damage immunity or reduction, flight and movement, environmental protection, interaction with combat scaling and replacement after loss; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.1B7A6E394D17A5F9.quest_subtitle: "See beyond reality. No illusion can deceive you now."
	quest.1B82B4629245EC26.quest_desc: ["Reinforced Obsidian Block is a specialized Ender IO component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its alloy, capacitor, side, conduit or inventory contract and a safe blocked or disconnected state; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1B855E9478095343.quest_desc: ["Advanced Magnet is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1B9851CDDC2EC912.quest_desc: ["Blazing Infuser is a specialized RFTools ecosystem component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify its module or card configuration, power contract, area or network ownership and a safe invalid or disconnected state; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1B9DDF8A12434E1F.quest_desc: ["Crafted from &cnetherite,&r an &boxygen can&r, and &dOstrum plates&r, this can hold more &boxygen.&r"]
	quest.1BB571557F74D3A1.quest_desc: ["As you have explored, you may have encountered abandoned colonies. If you like, you can take over an abandoned colony and repair it. This can be a good way to jumpstart your colony. However, if you want the full colony experience, then it’s recommended that you find a good place to settle your colony and start the old fashioned way. Blood, sweat and tears. "]
	quest.1BD956EF7376C51C.quest_desc: ["Found in &9The Other&r dimension in the library, on the &62nd floor&r there will be a &3trial spawner&r with &4evokers&r, when you clear the &3trial spawner&r it will drop 1 smithing template."]
	quest.1BEEB1B3081EA395.quest_subtitle: "Used to maintain any temperature you want"
	quest.1BFFBDE6FB0F5476.title: "Defeat the Netherite Monstrosity"
	quest.1C16AEE8E29FB5A0.quest_desc: [
		"The rallying banner will summon your Guards to you when used. It’s especially useful in raids, as Guards don’t automatically know where to find the raiders. You must shift + right-click the banner on a Guard tower or Barracks Tower to assigns the Guards in that tower to the rallying banner."
		""
		"Note: Your Guards will not follow you outside the colony border. To bring Guards outside the border, set them to Follow you on the second page of their tower GUI."
	]
	quest.1C214DD51C58BE4D.title: "&fFlux Controller"
	quest.1C25114D2AF71C35.quest_desc: ["Implosion Compressor is a single-block industrial processing machine in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify recipe lock, input and output buffers, fluid or tool requirements, power tier, byproducts and full-output shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
