	quest.1C29C4D117761F30.title: "Molecular Assembler — Network Acceptance"
	quest.1C4ABF4518638A82.quest_desc: ["Supremium Apple is a Supremium Mystical Agriculture component. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify its actual production role, legal first acquisition, sustained input and output rates and every renewable-resource bypass it could introduce; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.1C91BD525C91FD73.quest_desc: [
		"This stuff is everywhere."
		""
		"It can be used to give yourself experience, or used to make the Stella Eternal."
	]
	quest.1CA2825FFA775BBE.quest_desc: ["Electrolyzer is a single-block industrial processing machine in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify recipe lock, input and output buffers, fluid or tool requirements, power tier, byproducts and full-output shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1CB243F7E197B883.quest_desc: ["Displays the top level job and its current progress so you can see what a particular Crafting CPU is currently working on."]
	quest.1CBE8399B440A1FD.quest_desc: ["A powerful multi-cylinder engine arranged in a circular pattern for balanced motion and high torque. Its efficient design provides strong, consistent power for advanced industrial machinery."]
	quest.1CC35C01F13AE8EF.quest_desc: [
		"The &ePackage Crafting Machine Proxy&r allows &6Unpackagers&r to send items to &aspecialized package crafting machines&r"
		"&aremotely&r."
		""
		"This means crafting machines do &cNOT&r need to be placed directly next to an Unpackager."
		""
		"&eHow the Crafting Proxy Works&r"
		""
		"• The proxy acts as a &eremote endpoint&r"
		"• Unpackagers send packages to the proxy"
		"• The proxy forwards them to the bound machine"
		""
		"This enables clean layouts and long-distance automation."
		""
		"&eBinding a Crafting Machine&r"
		""
		"• Bind a &eProxy Marker&r to a package crafting machine"
		"• Insert the bound marker into the &eCrafting Proxy&r"
		"• The proxy now knows where to send packages"
		""
		"&eManaging Proxy Markers&r"
		""
		"• &aSneak + Right-click&r with a bound marker to unbind it"
		"• You can copy a bound marker by crafting it"
		"  together with empty markers"
		""
		"&eAdvanced Setup&r"
		""
		"• Use the &ePackaging Settings Cloner&r"
		"  to copy proxy targets"
		"• Paste settings into another proxy"
		"  using an empty Proxy Marker"
		""
		"&eWhy Use the Crafting Proxy?&r"
		""
		"• Keep crafting machines far away from Unpackagers"
		"• Build clean, modular factories"
		"• Reduce cable and pipe clutter"
		"• Ideal for large &ePackagedAuto&r setups"
	]
	quest.1CC35C01F13AE8EF.title: "&bWhat Is the Crafting Proxy?&r"
	quest.1CC4F8570A7A99EB.quest_desc: ["Inferium Essence is a tier or resource essence. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify upgrade and downgrade direction, infusion-crystal durability, batch ratios and prevention of recursive conversion or EMC loops; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.1CC910880728D896.quest_desc: ["Fusion Reactor / Highly Advanced Machine Hull / Fusion Chamber is a large industrial multiblock component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify structure validity, hatch tiers, parallel recipes, heat or pressure requirement, maintenance access and recovery after interruption; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1CC910880728D896.quest_subtitle: "Can I eat it?"
	quest.1CCA31D9352C60E6.quest_desc: ["Clustered around a towering central “grandmother” mushroom, these villages appear quaint from afar. Yet the villagers within are far more aggressive than their old-world counterparts, hiding a cunning fierceness beneath their colorful caps. Approach with caution as this village may welcome the unwary only to spring its traps."]
	quest.1CCA31D9352C60E6.quest_subtitle: "Find a mushroom village"
	quest.1CDBE274A0E9E725.quest_desc: ["The simplest option. Place it next to a furnace burning coal or on top of a bucket of lava, and it will start generating a small amount of RF. It's enough to power your first two machines."]
	quest.1CF0D347EBEB72CB.quest_desc: ["Annihilation Plane is a network input or output endpoint in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify filter exactness, direction, acceleration, destination capacity and prevention of routing loops; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.1CF8263756EE8F2A.quest_desc: ["Cognizant Dust is a Untiered Mystical Agriculture component. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify its actual production role, legal first acquisition, sustained input and output rates and every renewable-resource bypass it could introduce; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.1D00D782B8F0B6D6.quest_desc: ["Mechanical Mixer is a kinetic processing machine in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify required RPM and stress, recipe isolation, input and output buffer, heat or fluid condition, byproducts and full-output shutdown; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1D06097B6206BA60.quest_desc: ["Some bookshelves have a more &cpowerful&r &bInfused&r version, these are bookshelves that have been &denchanted&r with a specific &eInfuse&r &denchant&r at a specific stat level."]
	quest.1D06097B6206BA60.title: "Infusion"
	quest.1D0939A8B41C72BF.quest_desc: [
		"Stores up to 200,000 AE."
		""
		"They do not accept power directly, but are used to add additional power storage to an already existing ME Network."
	]
	quest.1D10D63725698BED.quest_desc: [
		"&0Dark matter pedestals&r are used to activate the &cextra ability&r withen &6trinkets &o(usally rings&r)&r added with &dProjectE&r, "
		""
		"&lRight-Click&r with the &aitem&r you want to put on the &0pedestal,&r &lRight-Click&r again to &aactivate&r or &bdeactivate&r it, and &lLeft-Click&r to &cremove the item&r."
		""
		"You can view what the &aitem&r does by &ehovering over it&r with your &amouse&r and &bblue text&r should appear."
	]
	quest.1D1174EBE379B36D.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Reactor is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.1D197B1919452187.quest_desc: ["A compact Redstone Link that adds wireless redstone to buttons, levers, and linked levers."]
	quest.1D22136BD093C348.quest_desc: ["Book Of Binding Foliot / Book Of Binding Bound Foliot is a ritual knowledge or spirit-binding document in Occultism. Its value comes from a correct ritual, a bounded spirit contract or a controlled dimensional system rather than from merely possessing the item.","Acceptance: verify tier and spirit type, binding ingredients, data-bearing state, ownership, replacement after loss and prevention of pre-bound reward copies; perform a representative ritual, spirit task or storage cycle, record ingredients, duration, capacity and recovery, and close quest-reward, trade, loot, EMC, miner, possession and alternate-ritual shortcuts."]
	quest.1D22136BD093C348.quest_subtitle: "Your first companion"
	quest.1D22136BD093C348.title: "Book Of Binding Foliot / Book Of Binding Bound Foliot — Ritual Acceptance"
	quest.1D2ED78CD7DEA8E2.quest_desc: ["Wyvern Hoe / Wyvern Pickaxe / Wyvern Shovel / Wyvern Sword is a modular tool, weapon or portable energy item in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify module capacity, charged performance, area effect, attack or mining throughput, repair path and energy supply; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1D2ED78CD7DEA8E2.title: "Wyvern Hoe / Wyvern Pickaxe / Wyvern Shovel / Wyvern Sword — High-Energy Acceptance"
	quest.1D45085F4D187E92.quest_desc: ["Datura Seeds / Dictionary Of Spirits is a specialized Occultism ritual or spirit component in Occultism. Its value comes from a correct ritual, a bounded spirit contract or a controlled dimensional system rather than from merely possessing the item.","Acceptance: verify its ritual, spirit, storage, extraction or equipment contract, legal ingredient sources, failure state and every alternate acquisition route; perform a representative ritual, spirit task or storage cycle, record ingredients, duration, capacity and recovery, and close quest-reward, trade, loot, EMC, miner, possession and alternate-ritual shortcuts."]
	quest.1D45085F4D187E92.quest_subtitle: "Welcome to Occultism"
	quest.1D45085F4D187E92.title: "Datura Seeds / Dictionary Of Spirits — Ritual Acceptance"
	quest.1D57C823A1F0203C.quest_desc: ["Steam Mining Drill is a early steam-machine component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify steam supply, input and output separation, recipe duration, exhaust or byproducts and unattended stack processing; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1D861612DC79A95D.quest_desc: ["Didn't like the enchantment? no problem use the dis-enchantment table"]
	quest.1DA4B337940EFC2D.quest_subtitle: "You can use Mystical Agriculture!"
	quest.1DBA8DD396081924.quest_desc: ["Portable Fluid Interface is a fluid logistics or storage component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify flow direction, pump speed, tank reserve, infinite-source boundary, moving-interface contact and overflow; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1DBB7232A529A7E6.quest_desc: [
		"The Quantum Matter Fabricator (QMF) is the multiblock evolution of the DMA. It is built for bulk matter processing, parallel production and AE2 autocrafting integration."
		""
		"Up to 27 parallel threads in standard mode"
		"9 parallel threads while Safe Mode is enabled"
		"Accepts both QMF-native recipes and DMA recipes"
		"Pulls ingredients from the ME network automatically"
		"Pushes outputs back into ME storage automatically"
		"Supports AE2 automation through the Quantum Pattern Hatch"
		"Quantum Pattern Hatch"
		"The Quantum Pattern Hatch is the multiblock-facing pattern provider for this machine family."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Stores up to 72 encoded patterns"
		"Links itself to the controller when the structure assembles"
		"Exposes the controller to AE2 as a crafting machine"
		"Lets AE2 dispatch work directly into the multiblock threads"
		"Parallel Model"
		"Each free thread can run one recipe copy."
		""
		"A pushed AE2 pattern reserves one free thread"
		"Idle threads can still auto start valid work from the ME network"
		"Items, fluids and AE are all pulled directly from the network"
		""
		"Tier Rules"
		""
		"Recipes can require MK1, MK2 or MK3"
		"Higher machine tiers can run lower tier recipes faster and cheaper"
		"Safe Mode trades throughput for thermal stability"
	]
	quest.1DC40420068AD5DD.quest_desc: ["This weapon shoots blasts of&9 high knockback electricity&r that does &azero damage&r, and will &drecharge&r if depleted while you have a &btesla bulb&r in your inventory."]
	quest.1DCDA89DA49A8EF0.quest_desc: ["Refinery is a structure added by the Immersive Engineering mod. It uses energy and combines Ethanol (8 mb) and Plant Oil (8 mb) to create Biodiesel (16 mb), a combustible fuel for Diesel Generator."]
	quest.1DCDA89DA49A8EF0.title: "Refinery"
	quest.1DD861102962056D.quest_subtitle: "A somewhat good option for mining."
	quest.1DE0F289821F55D1.quest_desc: ["Now that we have a Foliot Crusher, we can &muse&r politely ask it to crush down some &eEnd Stone&r and &9Obsidian&r for us. We'll use these to make some new Chalk!"]
	quest.1DE0F289821F55D1.title: "&aChalking It Up&r"
	quest.1DE428DE5A0AB47C.quest_desc: ["When it's finished processing the coal, the front doors will open and it will spit the coal coke out the front. It's a good idea to have hoppers or a belt there to catch it."]
	quest.1DE8B0C9A7195720.quest_desc: ["Advanced Mekanism Checkpoint 5720 is a advanced Mekanism system-design checkpoint in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify documented energy tree, chemical and heat loops, radiation containment, digital logistics, emergency shutdown and restart procedure; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1DE8B0C9A7195720.title: "Advanced Mekanism Checkpoint 5720 — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.1DEB8D39E8484973.quest_desc: ["[ { \"text\": \"Click Me!\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"232F28C7B5A9F4DD\" } } ]"]
	quest.1DEB8D39E8484973.quest_subtitle: "Don't forget to check our farming mod MFM!"
	quest.1E01AC22D5903AD1.quest_desc: ["Hand cranks with a cogwheel installed."]
	quest.1E0AE46BB87E6C09.quest_desc: ["Crafter1 is a multi-tier autocrafting machine in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify recipe slot isolation, ingredient retention, internal buffer, operation order, byproducts and restart after blockage; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1E1016523BF3849D.quest_desc: ["A refined material obtained from crushing bauxite ore. It serves as a key ingredient in producing aluminum and other advanced industrial alloys."]
	quest.1E1870FAD295DEDE.quest_desc: ["Clear out and flatten an area roughly 20x20 blocks to make room for your camp. The camp will not place if there are objects in the way. Right clicking the supply camp on the ground will show a 3D preview of the camp. Using the placement controls arrows, position the camp in your clearing, then click the green checkmark to finalize the placement. If it won’t place, then the terrain is in the way, and you may need to clear the area more. Red lines may appear showing you the areas that need to be cleared."]
	quest.1E1EF430810D08BF.quest_desc: ["Solar Neutron Activator is a advanced chemical-processing component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify chemical phase, tank and side configuration, catalyst or secondary input, output separation, radioactive handling and clean purge; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1E31F400E47B0D34.quest_desc: ["The first &aore&r of your journey, found within the &9deep dark&r (and &emining dimension in the&r  &lDeep Slate layor&r) , you will use this for your first set of &6ATM&r &cgear.&r you need &dNetherite&r to mine this ore."]
	quest.1E3A0029B8A7826A.quest_desc: ["Crafted from &0plates of an ancient beast&r, &cpowerful&r yet&b can break&r."]
	quest.1E414D285E7A5FE2.quest_desc: ["Tertium Sword / Tertium Pickaxe / Tertium Axe / System is a linked agriculture system. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify component ratios, shared catalysts, legal crop tiers, output ownership and unattended completion without duplicating seeds or essences; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.1E5C1E40BC116DEC.quest_desc: ["Those small little fellas create their own mushroom tiny villages where they can be found. Trap them in jars and collect dust from them."]
	quest.1E62FF75E939AD80.quest_desc: ["Chaotic Capacitor is a modular tool, weapon or portable energy item in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify module capacity, charged performance, area effect, attack or mining throughput, repair path and energy supply; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1E6717073A2504CA.quest_desc: ["Dark Steel Ingot is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1E6717073A2504CA.title: "Dark Steel Ingot — Machine-System Acceptance"
	quest.1E7401AD76624DEB.quest_desc: ["Acquired through &lRight-Clicking&r a &egeothermal vent&r with an &bempty bottle&r, you will use this new found gas to create &dcolored lights&r! "]
	quest.1E8744C1B5BF390B.quest_desc: [
		"From here you can choose two paths to focus on, or both at the same time, but it may take longer. "
		""
		"One of them is Mystical Agriculture, with which you can grow most vanilla resources in the form of seeds and essences, being faster if used in a hydroponic bed. "
		""
		"Or you can choose the Productive Bees path, which also has most of the normal resources but with some extras such as items that would normally require quarries, manual mining, and crafting."
	]
	quest.1E8744C1B5BF390B.quest_subtitle: "Or just do both"
	quest.1E9AB7114C5ADDB9.quest_desc: ["Infinite Universal Cable is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1EBA6436DEBB02CC.quest_desc: [
		"The &eME Conversion Monitor&r is the upgraded version of the &2ME Storage Monitor&r."
		""
		"It adds the ability to &ndirectly&r withdraw from or store &aItems&r into the &dME Network&r."
		""
		"In addition to the &2Storage Monitor's&r interactions, conversion monitors support the following actions:"
		""
		"&bLeft-click&r &nExtracts&r a stack of the shown item into &nyour inventory&r"
		""
		"&bRight-click&r with &eItem&r &nInserts&r the held item into &nthe network&r"
		""
		"&bRight-click&r with &7Empty Hand&r will &ninsert&r all of the shown item from &nyour inventory&r into &nthe network&r."
	]
	quest.1ED70668BFC6611F.title: "Diamond Cell / Diamond Pylon / Diamond Plinth — Factory Legitimacy"
	quest.1EF51C312AAA3437.quest_subtitle: "Sturdy"
	quest.1F10BC33D22328BD.quest_desc: ["Time has claimed this once-sacred site, leaving its halls cracked and overgrown. Now, ghostly skeletons and trickster illusioners linger within, guarding little more than shadows of former glory. Though its dangers are real, the temple’s sturdy walls make it a tempting refuge for those seeking a foothold in this hostile world."]
	quest.1F10BC33D22328BD.quest_subtitle: "Find an Abandoned Temple"
