	quest.20C24A8F55709AC6.quest_desc: ["Quantum Accelerator is a cross-mod AE2 integration component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, component data and the absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.20CA94E3263FCA5E.quest_desc: ["Imperium Watering Can is a Imperium watering tool. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify manual learning use, area of effect, automation restrictions and the point at which the task must move to bounded infrastructure; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.20F4CBC52CD12260.quest_desc: ["The &6Tempad&r mod introduces a device inspired by the \"Loki\" series, allowing players to save specific locations and teleport to them from anywhere in the game world. Users can customize the color of the portals and the interface, with 30 available options."]
	quest.210137C6556CA68B.quest_desc: ["Nutritious Chicken Feed is a mob capture and spawn-egg conversion component in Mob Grinding Utils. A valid farm must be bounded, recoverable and restricted to creatures and drops that are legal after the corresponding first encounter.","Acceptance: verify allowed target list, exact entity identity, one legitimate encounter, component preservation and a blacklist for bosses, quest entities and unique-drop creatures; run a controlled batch, record spawn rate, kill rate, power or consumables, collection capacity and shutdown behaviour, then close boss, unique-drop, reward, trade, EMC, Woot and neural-simulation bypasses."]
	quest.212EF8601746C500.quest_desc: ["Imperium Apple is a Imperium Mystical Agriculture component. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify its actual production role, legal first acquisition, sustained input and output rates and every renewable-resource bypass it could introduce; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.21426F5EEC922866.quest_desc: ["Half-submerged in the oceans lie the petrified remains of a colossal beast, its skeletal form stretching farther than the eye can follow. Was it a creature of the deep, dragged ashore in ages past—or did it fall from the heavens themselves? No records remain, only questions carved into stone."]
	quest.21426F5EEC922866.quest_subtitle: "Find a Typhon"
	quest.215606B3A894512E.quest_desc: ["MI Factory Checkpoint 512E is a industrial-factory design checkpoint in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify documented voltage tree, steam and fluid budgets, component stock, byproduct routing, failure isolation and restart procedure; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
