		"Components are assembled in a Mechanical Crafter using plenty of Aluminum and Steel."
		""
		"Surround the rotor with the stators to complete the multiblock."
		""
		"Operational details:"
		""
		"0 RPM - 70 RPM: No electricity generation"
		""
		"71 RPM - 256 RPM: Voltage rises linearly from 12V to 2232 kV. Current is limited to 24.6A, giving power output from 295W to 54.9kW"
	]
	quest.218803812A9C332B.quest_desc: ["&cStronger&r &cHellshelves&r &eInfused&r in a &denchant&r table with at &lLeast 45&r &aEterna&r and at &lLeast 30&r &cQuanta.&r"]
	quest.21939E58707A7756.title: "Large Steam Macerator / Bronze Plated Bricks / Bronze Item Input Hatch / Bronze Item Output Hatch — Factory Acceptance"
	quest.2199F0DE2FBE29E3.quest_desc: [
		"The Mechanical Arm can interact with Cooking Pot, Skillet, Stove, Cutting Board, Chiller, Oven."
		""
		"And the Mechanical Arm can work on stations which have Packager unpacking support for container slot only, as the ingredient slots is properly handled by Packager unpacking."
	]
	quest.21A830CC8DAD6566.quest_desc: ["Track Station is a railway and train-system component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify track continuity, station ownership, schedule order, signal blocks, loading time, unloaded chunks and recovery from obstruction; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.21B40BEC30B40491.quest_desc: ["Andesite Funnel is a item-logistics component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify direction, filter, distribution mode, belt speed, destination capacity, overflow and prevention of recirculation loops; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.21B40BEC30B40491.title: "Andesite Funnel — Kinetic Acceptance"
	quest.21CCBEBD84A4C4A5.quest_desc: ["Shape Card Void is a builder or area-operation component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify shape-card bounds, chunk ownership, filter rules, energy per operation, protected blocks and output collection; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.21CED51F547085CE.quest_desc: [
		"Tier 4 and 5 Female dragons (yeah dont check between the legs, you won't find anything there) protect their laid eggs. Kill the mother to steal the egg.. Yeah well don't feel bad, they burnt down like 4 villages. "
		""
		"Tip: Swab the dragon for DNA to make its egg. Put it in the spawner and kill as many as you can. They seem to keep their AI despite spawner upgrades, so better kill them fast."
	]
	quest.21D45D2B85002B6E.quest_desc: ["A thick, tar-like substance derived from crude oil. It’s used as a base material for producing asphalt, fuel, and other industrial resources essential for large-scale factory operations."]
	quest.21EDEEE1A1B82B53.quest_desc: ["Raw Materials Iridium is a cross-mod industrial integration component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material identity, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.21EE456F005D0343.quest_desc: ["Water Condensator is a fluid logistics machine. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify source rules, tank reserve, chunk boundaries, overflow and unintended world-fluid duplication; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.21EE522DDBF0BF72.quest_desc: ["An enhanced version of the vanilla &dDragon's Breath&r, infused with &darcane&r power. Used for crafting the &bEndshelf.&r It's rare, &cvolatile&r, and &nabsolutely essential&r if you're aiming for &9peak magical performance&r."]
	quest.21EE72B7EC064BCB.title: "Kill a shulker"
	quest.2229840A38178686.quest_subtitle: "Best midgame flight method."
	quest.2239CC2E6B914090.quest_desc: ["A powered device that moves fluids through pipes using electrical energy. It provides precise and consistent flow control, perfect for automation systems and industrial machinery."]
	quest.22420EF3089DD7F6.quest_desc: ["Assembler is a single-block industrial processing machine in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify recipe lock, input and output buffers, fluid or tool requirements, power tier, byproducts and full-output shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2242CC4BAB25C4B9.quest_subtitle: "Requires a MASSIVE amount of matter"
	quest.226171470A06E7E8.quest_subtitle: "Get 4 planks"
	quest.226171470A06E7E8.title: "Craft some planks"
	quest.2278992080010A80.title: "See a Enderman"
	quest.22AC3C79141AB3FC.quest_desc: ["Obtained by putting an Electrum Sheet in a Rolling Mill."]
	quest.22AC3C79141AB3FC.quest_subtitle: "Crafting component."
	quest.22B958727A3B170A.quest_desc: ["Useful for &6crafting&r &anew armour&r and a &bnew bow&r."]
	quest.22C1FDD2FC9A3AC2.quest_desc: [
		"Recipes can be set inside of the Assembler. The fluid tanks in the Assembler will automatically fill liquid containers used in recipes, such as Water Buckets."
		""
		"The Assembler will automatically craft the set recipes if it has the correct materials. Crafted items will remain into the inventory of the Assembler."
		""
		"If an inventory is connected to the end of the Assembler, the crafted item will move into that inventory."
	]
	quest.22C1FDD2FC9A3AC2.title: "Assembler"
	quest.22C5D2CD84E6E9EF.quest_desc: ["Modification Station is a modular MekaSuit or Meka-Tool capability in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify module host, slot or unit count, energy demand, mining or combat throughput, flight or immunity effects, repair and replacement; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.22C5D2CD84E6E9EF.title: "Modification Station — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.22E01FE041DE9C54.quest_desc: ["A compact power source that transforms water pressure into rotational energy. It provides smooth and consistent motion, ideal for efficiently running mechanical systems."]
	quest.22E15D3CC2162F60.quest_desc: ["Environmental Controller is a area-effect environmental system in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify radius, module cost, energy demand, player or mob targeting, overlapping fields and server-side permission; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.22F4C38E79DEFF1E.quest_desc: ["When placing any building, including your supply camp or ship. You will have the option to change your colony style. Click the “Switch Pack” button to open a menu with many styles to choose from. If you want to get an idea of the styles before you build, go to youtube and search \"&eMineColonies Build Styles&r\". Note: This pack includes a number of additional styles not shown in the video."]
	quest.23012F6C4C522CEB.quest_desc: ["The Forester is an essential worker in your colony. They will chop down trees and replant a sapling in the tree’s place. Foresters will chop any tree in the immediate area. However, this area can be restricted using a &ezoning tool&r available in the hut block. "]
	quest.230463E830D6FFEB.quest_desc: ["Empty Pcb is a printed-circuit manufacturing component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify plastic preparation, UV exposure, etching time, acid handling, board yield and prevention of early PCB rewards; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.232F28C7B5A9F4DD.quest_desc: ["Welcome to &#FF2E62MFM&r! This mod is designed to eliminate the grind by turning energy into resources. To get started, you will need a source of Forge Energy (FE) from another mod. Your journey begins with understanding the world around you."]
	quest.232F28C7B5A9F4DD.quest_subtitle: "Minimum Effort, Maximum Output"
	quest.232F28C7B5A9F4DD.title: "Introduction"
	quest.2331FCDD2F2B709A.quest_desc: ["Supercharged Coil is a SPS, antimatter or nucleosynthesis component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify polonium input, SPS energy pulse, coil count, antimatter output rate, containment buffer, recipe authority and prohibition of simulated antimatter; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2331FCDD2F2B709A.title: "Supercharged Coil — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.233E438357CD89F6.quest_desc: ["Turbine Valve / Turbine Vent / Saturating Condenser is a large heat, steam or turbine multiblock component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify valid structure, steam or heat input, coolant return, rotor and coil balance, output limit, condensate recovery and safe spin-down; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.233E438357CD89F6.title: "Turbine Valve / Turbine Vent / Saturating Condenser — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.235103831F094D3F.quest_desc: ["Feeling like Poseidon? Well at the least you will be looking like one.."]
	quest.2389EB06F7BFCAC8.quest_desc: ["Absolute Logistical Transporter is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.239D0B5CA70AA4C5.quest_desc: ["Infinity Totem is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.23A9A2D399A7BF94.quest_desc: ["Elevator Pulley is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.23F165DEAD225B10.quest_desc: ["Universal Cables are Mekanism's way to transfer power."]
	quest.23F165DEAD225B10.title: "&aBasic Universal Cable"
	quest.2408BDBEDC0C2AD6.quest_desc: ["With this armor will provide &bresistance&r to some of &eirradiated's&r effects and will &creduces&r &aacid's destructive effects&r against this &6armor&r. "]
	quest.2408BDBEDC0C2AD6.title: "Hazmat set"
	quest.24092320E90F15B5.quest_desc: ["Has a &bchance&r to drop from a &6dinosaur&r I am not naming &o(Click on the leather to see what you have to kill).&r You will use this to &ccraft primal armor&r."]
	quest.24174700F7FB771C.quest_desc: ["Advanced Mekanism Checkpoint 771C is a advanced Mekanism system-design checkpoint in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify documented energy tree, chemical and heat loops, radiation containment, digital logistics, emergency shutdown and restart procedure; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.24174700F7FB771C.title: "Advanced Mekanism Checkpoint 771C — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.24422A6ACA45CC63.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is Ender Crafting?&r"
		""
		"&eEnder Crafting&r is a high-tier crafting recipe type used to automate recipes from the &eEnder Crafting Table&r."
		""
		"It is designed for &elate-game&r and complex crafting recipes."
		""
		"&eHow It Works&r"
		""
		"• Uses the &eEnder Package Crafter&r"
		"• Supports recipes from the &eEnder Crafting Table&r"
		"• Crafted items are &eejected&r into adjacent inventories"
		""
		"The Ender Package Crafter &crequires power&r to operate."
		""
		"&eEnder Alternators&r"
		""
		"Ender Crafting requires &eEnder Alternators&r to function."
		""
		"• Alternators must be placed within a &a7×7×7&r area"
		"• Alternators do &cNOT&r need items, but must be &apresent&r"
		"• Missing alternators will prevent crafting"
		""
		"&eUse Cases&r"
		""
		"• Automating Ender Crafting Table recipes"
		"• Late-game crafting chains"
		"• Advanced PackagedAuto setups"
		"• Integration with &3AE2&r factories"
		""
		"&eWhy Use Ender Crafting?&r"
		""
		"• Enables automated Ender Crafting"
		"• Handles very complex recipes"
		"• Removes manual crafting steps"
		"• Scales well into late-game automation"
	]
	quest.24422A6ACA45CC63.title: "&eEnder Crafting&r"
	quest.2457221FA3BDC0CB.quest_desc: ["Infinite &1AE2&r Energy, &bOLNY WORKS FOR AE2 CONTROLLERS!&r"]
	quest.245B6C714D755030.quest_subtitle: "“That’s one small step for a man, one giant leap for mankind.”"
	quest.24A4F1AA0BFFE867.quest_desc: ["Electric Blast Furnace / Heatproof Machine Casing / Cupronickel Coil is a voltage-tier electrical component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify voltage tier, amperage or EU demand, cable loss, transformer boundary, overvoltage protection and reserve capacity; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.24A4F1AA0BFFE867.title: "Electric Blast Furnace / Heatproof Machine Casing / Cupronickel Coil — Factory Acceptance"
	quest.24B3F8554E46922F.quest_desc: ["Awakened Draconium Block is a tier-defining draconic material or core in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify material origin, previous-tier core, awakening or Chaos prerequisite, batch size and reusable progression permissions; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.24BD32102AFA1691.quest_desc: ["An upgraded crafter that holds more patterns and has an increased crafting speed."]
	quest.24BD32102AFA1691.title: "&5Netherite Crafter&r"
	quest.24CFA0022432887E.quest_desc: ["Stockpile Switch is a factory sensing or control component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify input signal, target selection, priority, stock threshold, wireless channel ownership and safe default state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.24DB954ED93BE6EE.quest_desc: ["Golden Egg is a specialized mob-farm component in Mob Grinding Utils. A valid farm must be bounded, recoverable and restricted to creatures and drops that are legal after the corresponding first encounter.","Acceptance: verify its capture, spawning, movement, killing or collection role, bounded operating area, overflow response and restricted-target policy; run a controlled batch, record spawn rate, kill rate, power or consumables, collection capacity and shutdown behaviour, then close boss, unique-drop, reward, trade, EMC, Woot and neural-simulation bypasses."]
	quest.24DBBC97F8635A16.quest_desc: ["Adv Pattern Provider / Adv Pattern Provider Part / Adv Pattern Provider Capacity Upgrade is a cross-mod AE2 integration component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, component data and the absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.24DDED464AE48E05.quest_desc: ["Gearshift is a kinetic transmission component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify rotation direction, RPM ratio, stress capacity, branch isolation, reverse state and visible diagnostics; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.24E50A3AF87B2283.quest_desc: ["Screen is a monitoring and display component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify module source, displayed value, refresh cost, range, stale-data indication and diagnostic usefulness; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2507593830977B88.quest_desc: ["Tank Sink is a specialized mob-farm component in Mob Grinding Utils. A valid farm must be bounded, recoverable and restricted to creatures and drops that are legal after the corresponding first encounter.","Acceptance: verify its capture, spawning, movement, killing or collection role, bounded operating area, overflow response and restricted-target policy; run a controlled batch, record spawn rate, kill rate, power or consumables, collection capacity and shutdown behaviour, then close boss, unique-drop, reward, trade, EMC, Woot and neural-simulation bypasses."]
	quest.250D1E2BFE6E0D50.quest_desc: ["Advanced Large Steam Boiler is a steam-generation or conversion component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify water reserve, fuel or heat input, steam output, pressure-safe buffer, turbine demand and clean shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.253657BE5D9D9162.quest_desc: ["This type of cable interface is probably the most important item one can make in their Refined Storage journey. \\n \\n This type of cable interface connects an external storage to your Refined Storage Network. It basically lets RS look into the storage container to let you access it within your grid! \\n \\n This works on many things, including but not limited to: Chests, Barrels, Drawers, Drawer Controllers, and more! \\n \\n If you can't make drives and have a bunch of chests everywhere, this is your best bet in creating a storage Network!"]
	quest.253657BE5D9D9162.title: "External Storage"
	quest.253B13051E4540FB.quest_desc: ["Blaze Sword is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.2580602D7B567F11.quest_desc: ["A reinforced handle crafted for advanced tools, offering improved grip, durability, and performance. Essential for creating high-quality mechanical instruments and machinery parts."]
	quest.2598273041353196.quest_desc: [
		"When building the &6Reprocessor&r, you will need &o&bat least&r one &aCollector&r and &3Waste Injector&r."
		""
		"The &aReprocessor Collector&r must be placed &o&bin the center of the bottom face&r of the structure."
		""
