	quest.2745297337E13E9E.quest_desc: ["Advanced Air Compressor is a compressed-air generation component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify fuel or energy input, heat production, maximum pressure, air output and safe unload behaviour; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.275F53FE2A231771.quest_desc: ["Absolute Fluid Tank is a specialized advanced Mekanism component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify its power, chemical, heat, radiation, transport, modular or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or interrupted state; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.276379D643EFC5AD.quest_desc: ["Qio Drive Collapse is a QIO digital-storage or logistics component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify frequency ownership, item and type capacity, importer or exporter filters, remote access, overflow and recovery after frequency loss; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2774D37126FE6785.quest_desc: [
		"The piston's and the Conveyor Belts' direction matters. The piston should face downwards. The Conveyor Belts should both travel down the length or up the machine."
		""
		"After the blocks are in place, use an Engineer's Hammer on the piston whichever side the control panel should be on to complete the multiblock."
		""
		"The Metal Press requires a Mold in order to function. Right clicking a Metal Press with a Mold will attach the Mold to the Metal Press. The mold can be detached by shift right clicking with an Engineer's Hammer."
	]
	quest.2774D37126FE6785.quest_subtitle: "The Metal Press is a 3x1x3 multi-block"
	quest.2774D37126FE6785.title: "Metal Press"
	quest.27A11A6ED27A72D2.quest_desc: [
		"Transformers can raise or lower voltage based on the ratio of turns on their electromagnetic coils. For example, an input coil with 100 turns and an output coil with 400 turns gives a turn ratio of 4, boosting the voltage by 4×."
		""
		"Coils are added by right-clicking them onto the transformer. The input coil is always placed first, followed by the output coil."
		""
		"Currently, there’s no clear way to distinguish input from output aside from the noise texture on top. Transformers are not bidirectional. The top part of the \"handle\" with the checkerboard pattern marks the input side, which will be on the left when the block is placed."
	]
	quest.27A396E8628B269E.quest_desc: ["Gold Drill is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.27B28A53F0EFE604.title: "Enter &dThe Nether&r"
	quest.27BE23C8489886AF.quest_desc: [
		"This checkmark is to help if you don't want to have to do the progress of seashelf and hellshef together, so you can follow just one of them."
		""
		"Maybe I should have warned you beforehand."
	]
	quest.27C34EDA36455548.quest_desc: ["Battlemage Hood is a magical equipment tier in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify mana or Source benefit, thread slots, defensive statistics, mobility interaction and repair path; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.27F1BFDA949F8005.quest_desc: ["Found throughout these &6caves&r are &core&r, you will use this &aradioactive rock&r for &ecrafting&r."]
