	quest.281C68F6B89A7168.quest_desc: ["&5An item that when placed on the ground is used to attract the Gum Worm to it&f."]
	quest.282994DE03384B38.quest_desc: ["Infinity Shovel is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
