	quest.29164630E1BD76B5.quest_desc: ["This is the main resource in the mod. Go out and mine some!"]
	quest.29164630E1BD76B5.title: "Arcane Crystals"
	quest.292C729230F5259E.quest_desc: ["Speed Card is a specialized AE2 network component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify its channel, power, storage or routing contract and a safe disconnected or saturated state; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
