	quest.2951D84F8F0F389A.quest_desc: ["An electronic screen made up of individual light segments used to show numbers or simple symbols. Perfect for building clocks, counters, or digital readouts in advanced machinery and control panels."]
	quest.295618B74C1FED6C.quest_desc: ["Knife / Cable Anchor / Name Press is a specialized AE2 network component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify its channel, power, storage or routing contract and a safe disconnected or saturated state; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.2956AF6FF3F119B2.quest_desc: ["Quantum Storage 128 / Quantum Storage 256 is a cross-mod AE2 integration component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, component data and the absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.2976203B1081D414.quest_subtitle: "Not part of the Dimensional Storage mod btw."
	quest.2978E3692E772978.quest_desc: ["After using an &6ATM portal&r in the &cnether,&r you will be transported to this &drealm.&r"]
	quest.2979C84CDED4119B.quest_desc: ["Supreme Fluid Tank is a specialized advanced Mekanism component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify its power, chemical, heat, radiation, transport, modular or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or interrupted state; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.29C7DC6D524A125E.quest_desc: ["Fire Bangle is a cross-mod arcane integration component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, data-bearing state and absence of a cheaper parallel route; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.29D05998ADC8ACF5.quest_desc: ["Processing Unit is a industrial control-circuit tier in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify previous circuit tier, board and wire supply, clean-room or machine requirement, batch yield and stage authority; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.29EE878BC8D3A742.quest_desc: [
		"Productive Bees adds additional bees and advanced beehives allowing you to put your bees to work creating resources in a fully automated setup. Productive bees are just as derpy as their vanilla cousins, but makes up for it in usefulness and beeuty."
		""
		"This mod adds bees for most vanilla resources as well as all your favorite modded resources like copper, lead, silver etc. There are also a lot of bees for mod specific resources like Mystical Agriculture essence, Silents Gems, Powah, Tinkers Construct, Thermal and many more. In total you can find more than 200 bees if the relevant mods are installed."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Also there are up to 32 variants of a new advanced beehives for the bees to live in, most of which are made from wood added by other mods."
		""
		"It is recommended to use JEI for looking up breeding recipes and Patchouli for ingame documentation."
	]
	quest.29EE878BC8D3A742.title: "Bee cages"
	quest.2A0A01BE836BB2AB.quest_desc: ["A monument of grandeur and mystery, the Shiraz Palace sprawls in every direction, its halls twisting and turning beyond comprehension. Its purpose remains unknown, but its size and opulence are undeniable. Travelers beware: without a companion, it’s all too easy to lose your way in this labyrinthine estate."]
	quest.2A0A01BE836BB2AB.quest_subtitle: "Find the Shiraz Palace"
	quest.2A1B0386B7987DD3.quest_desc: ["Vast and dreamlike, the Aviary stretches high into wtilight sky, its halls divided into four whimsical quadrants. Each one unfolds as a surreal scene—bright, strange, and perilous in its own way. To wander here feels like stepping beyond reality itself. Is this the journey’s end… or just another beginning?"]
	quest.2A1B0386B7987DD3.quest_subtitle: "Find an Aviary"
	quest.2A20000FAEC2E16A.quest_desc: ["The &dSolid access port&r allows for fuel to be &cinputed&r and waste &aoutputed&r from the reactor, while the &eEnergy tap&r stores and outputs the &creactors&r energy."]
	quest.2A20000FAEC2E16A.title: "Reactor Interacting Components"
	quest.2A2CE255693B7495.quest_desc: ["The Engine Base will prompt you to right-click each required part onto it. Once all components are added, the engine will request as many pistons as needed to complete the configuration you selected."]
	quest.2A2D5DC9B5474841.quest_desc: [
		"What’s left after killing a &0Brainiac&f."
		""
		"Not to be confused with DC Comics' &0Brainiac&r."
	]
	quest.2A2E1C7C34C9A4AA.quest_subtitle: "Destroys almost any block"
	quest.2A404708E175235F.quest_desc: ["Fluid Tank is a fluid logistics or storage component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify flow direction, pump speed, tank reserve, infinite-source boundary, moving-interface contact and overflow; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2A5004EB99AE4F96.quest_desc: [
		"There are more Otherworld items you will need to gather, and eating &cDemon's Dream Fruit&r every time you need the &7Third Eye&r effect gets annoying."
		""
		"This is what the &dOtherworld Goggles&r are for! When equipped (even in your Curios slot), it gives the Third Eye effect!"
	]
	quest.2A5004EB99AE4F96.title: "Quit Eating That Fruit!"
	quest.2A55024C0BA2F4EA.quest_desc: ["Qio Drive Hyper Dense is a QIO digital-storage or logistics component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify frequency ownership, item and type capacity, importer or exporter filters, remote access, overflow and recovery after frequency loss; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2A6ECCE28B9C64FB.quest_desc: ["An aerial brass companion that follows the player if they hava a controller."]
	quest.2A71A8C85EC08868.quest_desc: ["&6Links&r from&d project Expansion&r are used to&a transport items&r, &bliquids&r, and &eEMC&r. Place one &6link&r and &ainput items&r through &ehoppers&r or &bpipes&r, &9liquids&r through clicking on the &6link&r with a &abucket&r of the &bfluid&r you want to transport to make a &efilter&r, then using &bpipes&r to insert the rest of the &bfluid,&r Then place another &6link&r &esomewhere else&r and extract the &atransported items&r with &bpipes&r set to extract or with &ehoppers&r, &eEMC&r will be turned into &aitems&r when transported, you need to choose what to transport by &lRight-Clicking&r with the item and &lShift-Right-Clicking&r to remove it if you need to &aswitch&r it for something else."]
	quest.2A71A8C85EC08868.quest_subtitle: "Did you read that?"
	quest.2A71A8C85EC08868.title: "EMC Link"
	quest.2A7E3F2CD335EAD0.quest_desc: ["Inferium Helmet / Inferium Chestplate / Inferium Leggings / System is a linked agriculture system. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify component ratios, shared catalysts, legal crop tiers, output ownership and unattended completion without duplicating seeds or essences; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.2A8FA05582ACC3FE.quest_desc: ["Quantum Helmet / Quantum Chestplate / Quantum Leggings / Quantum Boots is a cross-mod AE2 integration component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, component data and the absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.2A8FA05582ACC3FE.title: "Quantum Helmet / Quantum Chestplate / Quantum Leggings / Quantum Boots — Network Acceptance"
	quest.2A9FAF18AD150A7C.quest_desc: ["Basic Item Filter is a multi-service conduit or routing component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify service type, insert-extract direction, filter exactness, channel priority, redstone mode and loop prevention; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2AC48A0D4CA24084.quest_desc: ["Combine &6Lightning Rods&r, &8Lodestones&r and &1Neutron Star Fragment&r to get &2Pulsar Fragment Ingot&r."]
	quest.2ADDA74C73C08DB2.quest_desc: ["A gearbox where the rotation direction of all 4 sides are independently configurable."]
	quest.2AEBE3F28996A6ED.quest_subtitle: "Faster furnaces!"
	quest.2AF31F1769085641.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Reprocessor&r is a &o&b3x3x7&r multiblock structure that has &o&bspecific rules&r to complete the construction of the multiblock."
		""
		"The heart of this multiblock is the &dController&r, and can be placed in &o&bany vertical face&r as long as it is not an &bedge/frame&r."
	]
	quest.2AF85A5EE9A8CCBA.quest_desc: ["A clutch that is only coupled if the input RPM is faster than a configurable threshold."]
	quest.2AFDEEA844B0DC0B.quest_desc: ["Wireless Access Point / Wireless Booster is a wireless network access component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify range, energy drain, permission, dimensional boundary and protection of the main network reserve; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.2B01B964638DFBD1.quest_desc: ["The Crusher’s Hut is where the Crusher will take items and crush them into other blocks. Most notably cobblestone = gravel, gravel = sand, sand = clay. One important factor to know is that the crusher has a daily limit based on the hut level. Level 1 has a daily max of 16, level 2 has 64. At level 5 it’s daily max is 999. "]
	quest.2B01B964638DFBD1.quest_subtitle: "Build a Crusher's Hut"
	quest.2B115519A21F9CB7.quest_desc: ["Cataclysm Encounter Checkpoint 9CB7 is a boss-encounter planning checkpoint in Cataclysm. Progress must come from discovering the correct structure, preparing for its mechanics and winning the legitimate encounter rather than receiving boss progress from a reward table or simulated drop source.","Acceptance: verify documented structure route, arena preparation, equipment reserve, escape and recovery plan, first-victory evidence and post-victory automation limits; document entry, arena safety, required equipment, failure recovery and first-victory evidence, then prove that Woot, neural simulation, spawners, trades, EMC, loot aliases and quest rewards cannot grant unique or capability-changing drops early."]
	quest.2B1717F5D6E20B79.quest_desc: ["Uu Matter Bucket is a late matter or quantum-production component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify energy scale, data or matter input, previous circuit tier, cross-mod gate, output rate and prohibition of early replication; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2B27E4E04A628C60.quest_desc: ["The &9Speed Upgrade&r does exactly what it says it does. It will increase the speed at which the interface/block works. Need an importer to pull faster? Want your crafters to work faster? This is the upgrade! \\\\n \\\\n The &6Stack Upgrade&r increases the speed of transfer by a stack of items rather than just one. Combine with Speed Upgrades!"]
	quest.2B27E4E04A628C60.title: "Speeding Everything Up!"
	quest.2B29DDBADF11195E.quest_subtitle: "Charges your gadgets"
	quest.2B3A70E34CB0CE21.quest_desc: ["Automatically refills gadgets and armor that use fuel."]
	quest.2B3F2F470E06BC40.quest_desc: ["Advanced Mekanism Checkpoint BC40 is a advanced Mekanism system-design checkpoint in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify documented energy tree, chemical and heat loops, radiation containment, digital logistics, emergency shutdown and restart procedure; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2B3F2F470E06BC40.title: "Advanced Mekanism Checkpoint BC40 — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.2B4BFD88DF1A934D.quest_desc: ["Ingots Aluminum is a cross-mod industrial integration component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material identity, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2B56AEA32C0C43FD.quest_desc: ["Infinity Pickaxe is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.2B56AEA32C0C43FD.quest_subtitle: "Mines everything. Breaks everything. Probably too much."
	quest.2B6E2CD796D4ADF3.quest_desc: ["A heavy metal ingot used in crafting industrial components and machinery parts. Its density and conductivity make it valuable for advanced mechanical and electrical creations."]
	quest.2B70445E6CD99EDB.quest_desc: [
		"Strange structures have begun rising from the land. Mysterious dungeons, fortresses, and towers that pierce the skies. No one knows where they came from, only that they’re teeming with hostile creatures, forgotten treasures, and powerful secrets."
		""
		"Your task is to venture forth and uncover the mysteries of these ancient places. Each dungeon holds new dangers, but also the keys to survival: weapons, artifacts, and knowledge that will aid you in the trials ahead."
		""
		"Prepare yourself adventurer. &6Exploration&r and courage are the only ways to thrive in this world where the land itself rises against you."
	]
	quest.2B76B2F18C2C47D2.quest_desc: ["Sinks is a cross-mod advanced Mekanism integration component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material or data state, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2B76B2F18C2C47D2.title: "Sinks — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.2B8E1CBA2BB77B86.quest_desc: ["Cosmic Fluid Tank is a specialized advanced Mekanism component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify its power, chemical, heat, radiation, transport, modular or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or interrupted state; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2B94BD0F7A5D46C3.quest_desc: ["Guidebook is a Hostile Neural Networks integration component. Neural simulation is repeat-production infrastructure, not a substitute for discovering, fighting and understanding the represented creature for the first time.","Acceptance: verify its real role in training, prediction production or fabrication, the declared stage and every alternative acquisition path; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy, consumables, time and output, and prove that random rewards, model swapping, trades, EMC, Woot, spawners or loot-table shortcuts cannot produce restricted drops early."]
	quest.2BB30AED452773EB.quest_desc: ["A portable device that lets you access your entire storage network remotely. It combines multiple functions into one interface, allowing seamless item management, crafting, and monitoring from anywhere within range."]
	quest.2BC64E1EB1BCE14D.quest_desc: ["Stainless Steel Drill is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2C09CD9B5A1E51B3.quest_desc: [
		"Mekanism Digital Miner: This is the game changing machine. You place it in the world, power it, and it can mine an area of up to 128x128 blocks, searching for exactly the ore you choose."
		""
		"Want just diamonds and osmium? It only takes those and ignores the rest. It's your primary source of minerals from now on."
	]
	quest.2C09CD9B5A1E51B3.quest_subtitle: "No more manual mining. Let's let the machines do the work."
	quest.2C0A45666CCB62BE.quest_desc: ["Redstone Card / Toggle Bus is a specialized AE2 network component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify its channel, power, storage or routing contract and a safe disconnected or saturated state; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.2C0A45666CCB62BE.title: "Redstone Card / Toggle Bus — Network Acceptance"
	quest.2C0E51F90A72C16C.quest_desc: ["Dropped from the &eGloomoths&r of these caves, you will use this to &ccraft three items&r."]
	quest.2C1AB8A598E5BFB3.quest_desc: ["&bStore&r &dinfinite&r &epower&r."]
	quest.2C284001988DF201.quest_desc: ["Infinite Chemical Tank is a advanced chemical-processing component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify chemical phase, tank and side configuration, catalyst or secondary input, output separation, radioactive handling and clean purge; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2C4CA092A557205E.quest_desc: ["Gravichestplate is a industrial material form in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify authoritative source material, forming machine, tool or mold return, batch buffer and tag-unification direction; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2C53C8A3322CAB88.quest_desc: ["Infinity Ingot is a endgame structural material in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify full convergence recipe, previous-tier components, antimatter or draconic dependencies, EMC zeroing and scalable batch production; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.2C603F39F80D3267.quest_desc: ["Used to &edetonate explosives&r from a &bdistance&r, simply &lRight-Click&r &ctnt&r or a &dnuke&r, then &lRight-Click&r the air to &cdetonate it&r."]
	quest.2C6A8E61F9FEEFD8.quest_desc: ["Naquadah Reactor Controller is a fusion-reactor ignition or structure component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify D-T fuel production, laser charge, ignition sequence, injection rate, passive and active output, coolant loop and restart after flameout; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2C9C9CB71941DC01.quest_desc: ["Tertium Essence is a tier or resource essence. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify upgrade and downgrade direction, infusion-crystal durability, batch ratios and prevention of recursive conversion or EMC loops; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.2CA78C74FC24502D.quest_desc: ["End Steel Ingot is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2CA7B7158BE3A3D4.quest_desc: ["Infinity Sword is a creative-adjacent weapon or tool in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify area effect, world damage, combat throughput, safety controls, repair or replacement and strict post-convergence acquisition; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.2CA7B7158BE3A3D4.quest_subtitle: "One hit. That’s all it takes. No exceptions."
	quest.2CC1D393E3A7EFFC.quest_desc: ["Divination Rod / Iesnium Ingot is a spirit utility or perception tool in Occultism. Its value comes from a correct ritual, a bounded spirit contract or a controlled dimensional system rather than from merely possessing the item.","Acceptance: verify stored entity or target data, charge or durability, valid use cases, replacement, component preservation and prevention of capability duplication; perform a representative ritual, spirit task or storage cycle, record ingredients, duration, capacity and recovery, and close quest-reward, trade, loot, EMC, miner, possession and alternate-ritual shortcuts."]
	quest.2CC1D393E3A7EFFC.quest_subtitle: "Nether"
	quest.2CC1D393E3A7EFFC.title: "Divination Rod / Iesnium Ingot — Ritual Acceptance"
	quest.2CC2D2C475F8E758.quest_desc: ["Antiprotonic Nucleosynthesizer is a SPS, antimatter or nucleosynthesis component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify polonium input, SPS energy pulse, coil count, antimatter output rate, containment buffer, recipe authority and prohibition of simulated antimatter; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2CC56A4F06E53307.quest_desc: ["Uv Light Box is a printed-circuit manufacturing component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify plastic preparation, UV exposure, etching time, acid handling, board yield and prevention of early PCB rewards; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2CCAA7C0FEDEB573.quest_subtitle: "Your best early game friend."
	quest.2CCDBD3E57F1BD87.quest_desc: [
		"Fills &nenclosed areas&r with &bbreathable air&r. Vital for making &6space stations&r and planetary bases livable."
		""
		"Requires &apower&r and &bwater&r pumped in from the &nbottom&r."
	]
	quest.2CCDBD3E57F1BD87.title: "Oxygen in your base"
	quest.2CD6597AE3312F20.quest_desc: ["Will form nearly instantly in the naphtha vat, so you can think of liquid plastic being a direct result of naphtha."]
	quest.2CD70FCC8B119D7A.quest_desc: ["Mechanical Pump is a fluid logistics or storage component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify flow direction, pump speed, tank reserve, infinite-source boundary, moving-interface contact and overflow; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2CD754C4B15B480F.quest_desc: ["Item Wyvern Proj Accuracy is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2CDB914E84D00B66.quest_desc: ["Conduit is a multi-service conduit or routing component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify service type, insert-extract direction, filter exactness, channel priority, redstone mode and loop prevention; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2CDB914E84D00B66.title: "Conduit — Machine-System Acceptance"
	quest.2CE2A196359A53AA.quest_desc: ["Has 4 slots for Constructing."]
	quest.2CE3008EE0CDFD64.quest_desc: ["Charged Staff / Entropy Manipulator / Matter Cannon is a specialized AE2 network component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify its channel, power, storage or routing contract and a safe disconnected or saturated state; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.2CE3008EE0CDFD64.title: "Charged Staff / Entropy Manipulator / Matter Cannon — Network Acceptance"
	quest.2CFEE04BA574921E.quest_desc: ["This interface will place the designated block in the direction it is pointed. \\n \\nYou can designate the block within the GUI. This is useful for automation!"]
	quest.2CFEE04BA574921E.quest_subtitle: "Placing Blocks!"
	quest.2CFEE04BA574921E.title: "Constructor"
	quest.2D4170B5AD28DCBF.quest_desc: ["Hv Diesel Generator is a voltage-tier electrical component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify voltage tier, amperage or EU demand, cable loss, transformer boundary, overvoltage protection and reserve capacity; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2D592669F4D41793.quest_desc: ["Just like the &2Reactor&r, the frame must be built out of &eCasings&r, but the walls can be &3Turbine Glass&r instead!"]
	quest.2D592669F4D41793.title: "Turbine Construction Parts"
	quest.2D665540B859B8BE.title: "Alloy Ingots"
	quest.2D7605FB3D8E1F85.quest_desc: ["Controller is a cross-mod convergence component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's completed infrastructure, authoritative output, data or container state and absence of a cheaper substitute; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.2D7605FB3D8E1F85.quest_subtitle: "Important Notice!"
	quest.2D94489E09F8DD9C.quest_desc: [
		"The steel mechanism is used in many machines."
		""
		"Like the precision mechanism, it requires a heavy plate to have various items deployed onto it:"
		""
		"Steel cogwheel"
		"Nickel plate"
		"Large steel cogwheel"
		"Lead plate"
		"Screws"
		"Screwdriver"
		""
		"Doing this twice with a 94% chance of getting a steel mechanism."
	]
	quest.2D950D37BA27DF62.quest_desc: ["AE2 Network Checkpoint DF62 is a network design checkpoint in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify documented topology, channel budget, power reserve, storage overflow and a restart procedure; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.2D950D37BA27DF62.title: "AE2 Network Checkpoint DF62 — Network Acceptance"
	quest.2DB4F395EA26DF4B.quest_subtitle: "Find a Coliseum"
	quest.2DD3DE061E0BD676.quest_desc: ["Denser Neutron Collector is a neutronium production component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify collector count, passive production rate, chunk availability, buffer capacity and fair scaling without manual waiting; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.2DEF6ABC9BCBEB82.quest_desc: [
		"Used to make many recipes that can give certain buffs to the player or for decorating a kitchen."
		""
		"Here are some examples:"
	]
	quest.2DEF812916A51C34.quest_subtitle: "Found in the nether."
	quest.2DF7B0A4E49ACEB1.title: "Gold Cell / Gold Plinth / Gold Pylon — Factory Legitimacy"
	quest.2E10AFB432824AB1.quest_desc: ["A durable alloy wire made from copper and nickel, valued for its consistent electrical resistance. Commonly used in advanced circuits and precision engineering applications."]
	quest.2E20069AE6C51ADF.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cardboard Box&r is used for &o&bboxing up&r other blocks to move them, preserving the inventory while being &o&bmoved&r."
		""
		"By &eRight-Clicking&r it on any &o&bblock&r, &o&btank&r, &o&bchest&r or &o&bmachine&r, you &nwrap&r it in this protective box that you can break while still preserving everything about that &o&bblock&r, &o&btank&r, &o&bchest&r or &o&bmachine&r. This includes its &o&binventory&r, &o&borientation&r, &o&binstalled upgrades&r, and &o&bmore&r. You can later place it safely into the world. &eSneak+Right-Click&r to &nunwrap&r a box, causing the &6Cardboard Box&r to drop as an item."
		""
		"With &6Cardboard Boxes&r you can pick up &nspawners&r too."
	]
	quest.2E274BEEF2B0B8C7.quest_desc: [
		"The Chemical Oxidizer is used for making gases from materials. It is a crucial machine needed for Mekanism's 5x ore production system."
		""
		"Okay, let's start with making Sulfur Dioxide first."
		""
		"Feeding the Sulfur Dust into this machine, the Chemical Oxidizer, will create Sulfur Dioxide. "
		""
		"Now we need to create Sulfur Trioxide. Send the Sulfur Dioxide into a Chemical Infuser to combine it with Oxygen to create Sulfur Trioxide."
		""
		"Send the Trioxide to another Chemical Infuser to combine it with Water Vapor to create Sulfuric Acid."
	]
	quest.2E2811D1A0F2A492.quest_desc: ["To increase the range of your wireless connection to your system, you'll need to craft &9Range Upgrades&r. \\n \\nThe Wireless Transmitter can only hold 4 total. Here's one on the house."]
	quest.2E2811D1A0F2A492.quest_subtitle: "I mean Transmitting Range"
	quest.2E2811D1A0F2A492.title: "Increasing Wifi Range"
	quest.2E4361DA4E4F0874.quest_desc: [
		"&eFusion Crafting&r is an &eextreme endgame&r crafting recipe type used to automate recipes from a &eFusion Crafting Core&r."
		""
		"It is based on the powerful fusion system and is intended for the most complex recipes."
		""
		"&eHow It Works&r"
		""
		"• Uses the &eFusion Package Crafter&r"
		"• Supports recipes from the &eFusion Crafting Core&r"
		"• Crafted items are &eejected&r into adjacent inventories"
		""
		"The Fusion Package Crafter &crequires power&r to operate."
		""
		"&eMarked Injectors&r"
		""
		"Fusion Crafting requires &eMarked Injectors&r of sufficient tier."
		""
		"• Injectors must be placed at least &a3 blocks&r away"
		"• Injectors must face the crafter"
		"• No blocks may obstruct the connection"
		"• All injectors must be &apowered&r"
		""
		"Different recipes require different &etiers&r of injectors (Draconium, Wyvern, Draconic, Chaotic)."
		""
		"&eChecking Injector Requirements&r"
		""
		"You can &aSneak + Right-click&r with an empty hand on an &eidling&r Fusion Package Crafter to view the required number and tier of Marked Injectors."
		""
		"&eWhy Use Fusion Crafting?&r"
		""
		"• Fully automates the most powerful recipes"
		"• Removes manual Fusion Crafting"
		"• Handles injector tiers automatically"
		"• Essential for late- and endgame progression"
	]
	quest.2E4361DA4E4F0874.title: "&eFusion Crafting&r"
	quest.2E44DE5AB631D67A.quest_desc: ["Reactor Injector is a draconic reactor safety component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify containment field, saturation, fuel conversion, extraction rate, emergency shutdown and blast-safe placement; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2E4671264448F7E9.quest_desc: ["Basic Soul Filter is a multi-service conduit or routing component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify service type, insert-extract direction, filter exactness, channel priority, redstone mode and loop prevention; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2E6B809BDF02CE75.quest_desc: ["Apprentice Spell Book is a spellbook capability tier in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify book tier, unlocked glyph tier, spell slots, upgrade ingredients and replacement after loss; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.2E8B0B59ACD1F35B.quest_desc: ["Sludge Refiner is a Industrial Foregoing production component. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify its exact work area, input contract, power or fluid demand, output routing and safe shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.2E8B8DBE61162084.quest_desc: ["Smart Chute is a item-logistics component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify direction, filter, distribution mode, belt speed, destination capacity, overflow and prevention of recirculation loops; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2E9C478E71901CFE.quest_desc: ["Neutron Minecart is a cross-mod convergence component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's completed infrastructure, authoritative output, data or container state and absence of a cheaper substitute; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.2E9C478E71901CFE.quest_subtitle: "\"What is the rarest...\""
	quest.2E9FC7DC2AC6FD8E.quest_desc: ["Pellet Plutonium is a fission-reactor, radiation or nuclear-fuel component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify reactor structure, fissile fuel rate, coolant and heated output, burn limit, waste route, radiation containment and emergency SCRAM; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2EA3E6C82DA79317.quest_desc: ["Entity Spawner / Mob Swab is a spawn-control or farm-safety component in Mob Grinding Utils. A valid farm must be bounded, recoverable and restricted to creatures and drops that are legal after the corresponding first encounter.","Acceptance: verify affected entity or sound scope, ownership, range, chunk reload state and proof that suppression does not hide a failed or escaped farm; run a controlled batch, record spawn rate, kill rate, power or consumables, collection capacity and shutdown behaviour, then close boss, unique-drop, reward, trade, EMC, Woot and neural-simulation bypasses."]
	quest.2EC13B39D90021B7.quest_desc: ["Unlocks travel to &eVenus.&r Requires &dostrum&r to be built."]
	quest.2EC4BA00CE42B1DC.quest_desc: ["An automated version of the &bNASA Workbench&r. Speeds up rocket production by allowing input from &eexternal inventories&r (FE is needed)."]
	quest.2EF4DD5CC254CC80.quest_desc: [
		"Mechanical Pipe is the fluid pipe for Mekanism."
		""
		"It can be used to connect to any blocks with Fluid Handlers in them."
	]
	quest.2EF4DD5CC254CC80.title: "&aBasic Mechanical Pipe"
	quest.2EFC5DBD8122A0AE.quest_desc: ["Far below the surface lies a twisted network of chambers, where the air is thick with disease and shadow. Once a place of treatment, it now resembles a burial ground for forgotten rulers, its halls echoing with the whispers of those long lost. Only the brave (or the desperate) dare to tread these haunted corridors."]
	quest.2EFC5DBD8122A0AE.quest_subtitle: "Find a Plague Asylum"
	quest.2F0B0D4401AA455E.quest_desc: ["Andesite Tunnel is a item-logistics component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify direction, filter, distribution mode, belt speed, destination capacity, overflow and prevention of recirculation loops; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2F0B0D4401AA455E.title: "Andesite Tunnel — Kinetic Acceptance"
	quest.2F66F85A601AC908.quest_desc: ["Bronze Macerator is a early steam-machine component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify steam supply, input and output separation, recipe duration, exhaust or byproducts and unattended stack processing; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2F6B432512FA2A65.quest_desc: ["Attach to any inventory to expand its surface area. Great for access in tight spaces and smart setups with threshold switches."]
	quest.2F6E8A0DFB555ED6.quest_desc: ["Cosmic Meatballs is a multi-branch convergence ingredient in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify all required domain outputs, batch automation, container return, unique encounter permissions and absence of random acquisition; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.2F74E955A2455025.quest_desc: [
		"When electrical components are connected directly without any diodes they share the voltage between them. The more devices you add, the less current each one receives. In other words, don’t overload your line unless you like watching things fizzle out."
		""
		"Diodes, on the other hand (along with potentiometers and transformers), act as circuit splitters. Anything on the output side gets the full voltage all to itself clean, isolated, and ready for action."
	]
	quest.2F8B1B5084313565.quest_desc: [
		"Immersive Engineering is a tech mod."
		""
		"It is best known for its multiblock machines, characterized by their industrial look. Both single and multiblock machines operate on three tiers of power, low voltage being 256 RF/t, medium being 1024 RF/t and high corresponding to 4096 RF/t."
		""
		"The most important tool for this mod is the Engineer's Manual, created by crafting together a book and a lever. It contains recipes and instructions for everything in the mod."
	]
	quest.2F8B1B5084313565.title: "Welcome to Immersive Engineering"
	quest.2F8F54A16D09A07F.quest_desc: ["A very important component in the mod used for most of the main recipes!"]
	quest.2F9B52EA41B4DFF0.quest_desc: ["A conductive wire made from refined copper, used to transmit electrical energy between machines and components. Essential for building power networks and automation circuits."]
	quest.2FA6B8A1C8713DE0.quest_desc: ["Insanium Farmland is a crop-tier farmland. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify hydration, crop-tier compatibility, harvest area, replacement stock and the effect of acceleration on server load; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.2FB2FE782B1103D6.quest_desc: ["Bronze Item Input Hatch / Bronze Fluid Input Hatch / Bronze Item Output Hatch / Steam Blast Furnace is a early steam-machine component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify steam supply, input and output separation, recipe duration, exhaust or byproducts and unattended stack processing; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2FC6539688E453D7.quest_desc: ["Some of the&9 best gear&r, untill &dAvaritia&r where you gain &ccontrol of the&r &0universe.&r"]
	quest.2FD77E58D9FF8877.quest_desc: ["Mechanical Dirt is a Industrial Foregoing production component. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify its exact work area, input contract, power or fluid demand, output routing and safe shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.2FED203901B58547.quest_desc: ["Meat Feeder is a Industrial Foregoing production component. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify its exact work area, input contract, power or fluid demand, output routing and safe shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.2FF641C1FD519E5D.quest_desc: ["Spatial Storage Cell 2 is a digital storage component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify type limits, byte capacity, partition policy, overflow destination and safe cell migration; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.302553C58A76A140.quest_desc: ["[ { \"text\": \"Click Me!\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"78545503CE761C3F\" } } ]"]
	quest.302D29E43E9C9A94.quest_desc: ["Packager is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3030A68A0EA81C54.quest_desc: ["This is a new &ddimension&r visited through a &eAllthemodium portal&r, full of &arocks&r and &6ores&r for your &cmining necessities&r!"]
	quest.3035A949E710CCCB.quest_desc: ["Upgrade Smithing Template is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.3041273D3B7942CA.quest_desc: ["Fuzzy Card / Inverter Card is a specialized AE2 network component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify its channel, power, storage or routing contract and a safe disconnected or saturated state; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.30478230148F08CB.quest_desc: ["Naquadah Reactor Casing is a specialized advanced Mekanism component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify its power, chemical, heat, radiation, transport, modular or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or interrupted state; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.30478230148F08CB.quest_subtitle: "good luck"
	quest.305B3D42F8B290B0.quest_desc: ["Familiar Amethyst Golem is a summoning, familiar or magical automation component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify summoning prerequisite, entity ownership, working area, valid targets, output policy and unique-drop exclusion; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.305C778D5538E46F.quest_desc: ["The Ultimate processing unit for all known ores. Faster, easier, more productive. For the little cost of energy, you extract from ore maximum."]
	quest.305C778D5538E46F.quest_subtitle: "Extracting Maximum value"
	quest.30700E99091B712A.quest_desc: ["The &9Regulator Upgrade&r allows you to maintain a certain amount of items within a block or machine. A great example of this is telling your network that you want to keep 64 Coal within a Furnace. You'd place the upgrade in the exporter attached to the furnace, and set it to 64. Your system will then try to keep the furnace full of fuel! \\\\n \\\\n But what if you need an item that is crafted? The &9Crafting Upgrade&r does exactly this. If you have the recipe learned inside of a crafter, adding this upgrade to an interface will let it know to craft it if you run out. \\\\n \\\\n Using our example from before, let's say we have a Mystical Ag farm going and have Coal Essence. We can then put the Coal recipe in a crafter connected to our system, then place this upgrade in the same exporter that is keeping the Furnace fueled. If you run out of Coal in your system, the crafting upgrade allows your system to craft some more!"]
	quest.30700E99091B712A.title: "Regulating Items in Interfaces"
	quest.3081877A09CE2A60.quest_desc: ["Draconic Capacitor is a modular tool, weapon or portable energy item in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify module capacity, charged performance, area effect, attack or mining throughput, repair path and energy supply; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3086EB50617AE8BE.quest_desc: ["Ring Of Greater Discount is a equipment augmentation component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify compatible slot, stacking rule, exact capability gain, removal cost and interaction with other accessory mods; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.30A1DEBBC212EDF1.quest_desc: [
		"Converts bulk source materials into printed parts"
		"Supports up to 27 parallel jobs in standard mode"
		"Drops to 9 parallel jobs in Safe Mode"
		"Integrates with AE2 through the Quantum Pattern Hatch"
		"Uses direct ME network pull and push for ingredients and outputs"
		""
		"The Quantum Pattern Hatch stores 72 encoded patterns"
		"It links itself to the controller after the structure assembles"
		"AE2 can push jobs directly into the slicer without manual inventory handling"
	]
	quest.30A238E87F013CBB.quest_desc: [
		"Apart from the 5 main genes, there is a 6th gene, the bee specific gene. "
		""
		"These are used to make spawn eggs of that bee. "
		""
		"Most major mods use bee spawn eggs to connect themselves to Productive Bees. "
	]
	quest.30A238E87F013CBB.title: "Genes"
	quest.30A84C6A54BD336E.quest_desc: ["Mechanical Drill is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.30B3469DAA8D5A0A.quest_desc: ["A better tier of transporter with more storage."]
	quest.30B3469DAA8D5A0A.title: "&cAdvanced Logistical Transporter"
	quest.30BA459B25CF0912.quest_subtitle: "Found in the Depths of the Nether"
	quest.30BEE6FCFFC78A63.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is the Settings Cloner?&r"
		""
		"The &ePackaging Settings Cloner&r is a utility tool that allows you to &acopy&r and &apaste&r configuration settings between supported &ePackagedAuto&r machines."
		""
		"&eHow to Use&r"
		""
		"• Hold the &eSettings Cloner&r in your hand"
		"• &aSneak + Right-click&r a supported machine to &acopy&r its settings"
		""
		"• &aRight-click&r another machine of the &esame type&r to &apaste&r the copied settings"
		""
		"• &aSneak + Right-click&r on &eair&r or on an &eunsupported block&r to clear the stored configuration"
		""
		"&eWhy Use the Settings Cloner?&r"
		""
		"• Quickly replicate complex setups"
		"• Avoid manual reconfiguration"
		"• Maintain consistent automation behavior"
		"• Essential for large &ePackagedAuto&r factories"
	]
	quest.30BEE6FCFFC78A63.title: "&eSettings Cloner&r"
	quest.30C7553B5832D22A.title: " Raw Iron"
	quest.30CB226DAA54E6EA.quest_desc: ["The &a&lEternal Generator&r is the core of your automation. It converts pure energy into physical drops using data."]
	quest.30CB226DAA54E6EA.quest_subtitle: "FULL STEAM AHEAD"
	quest.30CB226DAA54E6EA.title: "Matter from energy"
	quest.30D6BFA1A3B6B205.quest_desc: ["A gearbox where the rotation direction of all 4 sides are independently configurable."]
	quest.30E9255DEC69C061.quest_desc: ["Supremium Sword / Supremium Pickaxe / Supremium Axe / System is a linked agriculture system. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify component ratios, shared catalysts, legal crop tiers, output ownership and unattended completion without duplicating seeds or essences; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.30EB438C66324213.quest_desc: ["&dIgnores Player&r - Spawns mobs constently no need for a player to be nearby."]
	quest.30F8BA43B1BB9035.quest_desc: ["An upgrade to the &3Basic Fluid Tank&r."]
	quest.310969B8FE0A94DE.quest_desc: ["&bApotheosis&r is a mod about improving the vanilla experience while attempting to stay true to the base game. It adds new &dpotions&r, &benchantments,&r &cdangers,&r &emechanics,&r and other interesting things that greatly improve the &aMinecraft experience&r."]
	quest.310969B8FE0A94DE.title: "Obtain a Spawner"
	quest.314068155E263985.quest_desc: ["Plant Gatherer is a crop automation machine. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify working area, seed return, fertilizer demand, harvest routing and overflow; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.3143EA7DF096CE61.quest_desc: ["Steel Packer is a single-block industrial processing machine in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify recipe lock, input and output buffers, fluid or tool requirements, power tier, byproducts and full-output shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.314E41B84C8DD464.quest_desc: [
		"Your personal &earchive&r of &denchantments.&r"
		""
		"This block lets you &6store&r, &eview,&r and &bextract&r &denchantments&r using &aXP.&r Found a perfect &denchant&r but not the right item? &eSave it&r for later! Also great for transferring &eenchantments&r from &csalvaged&r &cgear.&r"
		""
		"Open the menu, here you can &binsert&r the &denchantment&r you want to store, &lShift-left-Click&r on a book to store it, &lLeft-Click&r on a stored &denchant&r to &edraw one level&r back, &lShift-Right-Click&r to draw the &6max level available&r."
	]
	quest.316399F0B5F729CA.quest_desc: ["A dedicated assembly station keeps recurring engineering parts visible and prevents critical tools from disappearing into general storage.","Acceptance: stock standard fasteners and plates, reserve tool slots, and label the table for IE components rather than treating it as another miscellaneous bench."]
	quest.31B396E100E83098.quest_desc: ["Item Chaotic Energy Link is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.31B73D16C0199785.quest_desc: [
		"The &dRefined Obsidian Ingot&r is used to create the most durable and powerful &aTools&r and &aArmor&r in the game as well as a few other items."
		""
		"However, it also the most expensive to obtain."
	]
	quest.31D603B530071AB9.quest_desc: [
		"Once your model is Basic or higher, you can use the simulation chamber to run simulations of your model. Simulations will always produce a generalized prediction, and may also produce a Mob Prediction, based on the accuracy of the model. "
		""
		"The higher tier of the model, the higher the accuracy, up to 99.5% at Self Aware. "
		""
		"Running simulations requires energy (based on the model type) and a catalyst item, which is usually a Prediction Matrix."
	]
	quest.31EEE2875595F315.quest_desc: ["Dusts Sulfur is a cross-mod advanced Mekanism integration component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material or data state, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.31EEE2875595F315.quest_subtitle: "A Quick Recap"
	quest.31EEE2875595F315.title: "Dusts Sulfur — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.3204A2F62F67F397.quest_desc: ["Qio Drive Singularity is a QIO digital-storage or logistics component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify frequency ownership, item and type capacity, importer or exporter filters, remote access, overflow and recovery after frequency loss; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.320C8B5D62920E21.quest_desc: ["After &csmelting&r your &6Raw Allthemodium ore&r, you will get ingots! You use the &aingots&r to craft &cweapons&r and when used in a &esmithing table&r and with the &6Allthemodium template&r you can craft new &aarmor&r and a new &dspell book&r."]
	quest.320CC038A64A3195.quest_desc: ["Laser Amplifier / Laser is a fusion-reactor ignition or structure component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify D-T fuel production, laser charge, ignition sequence, injection rate, passive and active output, coolant loop and restart after flameout; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.320CC038A64A3195.title: "Laser Amplifier / Laser — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.32439CCC802C8041.quest_desc: ["Conduit is a multi-service conduit or routing component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify service type, insert-extract direction, filter exactness, channel priority, redstone mode and loop prevention; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.32439CCC802C8041.title: "Conduit — Machine-System Acceptance"
	quest.324947891E0AF04A.quest_desc: [
		"Mekanism Ethylene Gas: This is by far the most efficient energy system in the mid-game."
		""
		"The Setup: You'll use plants (potatoes, carrots, etc.) to create Ethylene and burn it in a Gas-Burning Generator."
		""
		"Required Machines: Crusher (to make bio fuel), Pressurized Reaction Chamber (PRC) to convert biogas into Ethylene."
		""
		"A single generator burning Ethylene can generate thousands of RF/t, more than enough energy for this phase of the game."
		""
		"Extreme Reactors: A great source of energy for the midgame and \"cheap\" for the midgame."
		""
		"Setup: Initially, we'll use the smallest possible size, 5x5, which in itself generates a lot of RF/t."
	]
	quest.324947891E0AF04A.quest_subtitle: "Your base will start asking for more and more energy."
	quest.324AD7BD3B5735F8.quest_desc: ["If you aren't a fan of brainwashing, use this to cancel out sirens singing."]
	quest.325D7C592E2FB05A.quest_desc: ["Singularity is a late matter or quantum-production component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify energy scale, data or matter input, previous circuit tier, cross-mod gate, output rate and prohibition of early replication; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.325D7C592E2FB05A.quest_subtitle: "Not to be confused with Avaritia"
	quest.32615D0EAB219E27.quest_desc: ["A qubit (quantum bit) is the basic unit of quantum information, analogous to a classical bit but with unique quantum properties: it can be a 0, a 1, or a superposition of both states simultaneously, allowing it to hold far more data and enable faster processing for complex problems."]
	quest.32615D0EAB219E27.quest_subtitle: "Fun fact"
	quest.3289FED615552BF0.quest_desc: ["Pulsating Alloy Ingot is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.32958EB1EFD3FD4C.quest_desc: ["Coalgenerator is a specialized RFTools ecosystem component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify its module or card configuration, power contract, area or network ownership and a safe invalid or disconnected state; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3297BA81BC5156DE.quest_desc: ["Crafted from a &acave codex&r, this map will lead you to the &bcave&r the &acodex&r was &elinked to&r."]
	quest.3297BA81BC5156DE.quest_subtitle: "Craft a magnetic cave map"
	quest.32BEB0B1FD068CA5.quest_desc: [
		"End Remastered overhauls the way players get to the End and makes the experience way more interesting by forcing them to fully explore the beautiful world of Minecraft. "
		""
		"Adding 16 totally new Ender Eyes hidden all around your world, this mod will make your playthrough a lot more enjoyable."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"1. Old Eye - Found in Desert Pyramids"
		""
		"2. Nether Eye - Found in Nether Fortresses"
		""
		"3. Cold Eye - Found in Igloos"
		""
		"4. Rogue Eye - Found in Jungle Pyramids"
		""
		"5. Black Eye - Found in Buried Chests"
		""
		"6. Magical Eye - Dropped by Evokers"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"7. Lost Eye - Found in Mineshafts"
		""
		"8. Corrupted Eye - Found in Pillager Outposts"
		""
		"9. Wither Eye - Dropped by The Wither"
		""
		"10. Guardian Eye - Get it by Killing Elder Guardian"
		""
		"11. Witch Eye - Craft it using the witch pupil"
		""
		"12. Cursed Eye - Found in Bastions treasure chest"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"13. Exotic Eye - Craft it using aquatic item"
		""
		"14. Evil Eye - Buy it from a master cleric"
		""
		"15. Undead Eye - Craft it using an Undead Soul"
		""
		"16. Cryptic Eye - Have a small chance to get it when enchanting"
	]
	quest.32BEB0B1FD068CA5.quest_subtitle: "Vanilla eyes won't work "
	quest.32BEB0B1FD068CA5.title: "End Remastered?"
	quest.32C3E14578D48E6C.quest_desc: ["Reinforced Pressure Tube is a air-network distribution or safety component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify tube pressure rating, branch loss, regulator setpoint, isolation valve, leak diagnosis and overpressure protection; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
