	quest.35F24F6E403AADA1.quest_desc: ["A gearbox with shafts on all 6 sides. Conceptually uses the same internal mechanism as Parallel Gearbox, so top and bottom spins at half speed."]
	quest.360B4A5D7EAC3024.quest_desc: ["Conduit is a multi-service conduit or routing component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify service type, insert-extract direction, filter exactness, channel priority, redstone mode and loop prevention; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
