	quest.3761B64135EA94C0.quest_desc: ["Nuclear Reactor / Nuclear Alloy Machine Casing Pipe / Nuclear Casing is a nuclear fuel or reactor-cycle component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify fuel preparation, reactor heat, coolant, depleted output, radiation or waste handling and emergency shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
