	quest.387FC4D9C4010FD8.quest_desc: ["The Automated Engineer's Workbench is a 3x2x3 multiblock. It is an automated version of the Engineer's Workbench."]
	quest.387FC4D9C4010FD8.title: "Automated Engineer's Workbench"
	quest.38A28A6BCA401D6F.quest_desc: ["Respawned the same way as normal placing an end crystal on the exit portal's outer rim."]
	quest.38A28A6BCA401D6F.title: "Defeat the &8&lEnder Dragon"
	quest.38C3598203D0E017.quest_desc: ["Item Draconium Aoe is a tier-defining draconic material or core in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify material origin, previous-tier core, awakening or Chaos prerequisite, batch size and reusable progression permissions; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.38D14675BA200B0E.title: "Processing Upgrades"
	quest.38D5E571A36F12E4.quest_desc: ["Ring Of Potential / Mundane Belt / Dull Trinket is a equipment augmentation component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify compatible slot, stacking rule, exact capability gain, removal cost and interaction with other accessory mods; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.38D5E571A36F12E4.title: "Ring Of Potential / Mundane Belt / Dull Trinket — Arcane Acceptance"
	quest.38E84EA139A2316C.quest_desc: [
		"The Drive is the device you plug your storage cells into in order to use them for network storage. It has 10 slots which each accept a cell."
		""
		"If for some reason you want to, you can push and pull the cells from its inventory with any item logistics like hoppers or ae2 busses."
		""
		"It can be rotated with a Certus Quartz Wrench."
	]
	quest.38E9C4DB82B1279A.quest_desc: ["Contraption Controls is a moving-contraption component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify assembly boundary, movement axis, collision and protected blocks, inventory transfer, chunk edge and safe disassembly; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.39124F73B82400F4.quest_desc: ["Converts rotational energy from Create machines into FE at around 75% efficiency."]
	quest.3931273289B3A68C.quest_desc: [
		"Fluix ME Glass Cable is the simplest cable to make, transfers power and up to 8 channels. It comes in 17 different colors, the default being Fluix, and can be dyed any color using any of the 16 dyes."
		""
		"To craft colored cables surround a dye of any type with 8 cables of the same type ( color of the cables dosn't matter, but they must be the same type, glass, smart, etc ). You can also paint cables with any forge compatible paint brush in world."
		""
		"You can craft any colored cable with a water bucket to remove the dye."
		""
		"You can cover the cable with wool to create Fluix ME Covered Cable, and craft Fluix ME Smart Cable to get a better idea of what is going on with your channels."
	]
	quest.3940E67F7AB07D8D.quest_desc: ["Chalk Rainbow / Chalk Void is a ritual layout and execution component in Occultism. Its value comes from a correct ritual, a bounded spirit contract or a controlled dimensional system rather than from merely possessing the item.","Acceptance: verify pentacle pattern, chalk tier, bowl placement, central activation, consumed ingredients, chunk boundaries and safe cancellation; perform a representative ritual, spirit task or storage cycle, record ingredients, duration, capacity and recovery, and close quest-reward, trade, loot, EMC, miner, possession and alternate-ritual shortcuts."]
	quest.3940E67F7AB07D8D.quest_subtitle: "Make it easy"
	quest.3940E67F7AB07D8D.title: "Chalk Rainbow / Chalk Void — Ritual Acceptance"
	quest.396804B13ECF09ED.quest_subtitle: "Make a Diamond pickaxe"
	quest.3979E578C63823DB.quest_desc: ["Cosmic Universal Cable is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.398F2CE7DBE4A31B.quest_desc: ["Chaotic Crafting Injector is a fusion-crafting infrastructure component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify injector tier, symmetric placement, recipe energy, ingredient retention and restart after interrupted charging; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.39959176F27817A1.quest_desc: ["Chaotic Chestpiece is a modular defensive capability item in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify shield capacity, recharge demand, flight or movement modules, damage bypass interactions and replacement after loss; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3999760881C855FA.quest_desc: ["Crystallization converts clean slurry into solid crystals; its batch rate determines whether the expensive fivefold chemical infrastructure can actually run continuously.","Acceptance: crystallize one full clean-slurry batch, route crystals by material, prevent mixed outputs, and record the slowest stage across dissolution, washing and crystallization."]
	quest.3999760881C855FA.quest_subtitle: "Turns Ore Slurry into Crystals"
	quest.39AC44DD78BB695F.quest_desc: ["A basic yet robust power unit built for generating strong rotational energy. It’s reliable and easy to maintain, making it suitable for medium to large mechanical systems."]
	quest.39ADBE9A60170296.quest_desc: ["Has 27 more filter slots and is 5x faster than the regular Importer. Also has the Stack Upgrade integrated."]
	quest.39C8CD6102B26BFE.quest_desc: ["The workbench handles specialized equipment and upgrades whose ingredients should be controlled separately from bulk factory inputs.","Acceptance: provide dedicated blueprint and component storage, retain rollback parts, and record the intended loadout before consuming rare upgrades."]
	quest.39C8E1705EF1CD31.quest_desc: ["The 256k Fluid Storage Part is used to craft the 256k Fluid Storage Disk."]
	quest.39C8E1705EF1CD31.title: "&e256k Fluid Part&r"
	quest.39CACA9B9A3FC911.quest_desc: ["Enchanter is a experience or enchanting component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify XP ownership, material cost, deterministic output, invalid enchantment handling and prevention of duplication or cheap transfer; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.39CF27CAC4EE33DB.quest_desc: ["Steam Chainsaw is a cross-mod industrial integration component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material identity, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.39F0944503669D86.quest_desc: ["The Digital Miner from Mekanism is a high-tech, customizable mining machine that can automatically scan and mine specific blocks from a large area, even through obstacles."]
	quest.39F0944503669D86.title: "Digital Miner"
	quest.39FCE3168C26B863.quest_desc: ["Coke Dust / Coke is a industrial material form in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify authoritative source material, forming machine, tool or mold return, batch buffer and tag-unification direction; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.39FFA83723143D47.quest_desc: ["Endless Cake is a creative or rule-altering endgame item in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify exact capability, server-side consequences, permission boundary, irreversibility and placement after every other production gate; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.39FFA83723143D47.quest_subtitle: "The solution to world hunger"
	quest.3A059BC37D957B99.quest_desc: ["A core mechanical part used to transmit rotational force between connected machines. Essential for linking engines, gearboxes, and other moving components in automation systems."]
	quest.3A06A34514B2F406.quest_desc: [
		""
		"{ \"text\": \"CLICK ME!\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4BB13C80196FD034\" } }"
	]
	quest.3A06A34514B2F406.quest_subtitle: "Check out the create questlines."
	quest.3A06A34514B2F406.title: "Create"
	quest.3A14F2313050D25F.quest_desc: ["Spell Crossbow is a specialized Ars Nouveau component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify its Source, spell, ritual, entity or automation contract and a safe invalid-input or interrupted state; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.3A1D74301CC5C1BE.quest_desc: ["Source Jar is a Source generation or storage component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify input legality, Source per cycle, jar routing, generation radius, renewable boundary and overflow; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.3A2633B6030BBC52.quest_desc: ["Goggles is a configuration, diagnostic or planning tool in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify exact configuration effect, copied data, ownership, safe reset, replacement after loss and use in diagnosing the production line; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3A4B5A9B432576AD.quest_desc: ["Awakened Supremium Watering Can is a Awakened Supremium watering tool. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify manual learning use, area of effect, automation restrictions and the point at which the task must move to bounded infrastructure; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.3A7C1931B394082F.quest_desc: ["Agronomic Sourcelink is a Source generation or storage component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify input legality, Source per cycle, jar routing, generation radius, renewable boundary and overflow; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.3A814EC89CD7E435.quest_desc: ["&bEggs&r are &cbroken&r when &ejumped on&r, and if you place &bice&r or &6amber&r beneath them they will &anot grow up&r."]
	quest.3A87F281627E29DA.quest_desc: ["Builder is a builder or area-operation component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify shape-card bounds, chunk ownership, filter rules, energy per operation, protected blocks and output collection; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3A984DEC00459804.quest_desc: ["Hydroponic Bed is a crop automation machine. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify working area, seed return, fertilizer demand, harvest routing and overflow; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.3A9AC6AB4407DC32.quest_desc: ["Pneumatic Engineering Checkpoint DC32 is a pressure-system design checkpoint in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify documented pressure zones, compressor capacity, heat balance, emergency isolation and restart procedure; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3A9AC6AB4407DC32.title: "Pneumatic Engineering Checkpoint DC32 — Pressure-System Acceptance"
	quest.3AB541A2323AF3B3.quest_desc: ["Qio Drive Array is a QIO digital-storage or logistics component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify frequency ownership, item and type capacity, importer or exporter filters, remote access, overflow and recovery after frequency loss; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3ACBE9B17453B4B5.quest_desc: ["Sleep at night without setting spawn"]
	quest.3ACBE9B17453B4B5.title: "Craft a sleeping bag"
	quest.3AD4622409437713.quest_desc: [
		"The Excavator is made of two parts:"
		"The Bucket Wheel is the center part, and is formed by Right Clicking with an Engineers Hammer on the the middle Block of Steel."
		"The Engine is the other part, and is formed by Right clicking the Engineers Hammer on the Heavy Engineering Block in the center of the back side."
		""
		"The energy input for the engine is on its side, the back features a redstone control panel and the item output."
	]
	quest.3AD4622409437713.title: "Excavator"
	quest.3ADC8C0B1350925F.quest_desc: ["Spell Horn is a cross-mod arcane integration component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, data-bearing state and absence of a cheaper parallel route; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.3AE2172B95B58B99.quest_desc: ["Qio Drive Base is a QIO digital-storage or logistics component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify frequency ownership, item and type capacity, importer or exporter filters, remote access, overflow and recovery after frequency loss; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3AF4E5D4839CEF8B.quest_desc: ["Chemical Oxidizer is a advanced chemical-processing component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify chemical phase, tank and side configuration, catalyst or secondary input, output separation, radioactive handling and clean purge; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3AF4E5D4839CEF8B.title: "Chemical Oxidizer — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.3B02277DB476C566.quest_desc: ["Wired Charger is a specialized Ender IO component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its alloy, capacitor, side, conduit or inventory contract and a safe blocked or disconnected state; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3B118C4351749B71.quest_desc: ["Allows you to create&d any spell&r."]
	quest.3B2204B624FDC91E.quest_desc: ["Absolute Mechanical Pipe is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3B30F2220336DC8B.quest_desc: ["Fluid Gate is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3B3C89649DF57161.quest_desc: [
		"Quantum Network Bridges can extend a network over infinite distances and even between dimensions. They can carry 32 channels in total (regardless of how cables are connected to each face), essentially acting like a wireless dense cable."
		""
		"Eight of these quantum rings placed around a ME Quantum Link Chamber will create a Quantum Network Bridge. Only the 4 ME Quantum Ring blocks adjacent to the ME Quantum Link Chamber will accept network connections, the 4 corner blocks cannot connect to cables."
	]
	quest.3B3C89649DF57161.title: "&6The Quantum Bridge"
	quest.3B40A769EDB26EA2.quest_desc: [
		"Got your eye on a new recruit and need some hay bales? If you place a postbox outside your tavern you can request items from the warehouse and a courier will deliver them to the postbox."
		""
		"Similarly, if you have items you want taken to the warehouse, place them in a Stash and a courier will be along shortly to pick them up."
	]
	quest.3B40A769EDB26EA2.title: "Postbox and Stash"
	quest.3B43DB1A6B0A7B44.quest_desc: ["Bio Fuel is added by Mekanism and is a type of fuel used inside of a Bio-Generator. Beyond that Bio Fuel is used in the Pressurized Reaction Chamber to create Ethylene."]
	quest.3B43DB1A6B0A7B44.title: "Bio Fuel"
	quest.3B73F2EBCCD1884C.quest_desc: ["Automatically refills gadgets and armor that use water."]
	quest.3B81800EE6E77EF2.quest_desc: ["Advanced Mekanism Checkpoint 7EF2 is a advanced Mekanism system-design checkpoint in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify documented energy tree, chemical and heat loops, radiation containment, digital logistics, emergency shutdown and restart procedure; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3B81800EE6E77EF2.quest_subtitle: "Calm down"
	quest.3B84215240D9F2CB.quest_desc: ["The &9Security Manager&r allows you to grant access and permissions to users within your network. \\\\n \\\\n When placed in your system, you'll need to create a &9Security Card&r for each player you'd like to configure permissions for. When no cards are present, everyone has access to all permissions. \\\\n \\\\n To restrict permissions and access to all unconfigured players, configure a card that isn't bound to a player and put it into the manager. The person who placed the Security Manager will always have access to it."]
	quest.3B84215240D9F2CB.quest_subtitle: "Secure your grid!"
	quest.3B84215240D9F2CB.title: "Security Manager"
	quest.3B91163DE3DA885C.quest_desc: [
		"Possibly one of the most dangerous jobs, especially early on. The Nether Miner travels to the Nether to mine resources. When the miner travels through the portal, there is a chance they may die. So choose your worker carefully."
		""
		"The portal in the Nether Mine will transport players to the Nether. However, the Nether Miner does not actually travel into the Nether, nor do they actually mine any blocks in the Nether."
	]
	quest.3B91163DE3DA885C.quest_subtitle: "Build a Nether Mine"
	quest.3BB133018966E4FF.quest_desc: ["Item Draconium Speed is a tier-defining draconic material or core in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify material origin, previous-tier core, awakening or Chaos prerequisite, batch size and reusable progression permissions; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3BB3AA6C29285837.quest_desc: ["Prudentium Apple is a Prudentium Mystical Agriculture component. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify its actual production role, legal first acquisition, sustained input and output rates and every renewable-resource bypass it could introduce; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.3BD5FB4D0526A4F6.quest_desc: ["Emberblade is a unique weapon. Treat fire and damage-over-time effects as progression power, not as a cosmetic variant; read the actual tooltip and test the complete attack cycle before comparing raw damage.","Acceptance: obtain the weapon through its approved source, record speed, reach, effect trigger, cooldown, durability and repair path, then prove that quests, trades, loot duplication and mob simulation cannot grant it before its stage."]
	quest.3BDF340E0327AEE4.quest_desc: ["Provides &epower&r to &dEnder IO&r &cmachines&r around it."]
	quest.3BFC57385C345E2D.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Meatallurgic is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.3C09EDD821E4995D.quest_desc: ["Jumbo Tank is a item, fluid or experience collection component in Mob Grinding Utils. A valid farm must be bounded, recoverable and restricted to creatures and drops that are legal after the corresponding first encounter.","Acceptance: verify collection radius, destination priority, item-fluid separation, full-output shutdown, experience ownership and restart recovery; run a controlled batch, record spawn rate, kill rate, power or consumables, collection capacity and shutdown behaviour, then close boss, unique-drop, reward, trade, EMC, Woot and neural-simulation bypasses."]
	quest.3C3519AFEBBAEC70.quest_desc: ["Piston is a machine-structure or electromechanical component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify previous-tier ancestry, material forms, motor or pump tier, reusable molds and continuous component stocking; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3C3FE45CEF5E242B.quest_desc: [
		"These three parts can be placed on &o&bany vertical face&r as long as they aren't on the frame!"
		""
		"The &cPower Port&r is used to &o&bgive power&r to the multiblock machine to process waste."
		""
		"The &9Fluid Injector Port&r is used &o&bto inject&r the liquid needed, which will depend on the type of waste injected. For &dCyanite&r, that means &o&1water&r!"
		""
		"The &cOutput Port&r is used &o&bto output&r the reprocessed material. You can &eRight-click&r it &o&bto grab&r the material out by hand, or &o&bpipe it out&r for automation."
	]
	quest.3C49F2EEDCCAF1DF.quest_desc: [
		"A basic layout of your factory should be like this: "
		""
		"Raw Ore goes into your Chemical Dissolution Chamber then pumps A GAS to Chemical Washer then pumps A GAS to Chemical Crystallizer then outputs crystals to Chemical Injection Chamber then outputs shards to Purification Chamber then outputs clumps to Crusher then outputs dirty dusts to Enrichment Chamber then outputs clean dust to Smelter."
	]
	quest.3C49F2EEDCCAF1DF.title: "Ore Factory: Tier 4"
	quest.3C59084FEF875C41.quest_desc: ["Washing Factory is a multi-recipe processing factory. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify recipe locking, shared-input contamination, byproducts, energy demand and full-output shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.3C59FB74C4ABFDB2.quest_desc: ["Commontly found in the jungles. Those majestic birds fly high and remind us that not all flying creatures are bad (dragons)."]
	quest.3CA5DFF1105281D6.quest_desc: [
		"This is a multiblock battery."
		"You can input and output FE using a small connector."
	]
	quest.3CA5DFF1105281D6.quest_subtitle: "Big battery"
	quest.3CCB560EC216F826.quest_desc: ["Conductive Alloy Ingot is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3CE5A863271DF6D2.quest_desc: ["Potion Brewer is a experience or enchantment processor. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify XP ownership, fluid conversion, enchantment extraction, invalid-input quarantine and duplication prevention; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.3CED53CE6C425AD2.quest_desc: [
		"The &ePackager&r is the machine responsible for turning real items into &6Recipe Packages&r."
		""
		"These packages are later processed by an &eUnpackager&r to complete crafting or processing."
		""
		"The Packager &crequires power&r to operate."
		""
		"&eHow the Packager Works&r"
		""
		"• Insert an encoded &ePackage Recipe Holder&r"
		"• The Packager reads the available recipes"
		"• Items are taken from inventories or networks"
		"• Matching items are bundled into &6Recipe Packages&r"
		"• Requires an &3AE2&r channel"
		""
		"Created packages are &eejected&r into adjacent inventories by default."
		""
		"Inputs can be extracted from the &etop side&r."
		""
		"&ePackaging Modes&r"
		""
		"The Packager supports different matching modes:"
		""
		"• &eRequire Exact&r"
		"  – Only creates a package if the inventory exactly matches the recipe"
		""
		"• &eRequire Disjoint&r"
		"  – Creates a package only if items do not overlap"
		"  – Falls back to &eRequire Exact&r if needed"
		""
		"• &eFirst Match&r"
		"  – Creates the first package that can be made from the available items"
		""
		"&eWhy Use the Packager?&r"
		""
