	quest.4016DCA58E347F31.quest_desc: ["Conduit Binder is a multi-service conduit or routing component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify service type, insert-extract direction, filter exactness, channel priority, redstone mode and loop prevention; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.40189B0631062098.quest_desc: ["Welcome to the Rise of Be.. I mean Ice and Fire! Since the fall of the Obsidian Kingdom dragons have started to dominate the overworld. Their scales are harder than metal, their fire burns whole civilizations and their hunger? Immeasurable. Now it is your time to bring the end of this catastrophy. The Overworld needs your help. Gear up and arise Dragon Master!"]
	quest.40392CF41E5B333F.quest_desc: ["Generator is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
