		"Create Stuff 'N Additions is a mod that uses the resources of Create to offer a new set of equipment, tools and gadget! "
		""
		"Equipments that increase your physical abilities (Your Strength or Mining Speed) but also give you new ways to move like floating, bouncing and even flying! Depending on your type of equipment (brass, andesite or copper) you will need different fuels such as steam (using water and fuel), heat energy (using fuel) or hydraulic energy (using water)! "
		""
		"This mod also adds a lot of recipes that make certain Minecraft items (Chainmail Armor, Coral, Netherrack, Crying Obsidian and Magma Cream...) craftable with the new ways added by Create such as haunting and filling!"
	]
	quest.41AED1C20749E824.quest_desc: ["Infinite Logistical Transporter is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.41D1344A31FEA6DF.quest_desc: ["Kanthal Coil is a machine-structure or electromechanical component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify previous-tier ancestry, material forms, motor or pump tier, reusable molds and continuous component stocking; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.41E91ED150046688.quest_subtitle: "You can use Mystical Agriculture!"
	quest.41EB0C570FC54F43.quest_desc: [
		"&aChemical Tanks&r are used to store &7Gases&r."
		""
		"They can be placed as a block and can interact with &dPressurized Tubes&r."
		""
		"They come in the four tiers, each tier being double the capacity and output rate of its predecessor."
	]
	quest.41F93E64432175D5.quest_desc: ["Store large amounts of fluid in a single block. Stack them up for even more capacity practical and good looking."]
	quest.41F93E64432175D5.quest_subtitle: "The Tank is a 3x3x5 multi-block used for storing liquids"
	quest.41F93E64432175D5.title: "&aTank"
	quest.4204702AA6FBF40B.quest_desc: [
		"The Chargepad is a wireless electric charging station. Any rechargeable items you have in your inventory will be charged while standing on it."
		""
		"The Chargepad can recharge any item that requires any form of energy. It also functions as the deployment and teleportation point for your Robit."
	]
	quest.42125A0E7E0AAFAF.quest_desc: ["The most powerful armor in the mod, making you virtually immortal!"]
	quest.42125A0E7E0AAFAF.quest_subtitle: "Not for long..."
	quest.421851D4D39910DB.quest_desc: [
		"Affects the bee’s max health."
		""
		"The best being Strong."
	]
	quest.421851D4D39910DB.title: "Endurance"
	quest.42195C45933ACA1E.quest_desc: ["Welcome to Create: Central Kitchen, a mod offering more tools and methods to automate food processing for other mods in Create."]
	quest.421EA2CE61003DA1.quest_desc: ["Allows the player to fly, move and swim faster. Works with fuel."]
	quest.4236B9F071BE18F3.quest_desc: [
		"The Rotary Condensentrator (pronounced \"con-DEN-sen-traitor\") is used for converting substances between liquid and gaseous forms at a rate of 1:1. It has two modes: Decondensentrating, which turns Liquids into Gases, and Condensentrating, which turns Gases into Liquids."
		""
		"In Decondensentrating mode:"
		""
		"Liquid→Gas"
		"Water→Water Vapor"
		"Liquid Sulfuric Acid→Sulfuric Acid"
		"Liquid Hydrogen Chloride→Hydrogen Chloride"
		"Liquid Oxygen→Oxygen"
		"Liquid Hydrogen→Hydrogen"
		"Liquid Ethylene→Ethylene"
		"Liquid Chlorine→Chlorine"
		"Liquid Sulfur Dioxide→Sulfur Dioxide"
		"Liquid Sulfur Trioxide→Sulfur Trioxide"
		"Brine→Gaseous Brine"
		"Liquid Lithium→Lithium"
		"and the opposite is true in Condensentrating mode."
		""
		"Extract liquids with Mechanical Pipe by setting them to \"pull\" (use a Configurator and Shift+Right click the outer edges of the pipe)."
	]
	quest.4266BF7FCE3B4330.quest_desc: ["Cogwheel / Large Cogwheel is a kinetic transmission component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify rotation direction, RPM ratio, stress capacity, branch isolation, reverse state and visible diagnostics; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4266BF7FCE3B4330.title: "Cogwheel / Large Cogwheel — Kinetic Acceptance"
	quest.4276B941670CE0E2.quest_desc: [
		"P2P tunnels are a way to move things like items, fluids, redstone signals, power, light, and channels around a network without them directly interacting with the network. There are many variants of P2P tunnel but each only transports its specific type of thing. They essentially act like portals that directly connect two block faces at range. They are not bi-directional, there are defined inputs and outputs."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"There are many types of P2P tunnel. Only the ME P2P tunnel is directly craftable, the others are made by right-clicking other P2P tunnels with certain items:"
		""
		"ME P2P tunnels are selected by right-clicking with any cable."
		"Redstone P2P tunnels are selected by right-clicking with a variety of redstone components."
		"Item P2P tunnels are selected by right-clicking with a chest or hopper."
		"Fluid P2P tunnels are selected by right-clicking with a bucket or bottle."
		"Energy P2P tunnels are selected by right-clicking with almost any energy-containing item."
		"Light P2P tunnels are selected by right-clicking with a torch or glowstone"
		"Some tunnel types have quirks. For instance, ME P2P tunnels' channels cannot pass through other ME P2P tunnels, and Energy P2P tunnels indirectly extract a 2.5% tax on FE flowing through themselves by increasing their energy draw."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"The most common use case of P2P tunnels is using a ME P2P tunnel to compact the density of channel transport. Instead of a bundle of dense cable, a single dense cable can be used to carry many channels around."
	]
	quest.4291A72FF87220D5.quest_desc: [
		"There is also an inverted version of the toggle bus that &ndisables&r the connection when a &credstone&r signal is supplied."
		""
		"When &credstone&r signal supplied the part &nenables&r the connection, &6ME Inverted Toggle Bus&r provides the &nreverse&r behavior by &ndisabling&r the connection instead."
	]
	quest.42951D14ADCD9332.quest_desc: ["Cod N Chips is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.42A3D1BBCF05AEF9.quest_desc: ["Has &einfinite storage&r for a &bliquid&r."]
	quest.42BF0D7E017F718B.quest_desc: ["Fluix Crystal is a crystal and network-material production step in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify crystal source, charging or growth time, batch buffer and contamination-free conversion; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.42CBFE605060FF20.quest_desc: ["Copper Cell / Copper Pylon / Copper Plinth / Export is a factory multiblock foundation. A Woot factory may reproduce ordinary drops after legitimate progression, but it must never replace first discovery, boss mastery or unique capability rewards.","Acceptance: verify validated layout, controller and heart placement, tier matching, chunk boundaries, restart state and safe disassembly; run a representative bounded batch, record power, consumables, cycle time and output, and prove that random quest rewards, alternate shards, spawner data, EMC, neural models or loot-table aliases cannot automate a restricted encounter."]
	quest.42CBFE605060FF20.title: "Copper Cell / Copper Pylon / Copper Plinth / Export — Factory Legitimacy"
	quest.42D6CC67AB29D7DA.quest_desc: ["Digital Circuit is a industrial control-circuit tier in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify previous circuit tier, board and wire supply, clean-room or machine requirement, batch yield and stage authority; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.42D7C8CD8E6F5CD7.quest_desc: ["&e- 20 Max Spawn Delay&r - faster spawns."]
	quest.42DF944251E8538F.quest_desc: ["Neutron Collector is a neutronium production component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify collector count, passive production rate, chunk availability, buffer capacity and fair scaling without manual waiting; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.42F50CE7FE715583.quest_desc: [" "]
	quest.42F50CE7FE715583.title: "&aUpgrading Our Magical Storage&r"
	quest.430475E11D259B74.quest_desc: [
		"The Stone Smeltery is where the Stone Smelter will smelt cobblestone into stone, stone bricks into cracked stone bricks, clay balls into bricks, clay blocks into terracotta, terracotta into glazed terracotta, all types of stone into all types of smooth stone, and logs into charcoal. They can also pop chorus fruits! "
		""
		"Be sure to teach the Stone Smelter recipes needed by your colony. Also, be sure to set a fuel type. "
	]
	quest.430475E11D259B74.quest_subtitle: "Build a Stone Smelter"
	quest.436231715C11E3BA.quest_desc: ["Scattered across the wilds, small bands of Illagers set up camp beneath their distinctive purple tents. Though their supplies are meager and their loot scarce, their presence is a warning, the Illagers’ reach grows wider with every outpost."]
	quest.436231715C11E3BA.quest_subtitle: "Find an Illager Campsite"
	quest.4378B53C7BB2D518.quest_desc: [
		"To begin generating massive amounts"
		"of power, &aShift + Right-Click&r an &eEternal"
		"Generator&r with an &5Motorola&r to link"
		"them. Once linked, place the &5Motorola&r"
		"into a &4Pandora's Box&r."
		""
		"The &4Pandora's Box&r will then bleed off"
		"the \"overload\" from all linked Eternal"
		"&9Generators&r every minute. Each unit of"
		"overload grants a permanent"
		"generation increase of &e1 FE/t&r."
		"Additionally, you can further boost"
		"energy production by supplying XP"
		"directly into the &4Pandora's Box&r."
	]
	quest.4378B53C7BB2D518.quest_subtitle: "The Ultimate Energy Solution"
	quest.439600B9E9FC5C6E.quest_desc: ["Construction Sticks allow you to place multiple blocks at once, up to 1024 at a time, extending your build in the direction you're facing. You can upgrade your stick to enhance its abilities, making construction faster and more efficient."]
	quest.439600B9E9FC5C6E.title: "Construction sticks"
	quest.439AB4ACFC0FF768.title: "Iesnium Sacrificial Bowl / Dark Iesnium Sacrificial Bowl — Ritual Acceptance"
	quest.439C6C61A5263D31.quest_desc: [
		"Go to the Bedrock level."
		""
		"Place a obsidian above it, leaving one block space in between."
		""
		"Throw as much redstone dust in the gap left by the Bedrock and Obsidian as you want."
		""
		"Left-click the Obsidian. The Obsidian will crush the Redstone Dust against the Bedrock and create Flux!"
	]
	quest.439C6C61A5263D31.quest_subtitle: "Flux Networks lets you send, receive, and store energy across dimensions without cables."
	quest.439C6C61A5263D31.title: "&fFlux"
	quest.439D48E9647FC8C2.quest_desc: ["Bronze Boiler is a steam-generation or conversion component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify water reserve, fuel or heat input, steam output, pressure-safe buffer, turbine demand and clean shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.43ABE0538875B85B.quest_desc: ["Matter Transmitter / Matter Receiver / Dialing Device is a matter teleportation network component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify destination ownership, transmitter-receiver pairing, energy cost, safety check, unloaded destination and recovery from failed travel; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.43B97CC9BC94CD24.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to fly freely in cost of RF."
	quest.43D2DA2B87AADDF5.quest_desc: ["Chalk White Impure / Chalk White is a ritual layout and execution component in Occultism. Its value comes from a correct ritual, a bounded spirit contract or a controlled dimensional system rather than from merely possessing the item.","Acceptance: verify pentacle pattern, chalk tier, bowl placement, central activation, consumed ingredients, chunk boundaries and safe cancellation; perform a representative ritual, spirit task or storage cycle, record ingredients, duration, capacity and recovery, and close quest-reward, trade, loot, EMC, miner, possession and alternate-ritual shortcuts."]
	quest.43D2DA2B87AADDF5.quest_subtitle: "Your First Chalk"
	quest.43D2DA2B87AADDF5.title: "Chalk White Impure / Chalk White — Ritual Acceptance"
	quest.43D31DAC4737005E.quest_subtitle: "Byproduct of coke oven"
	quest.43DB398322EF99BD.quest_desc: ["Steel Alloy Smelter is a cross-mod industrial integration component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material identity, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.43E02E5DBDE6F0D2.quest_desc: ["An industrial structure used to safely burn excess gases and byproducts. It helps manage waste output in large-scale factories, ensuring cleaner and more efficient production systems."]
	quest.43E216268701FCD6.quest_desc: ["The 16384k Fluid Storage Part is used to craft the 16384k Fluid Storage Disk."]
	quest.43E4EE94BB396A7C.quest_desc: ["Used to make rods and wires."]
	quest.43E8912CB307E421.quest_desc: ["Great! We can store items virtually, but how do we see what is on the network? \\\\n \\\\n To access the system, you'll need to create a &9Grid&r. The Grid is the most basic form of 'Display' for the items in your inventory."]
	quest.43E8912CB307E421.title: "Accessing Our Network Storage"
	quest.43EF5513A1C52A37.quest_desc: ["Thermopneumatic Processing Plant is a oil, heat or plastic processing component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify temperature window, fluid separation, heat source, output tanks, byproduct routing and clean cooldown; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.43F28CD6CB3D6523.title: "&eAdvanced Crafting&r"
	quest.43FBFDBCDB69E7EE.quest_desc: ["Portable Teleporter is a remote mining, chunk or teleportation capability in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify target filters, radius, replacement mode, chunk ownership, energy cost, destination safety and blacklist of protected or gated resources; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.441202CC380854DF.quest_desc: ["Quantum Multi Threader is a cross-mod AE2 integration component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, component data and the absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.4415C9F8DA2D7E68.quest_desc: [
		"When your &2Reinforced Reactor&r turns its coolent to &7vapor,&r you can send it to a &aturbine&r to &egenerate power&r and turn it into &bwater.&r"
		""
		"You can make &bturbines&l&r 5x5x10&r with &abasic parts&r, but much &ebigger&r with &6reinforced parts&r."
		""
		"Just like the &creactor,&r you will need to place the &bturbine&r controller in the wall."
	]
	quest.4415C9F8DA2D7E68.title: "Turbines"
	quest.442BB17AE7AC4936.quest_desc: ["A fragment of &dinfinite power&r, with more you can create the&a very best&r this &buniverse&r has to offer."]
	quest.4431F1144F0C5C0C.quest_desc: ["Crystal Matrix Ingot is a endgame structural material in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify full convergence recipe, previous-tier components, antimatter or draconic dependencies, EMC zeroing and scalable batch production; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.4434D7B66521D69A.quest_desc: ["Pressurized Tubes are used to transport Gases."]
	quest.4434D7B66521D69A.title: "&aBasic Pressurized Tube"
	quest.445ACC0E40DB3D96.quest_desc: ["A partially assembled electrical component awaiting final processing. It’s used in crafting complete resistors and other advanced electronic parts."]
	quest.4487635C822086E0.quest_desc: ["Using &bIce shards&r from &cmars&r ore, these machine will generate &bCryofuel&r, a more efficient fuel source then &6oil.&r"]
	quest.44881E39AB1D62AA.quest_desc: ["The &9Crafter&r is how we store patterns for our Network to know how to craft items. Once a recipe is placed into the crafter, you'll be able to 'Request' an item to be crafted from your Grid. You can do this by hitting CTRL+Shift when clicking on the item you have a recipe for to bring up the crafting GUI. \\\\n \\\\n This block can also be placed facing a machine to use &6Processing Patterns&r. For example, if you point the Crafter at a Furnace, you can put a recipe inside for a recipe you need a furnace for, like smelting raw processors. As long as the crafter is attached to your system and the Furnace has an importer attached to it, the Crafter will allow you to request the smelted version of the Processor!"]
	quest.44881E39AB1D62AA.quest_subtitle: "Automated crafting!"
	quest.44881E39AB1D62AA.title: "Crafter"
	quest.4489EFA2FFA1584C.quest_desc: ["Another rocket that allows you to reach more planets"]
	quest.449C41A3AFBBE8E9.quest_desc: ["Steel becomes an infrastructure material and must be produced in planned batches rather than only when a recipe blocks progress.","Acceptance: provide coke input, slag handling and storage for at least one stack of steel output; the furnace must run three cycles unattended."]
	quest.449C41A3AFBBE8E9.title: "Blast Furnace — Steel Baseline"
	quest.449FA7FE3CBD2102.title: "Netherite Cell / Netherite Pylon / Netherite Plinth — Factory Legitimacy"
	quest.44B0E00B7465F278.quest_desc: ["Enchanters Shield is a specialized Ars Nouveau component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify its Source, spell, ritual, entity or automation contract and a safe invalid-input or interrupted state; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.44B1B147CDAC4E36.quest_desc: ["This gives X-Ray vision for mobs, highlighting them from afar to make it easier to spot them."]
	quest.44CD6DD20F51123F.quest_desc: ["Staff Of Travelling is a travel and teleportation component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify destination ownership, range or dimensional rule, energy cost, safe arrival and recovery from a lost anchor; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.44D115281B0BFB75.quest_desc: ["Whispers speak of a &9flying vessel&r that hovers above the world, shimmering with strange energy. Few dare approach, for those who return tell of eerie lights, warped corridors, and guardians not of this realm. Seek it out, if you dare—and uncover the secrets hidden within its metallic shell."]
	quest.44D115281B0BFB75.quest_subtitle: "Find a Giant Mushroom"
	quest.44DA7BE0F0E3E529.quest_subtitle: "The Nether!"
	quest.44DA7BE0F0E3E529.title: "Visit The Nether"
	quest.44E8D5277063565A.quest_desc: ["A monitoring device that measures and displays the voltage within an electrical circuit. Useful for diagnosing power fluctuations and ensuring your systems run at optimal efficiency."]
	quest.4512B97451C2221F.quest_desc: ["Mechanical Arm is a factory sensing or control component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify input signal, target selection, priority, stock threshold, wireless channel ownership and safe default state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.451517C833D25E1A.quest_desc: ["Crafting Core is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.453B1A596BE686ED.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is Flux Crafting?&r"
		""
		"&eFlux Crafting&r is a high-end crafting recipe type used to automate recipes from the &eEnder Crafting Table&r."
		""
		"It is designed for &elate-game&r and &eendgame&r crafting."
		""
		"&eHow It Works&r"
		""
		"• Uses the &eFlux Package Crafter&r"
		"• Supports recipes from the &eEnder Crafting Table&r"
		"• Crafted items are &eejected&r into adjacent inventories"
		""
		"The Flux Package Crafter &crequires power&r to operate."
		""
		"&eFlux Alternators&r"
		""
		"Flux Crafting requires powered &eFlux Alternators&r."
		""
		"• Alternators must be placed within a &a7×7×7&r area"
		"• All alternators must be &apowered&r"
		"• Missing power will prevent crafting"
		""
		"&eUse Cases&r"
		""
		"• Automating Ender Crafting Table recipes"
		"• Late-game item production"
		"• High-tier PackagedAuto setups"
		"• Integration with &3AE2&r factories"
		""
		"&eWhy Use Flux Crafting?&r"
		""
		"• Enables fully automated endgame crafting"
		"• Handles extremely complex recipes"
		"• Removes manual Ender Crafting"
		"• Perfect for large-scale automation"
	]
	quest.453B1A596BE686ED.title: "&eFlux Crafting&r"
	quest.453C36B78EB4B311.quest_desc: ["&eBreak down&r &denchanted gear&r and extract valuable materials. It’s the magical version of recycling. Great for clearing out that chest of \"almost good\" loot."]
	quest.454812A6E386C6D0.quest_subtitle: "sneaky sneaky, they can't find this subtitle"
	quest.454F315FF637EA84.quest_subtitle: "Big Patter Storage!!"
	quest.454FF6E2926163F7.quest_desc: ["MI Factory Checkpoint 63F7 is a industrial-factory design checkpoint in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify documented voltage tree, steam and fluid budgets, component stock, byproduct routing, failure isolation and restart procedure; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4561FE8367CD8216.quest_desc: ["Item Draconic Proj Anti Immune is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.456E6532B7FBA2EA.quest_subtitle: "\"The power of the sun in the palm of my hands.\""
	quest.459AA2AD67CA6AAA.quest_desc: ["Mix aluminum and crimsite."]
	quest.45B26D389684EF9B.quest_desc: ["Cosmic Thermodynamic Conductor is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.45BA5B8A785E1B82.quest_desc: ["Wrench is a configuration, diagnostic or planning tool in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify exact configuration effect, copied data, ownership, safe reset, replacement after loss and use in diagnosing the production line; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.45C02BA617A092FC.quest_desc: [
		"The Pumpjack allou you to get the oil that is in the chunk."
		"First, check with the Oil Finder if oil is in the chunk. "
		""
		"Then place the Pumpjack and start pumping oil."
	]
	quest.45CEF843FA33853F.quest_desc: ["You can grab and move blocks and launch them into the air!"]
	quest.45D20904723662F8.quest_desc: [
		"You cannot replicate what you do not understand. Take your Scanner and use it on a mob (Right-Click). This will add the entity's data to your personal &a&lPlayer Index&r."
		"{image:minformax:textures/quests/scanner.png width:190 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.45D20904723662F8.quest_subtitle: "First steps"
	quest.45DDCE3FF2E6A4F8.quest_subtitle: "Pulsar Fragment mixed with Obsidian Matrix"
	quest.45F0194CF3DCA5DD.quest_desc: ["Lignite Coal is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.45FEB8DE88CE4920.quest_desc: ["Basic Crafting Injector is a fusion-crafting infrastructure component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify injector tier, symmetric placement, recipe energy, ingredient retention and restart after interrupted charging; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.45FF08E4DB6F7F0E.quest_desc: ["An upgraded crafter that holds more patterns and has an increased crafting speed."]
	quest.45FF08E4DB6F7F0E.title: "Iron Crafter"
	quest.46004D01A142777E.quest_desc: ["Smart Fluid Pipe is a fluid logistics or storage component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify flow direction, pump speed, tank reserve, infinite-source boundary, moving-interface contact and overflow; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.462D63532B4C7D54.quest_desc: ["Ring Of Lesser Discount is a equipment augmentation component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify compatible slot, stacking rule, exact capability gain, removal cost and interaction with other accessory mods; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.46315A83942FFE6E.quest_desc: ["Energy Core / Energy Core Stabilizer / Energy Pylon is a mass-energy storage structure component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify valid multiblock tier, pylon mode, transfer bottleneck, reserve policy and safe expansion without losing stored energy; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.466A8F97AB868986.quest_desc: ["A more &6powerful&r version of the &avanilla&r coal also used in &bvarious&r recipes."]
	quest.469641436BC858D3.quest_desc: ["MI Factory Checkpoint 58D3 is a industrial-factory design checkpoint in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify documented voltage tree, steam and fluid budgets, component stock, byproduct routing, failure isolation and restart procedure; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.469641436BC858D3.title: "MI Factory Checkpoint 58D3 — Factory Acceptance"
	quest.46AB23E922C51517.quest_desc: ["A better tier of transporter with more storage."]
	quest.46AB23E922C51517.title: "&9Elite Logistical Transporter"
	quest.46BCDA0F17AE2073.quest_desc: ["Draconium Chest is a tier-defining draconic material or core in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify material origin, previous-tier core, awakening or Chaos prerequisite, batch size and reusable progression permissions; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.46EBE6B0E06D750D.quest_desc: ["Used with &6Spatial IO Port&r to store spatial regions."]
	quest.470B1F84D01E4F7A.quest_desc: ["Charged Certus Quartz is crafted by insterting an Certus Quartz Crystal into the Charger, and powering it."]
	quest.47106CE1937C4340.quest_desc: ["To get an HDPE Sheet, place 3 HDPE Pellets in an Enrichment Chamber."]
	quest.4722157BC8D3B965.quest_desc: ["Bronze Cutting Machine is a early steam-machine component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify steam supply, input and output separation, recipe duration, exhaust or byproducts and unattended stack processing; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.472C30DE79844F67.quest_subtitle: "Primordial matter from the universe."
	quest.472EBB6F6C957211.quest_subtitle: "“Beauty never dies.”"
	quest.47358ADC1470C82A.quest_subtitle: "Get Ready for a Trip"
	quest.47358ADC1470C82A.title: "&cDemon Fruit&r"
	quest.47379E2C3068985D.quest_desc: ["Alloy Smelter is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4745152F6FF242B3.quest_desc: [
		"When the reactor &o&6burns&r up fuel, it creates &o&dwaste&r that you will want to collect. That is what the other &3Solid Access Port&r is for!"
		""
		"Make sure to set it to &o&coutput&r, then &o&9pipe it&r into some type of storage."
	]
	quest.4745152F6FF242B3.title: "The Waste"
	quest.4750465C622D4C63.quest_desc: [
		"You won't have troubles finding them, as their smell is horrendous. Their brains aren't well developed but they a punch."
		"Their skin is tough, might be useful for making some sort of armor.."
	]
	quest.4752CD3375835EC9.quest_desc: ["Smelted &bVibranium ore&r."]
	quest.475B63AF0E87E318.quest_desc: ["Supremium Watering Can is a Supremium watering tool. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify manual learning use, area of effect, automation restrictions and the point at which the task must move to bounded infrastructure; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.475DC864A0BC0F1F.quest_desc: ["Steel Upgrade is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.476755275B948A5F.quest_desc: [
		"&cReactors&r can also be used to &o&bheat up&r coolants like &o&bwater&r to create &o&bvapor&r, like &7Steam&r."
		""
		"To do this, you'll need to build a &2Reinforced Reactor&r. I'd also suggest on it being bigger than a &o&b3x3x3&r."
		""
		"To input a &o&bcoolant&r to the &creactor,&r you'll need two &9Forge Fluid Port&r. This will port in &nany fluids&r into the reactor. This will also be used to &o&bexport the vapor&r created in the reactor."
		""
		"If you want, you can create a &eMekanism Fluid Port&r to convert the &o&bfluid steam&r into the mekanism &o&bgas steam&r instead."
	]
	quest.476755275B948A5F.title: "The Actively Cooled Reactor"
	quest.476816C0C7B4205A.quest_desc: ["Has 2 slots for Constructing."]
	quest.47783AA841823B0E.quest_desc: ["Coordinate Selector is a travel and teleportation component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify destination ownership, range or dimensional rule, energy cost, safe arrival and recovery from a lost anchor; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.47783AA841823B0E.quest_subtitle: "May be broken"
	quest.4791FC0A2E834D85.quest_desc: ["Dark magics linger in the depths of these dungeons, woven into items, halls, and even the very air. Power awaits the bold, but so do twisted fates for the careless."]
	quest.4791FC0A2E834D85.quest_subtitle: "Find a Bathhouse"
	quest.47A8E5DC11E846C5.quest_desc: ["Forge Hammer is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.47ACCCE2F34C5B99.quest_desc: [
		"To use it, items are dropped into the top of the multiblock structure, and can be removed from the black item port at the base. It does not have a GUI instead, the crushing wheels rotate while it is working. It can also be used to crush mobs, outputting the corresponding drops. If the Crusher is ever fed an item that it cannot process, it will destroy that item."
		""
		"Power is input via the copper looking dot, and the machine can be turned off by applying a redstone signal to the red dot on the front of the machine face."
	]
	quest.47ACCCE2F34C5B99.title: "Crusher"
	quest.47BABC95C5A372B8.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Halitosis is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.47C1108CF46C81FC.quest_desc: ["Aluminum Drill is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.47C4B38EB962CEC8.quest_desc: [
		"When both the&a Hood&r and &bCloak of Darkness&r are equipped, a &emeter&r appears above the hotbar. This &emeter&r slowly &6fills over time&r, depicting a &cbleak red eye&r. &eOnce full&r, it glows &cred&r with a bright white pupil if the player is in &6light level&r &l14&r &bor lower&r, indicating the &dspecial ability&r is ready."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Pressing &lG&r while the &emeter&r is glowing activates &0Darkness Incarnate&r for &l10&r seconds, hiding the &emeter.&r This effect grants the user &6increased speed&r and transforms them into a &cdark form&r."
		""
		"After the effect ends, the &emeter&r &areappears&r empty and&d begins refilling&r."
	]
	quest.47C4B38EB962CEC8.title: "Darkness set"
	quest.47CEFA06392C4211.quest_desc: ["The expansion box is a must have! since it increases the max amount of bees from 3 to 5 and allows you to install upgrades in the hive."]
	quest.47CEFA06392C4211.quest_subtitle: "Place on top of a Beehive"
	quest.47CEFA06392C4211.title: "The Expansion Box"
	quest.47D1190F36C49C34.quest_desc: ["A &dportable&r &astorage unit&r which can be opened with &lRight-Click,&r also holds &emany items&r."]
	quest.47D1190F36C49C34.title: "Alchemical bags"
	quest.47E07B4997E901E3.quest_desc: ["Naquadah Hohlraum is a fusion-reactor ignition or structure component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify D-T fuel production, laser charge, ignition sequence, injection rate, passive and active output, coolant loop and restart after flameout; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.47F7A992EB772464.quest_desc: ["Smart Filter is a Woot factory component. A Woot factory may reproduce ordinary drops after legitimate progression, but it must never replace first discovery, boss mastery or unique capability rewards.","Acceptance: verify its structural or production role, tier, power cost, consumables, output table and all restricted-drop controls; run a representative bounded batch, record power, consumables, cycle time and output, and prove that random quest rewards, alternate shards, spawner data, EMC, neural models or loot-table aliases cannot automate a restricted encounter."]
	quest.47F7A992EB772464.quest_subtitle: "woot is going on"
	quest.47F7DC87790D5064.quest_desc: ["Singularity is a late cross-dimensional networking component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify singularity production, paired ownership, chunk availability, energy reserve and loss-safe reconnection; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.480036468A6A5A4E.quest_desc: ["Combine &5White Dwarf Fragment&r, &1Neutron Star Fragment&r and &2Pulsar Fragment Dust&r to get &#FF670ERaw Star Plasma&r!"]
	quest.4821419D44F8083F.quest_desc: ["Inferium Growth Accelerator is a Inferium growth accelerator. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify vertical stacking, effective range, diminishing benefit, chunk activity and a measured limit for accelerated crop density; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.4844DEF57A2287B4.quest_desc: ["Allows you to take items and fluids from one disk into another grid's disks."]
	quest.4844DEF57A2287B4.title: "Disk Manipulator"
	quest.486457F40D2A1D29.quest_desc: ["key crafting ingredient of the mod"]
	quest.486457F40D2A1D29.title: "&fFlux Core"
	quest.4869C413646CC4CC.quest_subtitle: "Can transport anything."
	quest.4869C413646CC4CC.title: "Cables"
	quest.487D717B87795D2F.quest_desc: ["Condenser / Matter Ball is a specialized AE2 network component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify its channel, power, storage or routing contract and a safe disconnected or saturated state; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.488DBE69595F38F8.quest_desc: ["The energized smelter is your basic electric furnace that uses energy instead of fuel to smelt items."]
	quest.488DBE69595F38F8.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism's Powered Furnace"
	quest.48A3A6BBE4725AD2.quest_desc: [
		"&dWhere raw ingredients melt into magical madness. It’s less cooking... more candy alchemy&f."
		""
		"Conversion Crucibles have a 100% chance to generate within Licowitch Towers. Only 1 Conversion Crucible will spawn in each Licowitch Tower."
		""
		"The Conversion Crucible has the magical ability to change the biome around it if the correct ingredients are tossed into it."
		""
		"To start, the player must eat a Biome Treat in the biome they want while starving, binding the Biome Treat to that biome. Then the cruciable will show a \"hologram\" of an item to throw inside it.After all items are deposited into the crucible, the Crucible will convert the surrounding area into the wanted biome in a 12x12 range."
	]
	quest.48AC8545D66B71B7.quest_desc: ["Congratulations! Getting the builder upgraded is an important step. The Builder can only build or upgrade any other hut up to the level of their own hut. So, in order for the Builder to upgrade any building, the Builder’s Hut must be upgraded first. Then the Builder will be able to upgrade any other building(s)."]
	quest.48AC8545D66B71B7.quest_subtitle: "Level Up a Builders Hut"
	quest.48BF71269DEA1AB1.quest_desc: ["Supremium Farmland is a crop-tier farmland. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify hydration, crop-tier compatibility, harvest area, replacement stock and the effect of acceleration on server load; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.48E3F10CDF8AE115.quest_desc: ["&9Ad Astra!&r &7(To the Stars)&r is a &dspace mod&r with a focus on &ctechnology&r, &btravel&r and &aexploration&r. We've got everything you need to become an astronaut: &erockets,&r &bspace suits,&r &cspace stations&r and &cmachines&r. Why not take a stroll on the &bMoon&r? Build a self-sustaining bunker on &cMars?&r Go mining on &eVenus?&r the &9Milky Way&r is at your disposal!"]
	quest.48E3F10CDF8AE115.title: "Welcom to Ad Astra"
	quest.48F4D5E88C907E51.quest_desc: ["Crystal Axe is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.4905CD63121F13EA.quest_desc: ["Automatically refills gadgets and armor that use fuel."]
	quest.490628CE108A833A.quest_desc: [
		"The Courier runs back and forth from the Warehouse to all the worker huts in your colony, delivering materials to workers and putting finished products in the Warehouse. The level of the Courier’s Hut will dictate how many items the Courier can carry and the amount of requests they can keep track of at a time."
		""
		"Courier’s don’t just work on their own. You must build a warehouse, and assign the courier to work at a warehouse. "
		""
		"Note: If you have multiple Warehouses, Couriers will only see the items in the Warehouse they are assigned to. This is helpful in the late game when troubleshooting requests."
	]
	quest.490628CE108A833A.quest_subtitle: "Build a Courier Hut"
	quest.491C1EDC53F1CCED.quest_desc: ["Arcanist Robes is a magical equipment tier in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify mana or Source benefit, thread slots, defensive statistics, mobility interaction and repair path; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.4932FAE86B6262BE.quest_desc: ["Entity Detector is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.493B9FC17C3CF3CA.quest_desc: [
		"The Rabbit Hutch is where the Rabbit Herder will raise and butcher rabbits. You will have to capture and bring in two rabbits to the Rabbit Hutch, as the Rabbit Herder will not catch and bring in any rabbits."
		""
		" The Rabbit Herder will only keep two rabbits alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten rabbits in their holding pens."
	]
	quest.493BCE6F7191D267.quest_desc: ["Block Placer is a world interaction machine. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify area ownership, tool or block supply, protected blocks, unloaded chunks and item collection; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.49492BE19F4A1021.quest_desc: ["The 262m Fluid Storage Part is used to craft the 262m Fluid Storage Disk."]
	quest.495DCA49B4E80852.quest_desc: ["Minigun is a pressurized equipment capability item in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify air capacity, upgrade slots, active ability, recharge infrastructure, combat or mining throughput and repair path; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.495E3735F234617B.quest_subtitle: "Don't forget the upgrades for beehives and centrifuges."
	quest.495ED54AC102B1FD.quest_desc: ["Covered Dense Cable is a channel-bearing network segment in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify channel count, controller path, colour isolation, tunnel boundaries and a visible overload diagnostic; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.49793060345FB28C.quest_desc: [
		"The Cowhand’s Hut is where the Cowhand will milk, breed, and butcher cows for leather. The Cowhand will only keep two cows alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten cows in their holding pens to breed and butcher."
		""
		"Note: &eYou must bring your own cows to the pen.&r"
	]
	quest.497A879543460123.quest_desc: ["Relay Splitter is a Source or item logistics component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify link direction, range, priority, destination capacity, visible diagnostics and loop prevention; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.4980C231ECDB0BF2.quest_desc: ["Steel Drill is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.499A392498931C69.quest_desc: ["A glowing glob of concentrated sweetness. It hums with unnatural energy and the scent of a thousand desserts."]
	quest.49E36D3C3092346E.quest_desc: [
		"The IO Port allows you to rapidly fill or empty storage cells to or from network storage."
		""
		"It can be rotated with a Certus Quartz Wrench."
		""
		"The IO Port can be set to move the cell to the output slots when the cell is empty, full, or when the work is done."
		"If a Redstone Card is inserted, there will be options for various redstone conditions"
		"In the center of the GUI, there is an arrow to set which direction to transfer items, from the cell to network storage, or from storage to the cell."
		"Upgrades"
		"The IO Port supports the following upgrades:"
		""
		"Acceleration Card increases the amount of stuff moved per operation"
		"Redstone Card adds redstone control, allowing active on high signal, low signal, or once per pulse"
	]
	quest.49ED53D162564102.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Rocket is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.4A06EDE9CD0C65D9.quest_desc: ["Here you will be able to restore the knowledge of the Obsidian Kingdom with manuscripts."]
	quest.4A198E875A6B0A64.quest_desc: ["An upgraded crafter that holds more patterns and has an increased crafting speed."]
	quest.4A198E875A6B0A64.title: "&eGold Crafter&r"
	quest.4A19E3387DBD7FB0.quest_desc: [
		"The Winder consumes spools of wire to wrap around items."
		""
		"Crafting recipes that use the Winder (such as generators or potentiometers) will always use exactly the amount required."
		""
		"For winding magnetic coils, a winding percentage can be set out of 1000 turns, with a minimum of 100 turns (10% = 100 turns). Any turns beyond 100 are used only for transformer coils. The remaining turns on the wire spool can be checked using Goggles."
		""
		"Items cannot be extracted manually (except for the wire spool), and there is no filter for unfinished items. For manual winding, use a Funnel and a Lever."
	]
	quest.4A22534045841AE4.quest_desc: ["Low current"]
	quest.4A47E558AD90EB64.quest_desc: ["Provides an interface to access two inventories simultaneously. Also comes with filter slots to quickly sort incoming items."]
	quest.4A538D3FEC4D94D3.quest_desc: ["Item Draconic Energy Link is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4A5466E364B85AEF.quest_desc: ["Ingots Steel is a cross-mod industrial integration component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material identity, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4A59DF02128DA9F3.quest_desc: ["Provides high &dArcana&r and some useful &cQuanta,&r while &6minimizing negative effects&r. Ideal for chasing &drare&r &denchantments&r without risking too much &cchaos&r in the mix."]
	quest.4A6FD039DFAD7464.quest_desc: [
		"&ePushes&r &dmagnetic blocks&r toward the magnet while powered with &credstone.&r"
		""
		"The &arange&r can be &aincreased&r and &cdecreased&r by clicking on it with &bingots&r of the &asame type (Increase)&r or the &cdifferent type (Decrease)&r."
	]
	quest.4A6FD039DFAD7464.quest_subtitle: "Craft a azure magnet"
	quest.4A7F96E62A5845C5.quest_desc: ["Mechanical Piston is a moving-contraption component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify assembly boundary, movement axis, collision and protected blocks, inventory transfer, chunk edge and safe disassembly; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4A859875AFC89A13.quest_desc: ["A key mechanical component that compresses and channels energy within an engine. It’s essential for converting fuel or pressure into smooth, consistent rotational motion."]
	quest.4A961ADDC8054AA1.quest_desc: ["A magnetic device that attracts nearby items toward it using rotational energy. Perfect for automation setups where item collection needs to be fast and efficient."]
	quest.4AA150A009E904DA.quest_desc: ["Made from a &bElite Control Circuit&r this item is used in a few crafting recipes."]
	quest.4ABF0727AA569DD9.quest_desc: ["Electric Pump / Upgrade Filter is a specialized advanced Mekanism component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify its power, chemical, heat, radiation, transport, modular or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or interrupted state; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4ABF0727AA569DD9.title: "Electric Pump / Upgrade Filter — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.4AD6B31B2ACFD56E.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is the Package Recipe Holder?&r"
		""
		"The &ePackage Recipe Holder&r is the item that stores &erecipe data&r for &ePackagedAuto&r machines."
		""
		"Recipes are encoded into it using the &ePackage Recipe Encoder&r."
		""
		"&eHow It Is Used&r"
		""
		"• Insert encoded Recipe Holders into PackagedAuto machines"
		"• Machines read the stored recipes directly from the holder"
		""
		"Without a Recipe Holder, most PackagedAuto machines cannot function."
		""
		"&eManaging Recipe Holders&r"
		""
		"• &aSneak + Right-click&r an encoded holder to &cclear&r all stored recipes"
		""
		"• Place an encoded holder in a crafting grid to clear it as well"
		""
		"• Combine an encoded holder with empty holders in a crafting grid to &acopy&r all recipes"
		""
		"&eWhy It Matters&r"
		""
		"• Central storage for PackagedAuto recipes"
		"• Makes recipe reuse and duplication easy"
		"• Essential for scalable automation"
	]
	quest.4AD6B31B2ACFD56E.title: "&ePackage Recipe Holder&r"
	quest.4AD8363D7359A072.quest_desc: [
		"Your first&c basic reactor&r has a max size of &l5x5x5,&r though they &ecan be smaller&r, you can make by following these directions:"
		""
		"&lFirst:&r Make the &6walls&r and &6floor&r of &abasic Reactor Casing&r and &aGlass.&r"
		""
		"&lSecond:&r Add a &bbasic Reactor controller&r to one wall."
		""
		"&lThird:&r add &dtwo basic Reactor Solid Access Ports&r, one set to &cInlet (red)&r the other &aOutlet (green)&r you can attach &epumps&r from other mods to these."
		""
		"&lFourth:&r Add a &ebasic Reactor Active Forge Energy Power Tap&r, which will &astore&r and &apipe out&r &eenergy&r from the &creactor.&r"
		""
		"&lFifth:&r Then you want &9basic Reactor Fuel Rod&r in a &ediagonal&r pattern across the floor and build them up till &eone block&r from the roof where on top of the&9 Fuel rods&r you put &bbasic Reactor Control Rods.&r"
		""
		"Then fill in the empty spots of the roof with &aReactor casing&r. if done correctly the &etextures&r will change slightly to show it has become a &4Multi-block reactor.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"You can build &cbigger reactors&r with &9reinforced forms&r of the previously mentioned blocks instead of &abasic ones&r, also the &etaller&r a &creactor&r is, the &emore fuel&r it will use and hold while the &6energy&r it will make increases, but the &awidth&r will help it &bcool.&r"
	]
	quest.4AD8363D7359A072.title: "The First Reactor"
	quest.4AF83801E0F700E8.quest_desc: ["Shape Card Quarry is a builder or area-operation component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify shape-card bounds, chunk ownership, filter rules, energy per operation, protected blocks and output collection; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4AFF81D3D0E78255.quest_desc: ["The Washer converts dirty slurry to clean slurry and can stall the entire fivefold line when water, chemical storage or output capacity is undersized.","Acceptance: guarantee water reserve, separate dirty and clean networks, expose tank fill levels, and process a full dissolution batch without cross-contamination or manual tank clearing."]
	quest.4AFF81D3D0E78255.quest_subtitle: "Giving Ores a Bath"
	quest.4B492F4CA6EBC3E8.quest_desc: ["Found within the &aToxic caves&r, only &cdeath&r (and a new&6 cat variant&r within these caves) can stop the &cexplosion&r once it has &ebegan&r."]
	quest.4B4FD4F240F79E11.quest_desc: [
		"Saturn Info:"
		"&aGravity:&r 10.395 m/s"
		"&bOxygen:&r none"
		"&cTemperature:&r -154 °C"
	]
	quest.4B77657055E0D36A.quest_desc: ["But this one does! \\n \\nThis allows your RS system to be accessed wirelessly from any dimension."]
	quest.4B77657055E0D36A.title: "Dimension Card"
