	quest.4B81E84CAE814BA9.title: "&664k Fluid Part&r"
	quest.4B83CFF3601C34C7.quest_subtitle: "Used to make the Dimenisonal Processor"
	quest.4B8CB53818688501.quest_desc: ["Fluid Extractor is a latex and plastic production step. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify wood feed, latex rate, water supply, rubber conversion and plastic buffer; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.4B976C143EDA4317.quest_desc: ["Andesite Casing is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
