	quest.4B9E9497E44D0096.title: "Reactor Casings"
	quest.4BAA0DCA042ED9D7.quest_desc: ["Magebloom Fiber is a magical equipment tier in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify mana or Source benefit, thread slots, defensive statistics, mobility interaction and repair path; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.4BB13C80196FD034.quest_desc: ["Andesite is a cross-mod Create integration component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, conversion direction, moving-inventory state and absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
