	quest.4BBA254500807468.quest_desc: ["Its a nugget"]
	quest.4BDE773C3359D584.quest_desc: [
		"Robit is Mekanism's mechanical companion. It can act as a crafting grid, a furnace, an anvil, a chest, or simply a cute little buddy. It is immune to fire, including the Flamethrower."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"To bring your personal robotic friend into the world, you'll have to craft it. Once Robit is in your inventory, right click a Chargepad with it in hand. This will spawn Robit and assign it to the pad. Oh, and make sure the Chargepad is supplied with power. Otherwise, he won't be able to follow you around!"
		""
		"If at any time you want to pick Robit up, simply shift right-click it with a Configurator."
		""
		"Don't worry about losing your Robit as whenever it runs out of charge/health it will automatically teleport back to its charging pad. It does not have conventional health: instead, taking damage will deplete its charge. A fully charged Robit has an effective health of 100 or 50 hearts."
		""
		"When the chargepad is broken, Robit will turn into an item to be picked up. It keeps its items but it may despawn if it's not picked up."
	]
	quest.4C08C3777E037EBE.title: "Celestial Chalice / Eldritch Chalice — Ritual Acceptance"
	quest.4C09EB1987587A3E.quest_desc: ["Awakened Crafting Injector is a fusion-crafting infrastructure component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify injector tier, symmetric placement, recipe energy, ingredient retention and restart after interrupted charging; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4C0D00B5305117A1.quest_desc: ["Sentry Turret is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4C1E1604FD00EE5A.quest_desc: ["Source Gem is a Source generation or storage component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify input legality, Source per cycle, jar routing, generation radius, renewable boundary and overflow; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.4C1E1604FD00EE5A.title: "Source Gem — Arcane Acceptance"
