	quest.4C4B1602E2AFC314.quest_desc: ["An upgrade to the &cAdvanced Fluid Tank&r."]
	quest.4C57DF99E9A0BF6A.quest_desc: ["Meteorite Compass is a specialized AE2 network component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify its channel, power, storage or routing contract and a safe disconnected or saturated state; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.4C57DF99E9A0BF6A.title: "Meteorite Compass — Network Acceptance"
	quest.4C725130784DC554.quest_desc: ["Ah the dragonforge, pride of the Obsidian Kingdom. They discovered that if you let dragon breath into a forge, while there is iron inside, the outcome is dragonsteel. Each type of dragon requires its own forge. "]
	quest.4C725130784DC554.title: "Ice Dragonforge"
	quest.4C73A3B0E4396B29.quest_desc: ["Mob Imprisonment Tool is a Industrial Foregoing production component. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify its exact work area, input contract, power or fluid demand, output routing and safe shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.4C7455970DDABF24.quest_desc: ["Crystal Shovel is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.4C786266B391B772.quest_subtitle: "How can you lift this?"
	quest.4C7CD3858A2BE870.quest_desc: ["Mechanical Press is a kinetic processing machine in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify required RPM and stress, recipe isolation, input and output buffer, heat or fluid condition, byproducts and full-output shutdown; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4C80D71EE7CFD378.title: "&6Reinforced Deorum Sword \\& Blacksmith Gavel"
