	quest.4CA17B0A80020B2F.quest_desc: ["Manometer is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4CA92D60BED7D478.quest_desc: ["One of the &bpieces of gear&r crafted from the &cTelecore,&r This helmet will allow you to &astick to the roof&r if under &emagnetic blocks&r. (Like iron)"]
	quest.4CC229C23E5AC155.quest_desc: ["Energy Capacity: 16,000,000&r FE"]
	quest.4CC229C23E5AC155.quest_subtitle: "Tier 2"
	quest.4CCA40FAB3230C75.quest_desc: ["Portable Qio Dashboard is a QIO digital-storage or logistics component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify frequency ownership, item and type capacity, importer or exporter filters, remote access, overflow and recovery after frequency loss; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4CD83943865018EA.quest_desc: ["The &9Exporter&r is used to push items from your system into a block from your Network storage. \\\\n \\\\n This can be used to fill Furnaces with ores or fuel, push materials into designated chests, etc. \\\\n \\\\n You can also filter what items are pushed. Need more filter slots? Upgrade it!"]
	quest.4CD83943865018EA.quest_subtitle: "Exporting Items!"
	quest.4CD83943865018EA.title: "Exporter"
	quest.4CDB3F8E217ADC8E.quest_desc: ["A specialized metal ingot infused with magnetic properties. It’s used in crafting advanced machinery, motors, and components that rely on magnetic energy or attraction."]
	quest.4CE350628327599A.quest_desc: [
		"The &eME Level Emitter&r can indicate either the level of a specified item or the &dME Network&r energy level."
		""
		"You can set the threshold and if the&e ME Level Emitter&r will emit a redstone signal or turn it off."
		""
		"Does not require a &eChannel&r to function, if its power is lost the emitter will switch to an off state."
		""
		"These can tap into the &bcrafting system&r when a crafting card is installed, allowing you to output redstone while an item is being crafted, or even configure the system to output redstone to preform a crafting task, its important to note that you cannot mix level emitter craft via &credstone&r with &binterface patterns&r."
	]
	quest.4CEF6501FCD7D58D.quest_desc: ["A basic yet functional engine component that helps convert pressure or combustion into motion. Ideal for early-stage machinery and low-power mechanical systems."]
	quest.4CFE8B1C53B429E9.quest_desc: ["Crafter Slot Cover is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4D04830CBA2E04AF.quest_desc: ["Conduit is a multi-service conduit or routing component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify service type, insert-extract direction, filter exactness, channel priority, redstone mode and loop prevention; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4D04830CBA2E04AF.title: "Conduit — Machine-System Acceptance"
	quest.4D059A8B3F97649A.quest_desc: ["Wyvern Io Crystal / Wyvern Relay Crystal / Wyvern Wireless Crystal is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4D07B0A4A2E77CDA.quest_desc: ["&b+ 2 Max Entities&r - Max number of mobs that can be alive at one time."]
	quest.4D10C0FCFAFD5DE7.quest_desc: [
		"Now that you know what the genes are, you need to know how to get the genes. "
		""
		"When you squash a bee to get genes, you will get all of its 6 different genes. The bad news? You only get a small percentage of the gene. "
		""
		"The percentage dictates the chance that another bee has to get that gene. "
		""
		"To give genes to a different bee, combine a Honey Treat with your chosen gene(s) in a crafting grid and then Right Button on a bee to give them that trait."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Get a bee you wish to get the genes of"
		""
		"In a 3 block tall space, put a Bottler (with bottles of course) on the bottom, and a Piston facing down on top with button/lever next to it."
		""
		"Put the bee in the middle, and quickly press the lever/button, that will squish the bee into a bottler and give you Squashed Bee Material"
		""
		"Put that into a Centrifuge, and it will give you the 6 genes of the bee."
		""
		"Easy right? But remember, it will only give up to around 20% of the gene per bee, so you need to repeat the process 4-5 times."
	]
	quest.4D1A4983E9155671.quest_desc: ["Miner Ancient Eldritch is a spirit-operated resource extraction system in Occultism. Its value comes from a correct ritual, a bounded spirit contract or a controlled dimensional system rather than from merely possessing the item.","Acceptance: verify miner tier, valid ore table, dimensional access, output rate, storage capacity, repair or replacement and exclusion of stage-gated resources; perform a representative ritual, spirit task or storage cycle, record ingredients, duration, capacity and recovery, and close quest-reward, trade, loot, EMC, miner, possession and alternate-ritual shortcuts."]
	quest.4D1D83C41E9F02AD.quest_desc: ["A must have for any player who doesn't want to carry around a full inventory all the time."]
	quest.4D1D83C41E9F02AD.title: "Craft a &cBackpack"
	quest.4D278F1E4C68E29D.quest_desc: ["Wireless Terminal / Wireless Crafting Terminal is a network access and operator interface in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify access scope, crafting visibility, permission boundary, search behaviour and disconnected-state clarity; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.4D3274AE190EEA88.quest_desc: [
		"&6Pipez&r mod adds &o&bsimple&r and &o&bhighly configurable&r pipes that are designed to create"
		"&nas little lag as possible&r."
		""
		"Pipe Types:"
		"• &eItem&r Pipes"
		"• &9Fluid&r Pipes"
		"• &cEnergy&r Pipes"
		"• &3Gas&r Pipes (Mekanism)"
		"• &8Universal&r Pipes (All &o&b4&r Pipes in one!)"
		""
		"Pipes &o&bdon't transfer anything&r if they are not set to &nextract&r."
		"You can &eSneak-click&r onto the end of a connected pipe with a &2Wrench&r to set it to &o&bextract&r."
		""
		"Click the &nextracting&r part of the pipe to &o&bchange modes&r, add &3filters&r or add &aupgrades&r."
		""
		"Pipes can be &cdisconnected&r/&9reconnected&r by &eSneak-clicking&r with a &2Wrench&r."
		""
		"By default pipes are &o&brelatively slow&r. The speed can &nonly&r be increased by &o&badding an upgrade&r."
		"Higher tiers of upgrades mean a higher transfer rate."
		""
		"&3Filters&r can be used with &aitem&r pipes, &9fluid&r pipes and &7gas&r pipes. To add a specific item, just &eClick&r it on the slot in the filter &o&bGUI&r. Alternatively you can type the item &o&bID&r in the text field next to it."
	]
	quest.4D3274AE190EEA88.title: "Pipez"
	quest.4D37544E9165BEAC.quest_desc: ["After completing the &aSpelunking table&r puzzle &ethree times in a row&r, you will acquire the &cMagnetic cave codex&r, which is used in crafting a &amap&r to the &cmagnetic caves&r or &lRight-Clicking&r for &binformation&r on the &acaves.&r"]
	quest.4D37544E9165BEAC.quest_subtitle: "Craft a magnetic cave codex"
	quest.4D482A1A908ABFDA.quest_desc: ["Radial Chassis is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4D5787F48ECCB000.quest_desc: ["Steel Brewery is a cross-mod industrial integration component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material identity, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4D999E42010FFB85.quest_desc: ["Holds 1.6r AE in its battery and drains 1 AE/t for each block you are away from the nearest ME Wireless Access Point."]
	quest.4D9DC4973FD340E5.quest_desc: [
		"The Combat Academy is where your Knights in Training will train to become Knight. This also allows them to level up without a risk of dying to mobs."
		"The Knights in Training require a sword and shield to practice. They will attack the practice dummies, a pumpkin on top of a bale of hay."
		""
		"Tip: Consider setting the hiring mode to automatic so new recruits or kids growing up will automatically start training if not already attending school"
	]
	quest.4D9DC4973FD340E5.quest_subtitle: "Build a Combat Academy"
	quest.4D9DF84171B7453A.quest_desc: ["Alloy Smelter is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4DA04ABF4FF2625C.quest_desc: [
		"Aureal Bottles can be found in loot chests, but they can also be crafted using Arcane Crystal Dust."
		""
		"You can also generate Aureal with Arcane Crystal Obelisks."
	]
	quest.4DA04ABF4FF2625C.title: "&9Aureal"
	quest.4DA1C95BED78A662.quest_subtitle: "Better than Netherite"
	quest.4DA1C95BED78A662.title: "&1Draco Arcanus Armor&r"
	quest.4DAC24440803FE58.quest_desc: [
		"An AE2 network needs to be chunkloaded for any of its devices to be able to function, and if only some of it is loaded, it may not function correctly. The Spatial Anchor solves this problem. It forceloads the chunks that its network occupies. A single cable extending across a chunk border is enough to load that new chunk."
		""
		"It will propagate its \"loading\" across quantum bridges, but not cross-dimensionally, so if you have a quantum bridge to the nether, you need a spatial anchor on the network in your base and on the network in the nether."
		""
		"By default it will also enable random ticks in its loaded chunks, this can be turned off in the ae2 config."
	]
	quest.4DAEDB4B0C8D2CE4.quest_desc: ["A high-speed power generator that converts heat or fluid pressure into rotational energy through turbine blades. It delivers efficient, continuous power for advanced machines and automation systems."]
	quest.4DD7E2BD8508A117.quest_subtitle: "Build one of every herder hut."
	quest.4DD8EC6663F695BC.quest_subtitle: "Place down a Sequenced Pulse Generator"
	quest.4DD8EC6663F695BC.title: "Computational Supremacy"
	quest.4E058BAF38B16EE0.quest_desc: ["An electrical component that stores and releases energy when needed. It helps stabilize power flow, improve efficiency, and support machines during energy fluctuations."]
	quest.4E09A9C4D7200D2A.quest_desc: ["Conduit is a multi-service conduit or routing component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify service type, insert-extract direction, filter exactness, channel priority, redstone mode and loop prevention; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4E09A9C4D7200D2A.quest_subtitle: "Craft Ender Fluid Conduits"
	quest.4E09A9C4D7200D2A.title: "Conduit — Machine-System Acceptance"
	quest.4E190E6E1268D208.quest_desc: ["Right click the air with a empty bottle."]
	quest.4E4052F7EAD4FDD6.quest_desc: ["Bright banners and painted walls lure travelers closer, but inside these towering strongholds, chaos reigns. Each floor brims with bandits and traps, their laughter echoing as waves of foes pour from endless spawners. Conquer the towers, and their riches—and notoriety—are yours."]
	quest.4E4052F7EAD4FDD6.quest_subtitle: "Find the Bandit Towers"
	quest.4E4080F0A6E29532.quest_desc: ["Infinity Chestplate is a creative-adjacent armor capability in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify damage immunity or reduction, flight and movement, environmental protection, interaction with combat scaling and replacement after loss; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.4E4080F0A6E29532.quest_subtitle: "A heart of singularity. Protects against time, space, and logic."
	quest.4E5238F00CEED8B2.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to duplicate any raw ore into 2 dusts."
	quest.4E5238F00CEED8B2.title: "Hammah!"
	quest.4E54E2E26DEA652A.quest_desc: ["An essential crafting components made with &ehammers&r or any metal making &bmachine&r. Used in building &crocket&r parts and machinery."]
	quest.4E54E2E26DEA652A.title: "Plates"
	quest.4E5BB6BED111DEE3.quest_desc: ["Shadow Steel Casing / Shadow Steel / Refined Radiance / Refined Radiance Casing is a cross-mod convergence component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's completed infrastructure, authoritative output, data or container state and absence of a cheaper substitute; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.4E5BB6BED111DEE3.quest_subtitle: "No JEI?"
	quest.4E5C6F23628A9982.quest_desc: ["Encased Chain Drive is a kinetic transmission component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify rotation direction, RPM ratio, stress capacity, branch isolation, reverse state and visible diagnostics; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4E918421A699A711.quest_desc: ["&6Charged&r by pressing &lV&r and &cempted&r by pressing &lShift-V&r these &btools&r have special &lRight-Click&r &afunctionality.&r All of the tools &dnever break&r."]
	quest.4EA93AE8FD6CAF02.quest_desc: ["&bEggs&r are &cbroken&r when &ejumped on&r, and if you place &bice&r or &6amber&r beneath them they will &anot grow up&r."]
	quest.4EBD5363B552085D.quest_desc: [
		"Organizes electrical appliances into series-parallel groups without needing diodes or other circuit-splitting components."
		""
		"Different group numbers run in parallel and behave as if they are on separate diodes."
	]
	quest.4EC20D5D0EEC1DF7.quest_desc: [
		""
		"{ \"text\": \"Click Me!\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"3617DE87C4E1BCB9\" } }"
	]
	quest.4EC2703C7191C1BB.quest_desc: ["Corporeal: Relating to a person's body, especially as opposed to their spirit."]
	quest.4EC2EBFA7B7757BB.quest_desc: ["Battlemage Leggings is a magical equipment tier in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify mana or Source benefit, thread slots, defensive statistics, mobility interaction and repair path; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.4EC499B88FBFA01C.quest_desc: ["Stores kinetic stress for later use. Retains charge in item form to enable long-distance energy transport. Battery capacity, RPM at discharge and stress impact values are all configurable."]
	quest.4ED870EA84A78E94.quest_desc: ["Drop &5Quantum Foam&r in &dEnd&r at y coordinate below &c0&r."]
	quest.4ED870EA84A78E94.quest_subtitle: "Void"
	quest.4EDD96EB60EF5814.quest_desc: [
		"&dAdvanced Solar Generastor&r produces &b105.6FE/t&r."
		""
		"It also can be used to add extra heat to &2Thermal Evaporation Plants&r."
		""
		"Most of the panels need a clear view of the sky."
	]
	quest.4EE55D173F98BC99.quest_desc: ["Use in an &aSmithing table&r with an item infused with a &dgem&r to &cremove&r the &dGem.&r"]
	quest.4EF01E6BA6182A27.quest_desc: ["Quartz Wrench is a crystal and network-material production step in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify crystal source, charging or growth time, batch buffer and contamination-free conversion; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.4EF01E6BA6182A27.title: "Quartz Wrench — Network Acceptance"
	quest.4EF5DE3FBA2A7AE3.quest_desc: ["Inferium Sword / Inferium Pickaxe / Inferium Axe / System is a linked agriculture system. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify component ratios, shared catalysts, legal crop tiers, output ownership and unattended completion without duplicating seeds or essences; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.4EF621B740900EA8.quest_desc: ["Golden Sacrificial Bowl / Sacrificial Bowl is a ritual layout and execution component in Occultism. Its value comes from a correct ritual, a bounded spirit contract or a controlled dimensional system rather than from merely possessing the item.","Acceptance: verify pentacle pattern, chalk tier, bowl placement, central activation, consumed ingredients, chunk boundaries and safe cancellation; perform a representative ritual, spirit task or storage cycle, record ingredients, duration, capacity and recovery, and close quest-reward, trade, loot, EMC, miner, possession and alternate-ritual shortcuts."]
	quest.4EF621B740900EA8.quest_subtitle: "Aviars Circle"
	quest.4EF621B740900EA8.title: "Golden Sacrificial Bowl / Sacrificial Bowl — Ritual Acceptance"
	quest.4F00BE972EFE7FBE.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to exchange blocks from your inv to the selected area"
	quest.4F09E98E5E615AC9.title: "Redstone Transmitter / Redstone Receiver — Infrastructure Acceptance"
	quest.4F1307BB5B01F90F.quest_desc: [
		"The ME Chest acts like a miniature network with a ME Terminal, ME Drive, and Energy Acceptor. While it can be used as a tiny storage network, its capacity for just one single storage cell means it has limited utility as such."
		""
		"Instead, it is useful for interacting with specifically the storage cell mounted inside it. Its integrated terminal can only see and access the items in the mounted drive, while devices on the general network can access items in any network storage, including ME chests."
		""
		"It has 2 different GUIs and is sided for item transport. Interacting with the top terminal opens the integrated terminal. Items can be inserted into the mounted storage cell through this face, but not extracted. Interacting with any other face opens the GUI with the slot for the storage cell and the priority settings. The cell can be inserted and removed by item logistics only through the face with the cell slot."
		""
		"It can be rotated with a Certus Quartz Wrench."
		""
		"It has a small AE energy storage buffer, so if not on a network with an energy cell, inserting or extracting too many items at once may cause it to brown out."
	]
	quest.4F1C04C0F6769825.quest_desc: ["Chemical injection adds hydrogen chloride and another processing stage; gas starvation or excess intermediate stock makes the nominal yield irrelevant.","Acceptance: provide monitored hydrogen chloride, isolate shards from clumps, process sixteen ore units end to end, and shut down upstream machines before any intermediate buffer overflows."]
	quest.4F1C04C0F6769825.title: "Chemical Injection Chamber — Fourfold Chain"
	quest.4F1FA866A2F510A1.quest_desc: ["Obtained by putting an Electrum Ingot in a Rolling Mill."]
	quest.4F1FA866A2F510A1.quest_subtitle: "Crafting component."
	quest.4F216AB740548F80.quest_desc: ["A powerful industrial engine designed to generate massive amounts of rotational energy. Ideal for driving heavy machinery, large-scale factories, and advanced automation setups."]
	quest.4F2F6E31C38DA17F.quest_desc: ["Automatically refills gadgets and armor that use water."]
	quest.4F30FA10742473D3.quest_desc: [
		"After using a &aheavyweight&r to create this, you will need a build a &dmagnetic quarry&r to use it."
		""
		"&lFirst:&r craft &bfour magnetic lights&r and place them in a &esquare perimater&r."
		""
		"&lSecond:&r Place down a &cMagnetic quarry&r crafted from the &bheart of iron&r next to the perimeter of &bmagnetic lights&r."
		""
		"&lFinally:&r Place the &cQuarry smasher&r in the &emiddle&r of the square and &dwatch it mine!&r"
	]
