	quest.4F4B2A6997F25A5A.title: "Arcana"
	quest.4F51E1672ECE7D3B.quest_desc: ["Spatial Io Port is a bulk transfer or spatial-storage component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify transfer direction, cell compatibility, area boundary, protected blocks and rollback after interruption; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
