	quest.4F7EC227A0B7F2D6.quest_desc: ["If eating a &4Darkened Apple&r while under the effects of &0Darkness Incarnate&r, it will extend the &deffect's duration&r for &l30&r extra seconds. This bonus &6can stack&r with &nno reasonable limit&r when eating &4multiple Darkened Apples&r."]
	quest.4F86E16DE747E9FE.quest_desc: ["Redstone Information is a redstone control or sequencing component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify input condition, pulse or sequence timing, output ownership, reset state and behaviour after chunk reload; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4F89670D49DD2DE1.quest_desc: [
		"They provide diagnostic function by visualizing the Channel usage on the Cables, the Channels appear as lit colored lines that run along the black stripe on the Cables giving you an understanding of how your Channels are being used on your network."
