	quest.5007013C1A395087.quest_desc: ["AE2 Network Checkpoint 5087 is a network design checkpoint in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify documented topology, channel budget, power reserve, storage overflow and a restart procedure; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
