	quest.504C80D0179154D5.quest_desc: ["Energetic Photovoltaic Module is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
