	quest.50BFFEAF92B72965.quest_desc: ["Bronze Item Output Hatch / Bronze Fluid Input Hatch / Bronze Fluid Output Hatch / Coke Oven is a early steam-machine component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify steam supply, input and output separation, recipe duration, exhaust or byproducts and unattended stack processing; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
