	quest.5113AD9751B850A7.quest_desc: ["Ether Gas Bucket is a Industrial Foregoing production component. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify its exact work area, input contract, power or fluid demand, output routing and safe shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.517A4A2D4EDD6359.quest_desc: ["Chaos Shard is a Chaos-tier encounter or material in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify legitimate guardian victory, island destruction risk, unique-drop policy, repeat access and prohibition of generic mob simulation; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.518405876B7FEB5A.quest_subtitle: "If you are lost you can use the mod's guide book if it has one"
	quest.518405876B7FEB5A.title: "Guide Books"
	quest.51844489E649C85A.quest_desc: ["Qio Drive Time Dilating is a QIO digital-storage or logistics component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify frequency ownership, item and type capacity, importer or exporter filters, remote access, overflow and recovery after frequency loss; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.518CA7324056BD2E.quest_desc: ["Yeta Wrench is a specialized Ender IO component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its alloy, capacitor, side, conduit or inventory contract and a safe blocked or disconnected state; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.518D71CFF03E0A96.quest_desc: [
		"The Oxygen Distributor allou you to fill a room with oxygen."
		"For this, place a full an oxygen tank with oxygen with the Water Separator."
	]
	quest.51A4309769963F4F.quest_desc: [
		"With &#85817EDyson Cube Project&r you can build your very own Dyson Sphere like megastructure in Minecraft and unlock limitless energy for your world."
		""
		"How it works:"
		"Send Solar Sails and Beams to the sun using EM Railguns, EM Railguns can only work during non rainy days, and they will stop working when the sun is at its peak (By default you need 1 beam to support 4 solar sails)"
		""
		"After sending a bunch of solar sails you can harvest the power (FE) using Ray Recievers"
		"(All multiblocks can be connected from the bottom middle block)"
		""
		"In multiplayer other players can join your sphere by interacting with any multiblock"
	]
	quest.51A4309769963F4F.title: "Welcome to DCP"
	quest.51A618DFE2B4746A.quest_desc: ["Redstone Filter Base is a multi-service conduit or routing component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify service type, insert-extract direction, filter exactness, channel priority, redstone mode and loop prevention; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.51ABAF89A54612DB.quest_desc: ["&dGem armor&r is the best this mod has to offer, each piece gives you &cspecial abilities&r, including, &9Night-vision&r, &eflight,&r &bspeed,&r and &6fire-resistance&r"]
	quest.51C5499FC0E932CF.quest_desc: [
		"The Philosopher’s Stone remains the foundation of ProjectE, but its recipe now requires a Draconic Processor."
