	quest.55ED711EFD438FC3.quest_desc: ["Extreme Crafting Table is a crafting-infrastructure tier in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify previous-table ancestry, matrix size, automation interface, recipe authority and prevention of lower-table substitutes; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
