	quest.5A9D6672385D3D82.quest_desc: ["Upgrade Matrix is a machine or equipment upgrade in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify compatible host, stack limit, additional pressure or air demand, exact capability gain and safe removal; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
