	quest.5B653A45093C56F0.quest_desc: [
		"In &bApotheosis,&r anvils now can be &denchanted&r and &nno longer have a level limit&r. The anvil can be enchanted with &eUnbreaking,&r &cSplitting,&r and &9Oblteration&r."
		""
		"&l&cSplitting:&r&r"
		""
		"Used on &dmulti-enchantment&r books."
		""
		"&eAttempts&r to separate each enchantment into individual books."
		""
		"&l20%&r &lsuccess chance&r per level of &cSplitting.&r"
		""
		"&nAlways&r &cdamages&r the anvil (damage can be prevented with &eUnbreaking).&r"
		""
		"&l&9Obliteration&r:&r"
		""
		"Used on &dsingle-enchantment&r books above level 1."
		""
		"S&cplits&r the book into two books, each &none level lower&r."
		""
		"Also has &l2&r&l0%&r &lsuccess&r &lchance&r per level, and causes anvil &cdamage&r."
	]
	quest.5B658B92D3E5641D.quest_desc: ["Saw is a specialized mob-farm component in Mob Grinding Utils. A valid farm must be bounded, recoverable and restricted to creatures and drops that are legal after the corresponding first encounter.","Acceptance: verify its capture, spawning, movement, killing or collection role, bounded operating area, overflow response and restricted-target policy; run a controlled batch, record spawn rate, kill rate, power or consumables, collection capacity and shutdown behaviour, then close boss, unique-drop, reward, trade, EMC, Woot and neural-simulation bypasses."]
	quest.5B681BC43371CC5C.quest_desc: [
		"The Logistical Transporter is the basic item transport pipe for Mekanism logistics. With the Configurator the player can choose to \"paint\" the pipe with colors that can be detected by the pipe's color sorter by ⇧ Shift + right-clicking the center of a transporter with a Configurator."
		""
		"It has 2 other cousins called the Diversion Transporter and the Restrictive Transporter."
	]
	quest.5B681BC43371CC5C.title: "&aBasic Logistical Transporter"
	quest.5B84B8A165140BFA.quest_desc: ["Shape Card Def is a builder or area-operation component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify shape-card bounds, chunk ownership, filter rules, energy per operation, protected blocks and output collection; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.5B8F0C492F564758.quest_desc: ["Neutron Horse Armor is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.5B8F0C492F564758.quest_subtitle: "Thank you"
	quest.5B9501552E5DFB20.quest_subtitle: "Found in veins near the surface alongside crimsite and sand."
	quest.5B960A074B904E80.quest_desc: [
		"The electrical motor converts electrical power into SU with a small efficiency loss."
		""
		"This is a multistep deploying recipe, with one step involving the Winding Machine. Start with a shaft and follow these steps:"
		""
		"Use a Winding Machine to wrap 75 turns of copper wire around it"
		""
		"Add a Magnet"
		""
		"Attach a Steel Mechanism"
		""
		"Use a Screwdriver"
		""
		"Repeat this process three times for a 94% chance of obtaining a motor."
		""
		"Rotation direction can be configured."
		""
		"For 30V - 320V: SU output and motor speed depend on the input voltage, up to 11,220 SU at 255 RPM. This consumes 960W of power."
		""
		"For 320V - 1000V: The motor still produces its maximum SU but consumes more power. There is no benefit to going this high."
	]
	quest.5BC4250E4C9F803C.quest_desc: ["Imperium Farmland is a crop-tier farmland. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify hydration, crop-tier compatibility, harvest area, replacement stock and the effect of acceleration on server load; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.5BCFF8D80F8A0B5F.quest_desc: ["Grains Of Infinity is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.5BCFF8D80F8A0B5F.title: "Grains Of Infinity — Machine-System Acceptance"
	quest.5BD31AED5C80922D.quest_desc: ["Dislocator Receptacle / Infused Obsidian / Dislocator is a teleportation and location-control component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify binding ownership, destination safety, cross-dimensional cost, recovery from lost anchors and multiplayer permissions; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.5BD31AED5C80922D.quest_subtitle: "The perfect mob farm?"
	quest.5BE89BD0E51208C1.quest_desc: ["Dimensionalcell Simple / Powercell Card is a specialized RFTools ecosystem component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify its module or card configuration, power contract, area or network ownership and a safe invalid or disconnected state; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.5C083F2DA57E133F.quest_desc: ["Interface is a autocrafting infrastructure component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify pattern ownership, ingredient return, machine blocking mode, crafting CPU capacity and recovery from a failed job; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.5C12F4CC1F6F6C32.quest_desc: ["Looming among the clouds, this massive airship bristles with defenses and hostile crew. Phantom-mounted fiends circle overhead, while fish-like raiders astride hoglins stalk the decks. Boarding it is no small feat. Tthose who triumph will etch their name among the few who dared challenge the skies."]
	quest.5C12F4CC1F6F6C32.quest_subtitle: "Find a Heavenly Challenger"
	quest.5C1667FA12469BEE.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Crimed is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.5C2108BD3DEEB0E6.quest_desc: ["Spout is a kinetic processing machine in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify required RPM and stress, recipe isolation, input and output buffer, heat or fluid condition, byproducts and full-output shutdown; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.5C21D02BB2644A39.quest_desc: [
		"Despite what the tooltip says, it still requires Magnetic Alloy."
		""
		"Connect it to a generator, place one alloy on the prongs, and watch the needle rise until it creates a Magnet."
	]
	quest.5C4CA5CBBEA23FD4.quest_desc: ["Smelly, but provides good protection, especially against projectiles."]
	quest.5C56452BE7879D0A.quest_desc: ["Not all bookshelves increase a status. They can &creduce&r &aEterna,&r &cQuanta&r and &dArcana.&r Use them when you're aiming for &dprecision enchantment&r."]
	quest.5C56452BE7879D0A.title: "Negative Effects"
	quest.5C5DE3ECE4E39C5F.quest_subtitle: "Trigger an Overstress Clutch"
	quest.5C5DE3ECE4E39C5F.title: "Circuit Breaker"
	quest.5C63339483E6DE69.quest_desc: ["Has 9 more filter slots and is 2x faster than the regular Importer."]
	quest.5C6453AF1DC98785.title: "Auto Ender Crafter / Auto Flux Crafter — Convergence Acceptance"
	quest.5C68C72416734550.quest_desc: ["This artifact, though disgusting provides debuff to enemies. Just make sure to wash your hands afterwards."]
	quest.5C786EAC4B7CBEB4.quest_desc: ["Equal Distribution Card is a specialized AE2 network component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify its channel, power, storage or routing contract and a safe disconnected or saturated state; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.5C8D7BD3DA61109F.quest_desc: ["Electric Quarry / Chain / Steel Machine Casing Pipe / Steel Machine Casing is a voltage-tier electrical component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify voltage tier, amperage or EU demand, cable loss, transformer boundary, overvoltage protection and reserve capacity; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.5C950B2842FBB2D9.quest_desc: ["A subspace is a smaller vector space entirely contained within a larger one, acting as a \"space within a space,\" defined in linear algebra by three rules: it must contain the zero vector, be closed under vector addition (adding vectors stays in the subspace), and be closed under scalar multiplication (scaling vectors stays in the subspace). In science fiction, it's often a parallel dimension for faster-than-light travel or communication. "]
	quest.5C950B2842FBB2D9.quest_subtitle: "Fun fact again"
	quest.5CC88E9602D47EB9.quest_desc: ["Redstone Proxy / Redstone Proxy Upd is a cross-mod RFTools integration component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, data or inventory ownership, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.5CC88E9602D47EB9.title: "Redstone Proxy / Redstone Proxy Upd — Infrastructure Acceptance"
	quest.5CF320E9C4C1B1E1.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to Infinity Legacy II ."
		""
		"This questline exists to provide structure and direction, especially for players who may not be fully accustomed to large, progression heavy modpacks. It is meant to serve as a starting point that helps you understand what to work toward and why each step matters."
		""
		"With over 400 mods integrated into this pack, there is no single “correct” way to progress. Everyone is free to explore systems, automate resources, and approach challenges in their own way."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"These quests should be seen as a gentle push forward, not a strict path. They outline a logical flow of progression but do not represent the full depth or every possibility the modpack offers."
		""
		"Use this questline as guidance, not as a rulebook. Infinity Legacy is ultimately about mastery, experimentation, and choosing your own route through the modpack."
	]
	quest.5CF320E9C4C1B1E1.title: "Welcome to Infinity Legacy 2"
	quest.5D0809A3B18C9206.quest_desc: ["[ \"\", { \"text\": \"Click me!\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"1E31F400E47B0D34\" } } ]"]
	quest.5D343A8BA24FA327.quest_desc: ["Controller is a specialized AE2 network component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify its channel, power, storage or routing contract and a safe disconnected or saturated state; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.5D343A8BA24FA327.title: "Controller — Network Acceptance"
	quest.5D3A267FBE80149B.quest_desc: [
