	quest.5D3EE44FB41D289F.quest_desc: ["A item which contains a configuration similar to a Storage Cell, that allows you to customize the filtering of a particular ME Terminal."]
	quest.5D5C5B1F12462C2E.quest_desc: ["Quantum Upgrade Base is a cross-mod AE2 integration component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, component data and the absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.5D61FEEE2C38D2FE.quest_desc: ["Gm Chicken Feed Cursed is a mob capture and spawn-egg conversion component in Mob Grinding Utils. A valid farm must be bounded, recoverable and restricted to creatures and drops that are legal after the corresponding first encounter.","Acceptance: verify allowed target list, exact entity identity, one legitimate encounter, component preservation and a blacklist for bosses, quest entities and unique-drop creatures; run a controlled batch, record spawn rate, kill rate, power or consumables, collection capacity and shutdown behaviour, then close boss, unique-drop, reward, trade, EMC, Woot and neural-simulation bypasses."]
	quest.5D64250B940BC8FD.quest_desc: ["Compressed Iron Helmet / Compressed Iron Chestplate / Compressed Iron Leggings / Compressed Iron Boots is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.5D7086E12EF13158.quest_desc: ["A &asharpened spear&r made of &blimestone.&r &eUnbreakable&r and &ccan be thrown&r."]
	quest.5D7B34761E8FD212.quest_desc: ["Electrostatic Compressor is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.5DAC6A9AFDDCAA33.quest_desc: ["Dimensionalshard is a RFTools structural or infused material in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify material source, infusion percentage, previous-tier component, batch production and prevention of tag substitution; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.5DAC6A9AFDDCAA33.title: "Dimensionalshard — Infrastructure Acceptance"
	quest.5DD4B5780494D422.quest_desc: ["Dense Neutron Collector is a neutronium production component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify collector count, passive production rate, chunk availability, buffer capacity and fair scaling without manual waiting; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.5DD99224F29419C1.quest_desc: ["Lv Steam Turbine is a steam-generation or conversion component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify water reserve, fuel or heat input, steam output, pressure-safe buffer, turbine demand and clean shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.5DE6CDBDD36EC3CC.quest_desc: ["&rThe Entangled mod lets you link two blocks so that interacting with one affects the other, even from a distance."]
	quest.5E116409DC7D30BB.quest_desc: ["The Configurator is used to configure many of the items in Mekanism, from changing pipes to \"Pull or Push\" or rotating machines."]
