	quest.5E2F9E27E6B4DF74.quest_desc: ["A better tier of Conducter with more storage."]
	quest.5E2F9E27E6B4DF74.title: "&dUltimate Thermodynamic Conductor"
	quest.5E45D2A2FDD67495.quest_desc: ["This goes in the right side of the forge."]
	quest.5E45D2A2FDD67495.quest_subtitle: "Experience in a bottle"
	quest.5E45D2A2FDD67495.title: "&aBottle O' Enchanting"
	quest.5E52934814637713.quest_desc: ["Xp Vacuum is a experience or enchanting component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify XP ownership, material cost, deterministic output, invalid enchantment handling and prevention of duplication or cheap transfer; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.5E74162BFE874E02.quest_desc: ["Sorcerer Leggings is a magical equipment tier in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify mana or Source benefit, thread slots, defensive statistics, mobility interaction and repair path; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.5E8B7801E15425D7.quest_desc: [
		"&ePositioned Processing&r is a special processing and crafting method that allows items to be &asent to specific inventories&r in a &efixed order&r."
		""
		"It is designed for recipes where &aprecise item placement&r matters."
		""
		"&eHow It Works&r"
		""
		"• Uses a &ePositioned Package Distributor&r"
		"• Each input slot is linked to a specific target inventory"
		"• Outputs are &asorted and stacked&r when encoded"
		"• Items are inserted &ein exact order&r when unpackaged"
		""
		"&eDistributor Markers&r"
		""
		"• &eDistributor Markers&r are bound to inventories"
		"• Each marker represents one target location"
		"• Markers are inserted into the distributor slots"
		"  matching the encoded input order"
		""
		"This ensures items always go to the correct machine or inventory."
		""
		"&eSettings and Automation&r"
		""
		"• Target setups can be copied using the"
		"  &ePackaging Settings Cloner&r"
		"• Requires enough empty &eDistributor Markers&r"
		"  when pasting settings"
		""
		"&eWhy Use Positioned Processing?&r"
		""
		"• Perfect for multi-machine recipes"
		"• Guarantees correct item routing"
		"• Prevents mix-ups in complex automation"
		"• Ideal for advanced &ePackagedAuto&r setups"
	]
	quest.5E8B7801E15425D7.title: "&ePositioned Processing&r"
	quest.5E9AF6B8FC8929D0.quest_desc: ["A new &bnon-magnetic&r set of tools that do &eextra damage&r to &bmagnetic mobs&r and are crafted from &cscarlet neodymium&r."]
	quest.5E9AF6B8FC8929D0.title: "Scarlet neodymium tools"
	quest.5E9B440485DF6BCB.quest_desc: ["Amulet Of Mana Boost is a specialized Ars Nouveau component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify its Source, spell, ritual, entity or automation contract and a safe invalid-input or interrupted state; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.5EB59B43781EB61D.quest_desc: [
		"Use a Wrench to switch between input and output."
		""
