	]
	quest.6222356D4DC8011D.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Explosive is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.623B6948CC6BEE3B.quest_desc: ["Ultimate Stew is a multi-branch convergence ingredient in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify all required domain outputs, batch automation, container return, unique encounter permissions and absence of random acquisition; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.6244032FE2E5F1E1.quest_desc: ["The absolute peak of &denchanting&r &cpower&r offers massive &aEterna.&r If you’re looking to break the limits of &denchantment,&r this shelf is the limit."]
	quest.62458187F95EE35A.quest_desc: ["Spatial Anchor is a bulk transfer or spatial-storage component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify transfer direction, cell compatibility, area boundary, protected blocks and rollback after interruption; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.62625CAF6649AB53.quest_desc: ["Don't like storing things in drives? \\\\n \\\\n You can create storage &9Blocks&r instead and just slap the block down somewhere in your system. \\\\n \\\\n Whatever items end up in the block will be stored inside whenever you break it as well. \\\\n \\\\n If you want to un-craft it, you can sneak right click while holding it."]
	quest.62625CAF6649AB53.title: "1k Storage Block"
	quest.626580DB654F128D.quest_desc: ["Millstone is a kinetic processing machine in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify required RPM and stress, recipe isolation, input and output buffer, heat or fluid condition, byproducts and full-output shutdown; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.62671BDA7C583957.quest_desc: ["A natural fuel source produced from organic materials. It can be processed into Bioethanol, making it an eco-friendly alternative for generating energy and powering your Create machines sustainably."]
	quest.626811BDE3A415EA.quest_desc: ["Cosmic Pressurized Tube is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
