	quest.637EBAB0500A2295.quest_desc: ["An incendiary grenade that triggers a high-temperature chemical reaction on impact, melting through metal and igniting nearby flammable materials. It deals persistent area damage and can disable machinery or break through reinforced structures, but use with caution—its intense heat affects friend and foe alike."]
	quest.63A46DD9090FABCD.quest_desc: ["Double Compressed Crafting Table is a crafting-infrastructure tier in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify previous-table ancestry, matrix size, automation interface, recipe authority and prevention of lower-table substitutes; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
