	quest.6B9B0E7EFA9A9B0B.quest_subtitle: "Smash, next."
	quest.6BADE45ED40D5313.title: "Crystal/ Emerald Furnace"
	quest.6BB0C51EE8CA5966.quest_desc: [
		"At the Mine, the Miner will mine for ores and materials. Once they are hired, the Miner will first create a shaft downward to a specific depth depending on the level of the Mine. Once the main shaft is completed, the Miner will then branch out. While mining, sometimes the Miner will get lucky and get an ore block instead of a basic stone block. &7&o(magic!)&r&r"
		""
		"Tip: The miner fills holes and gaps with a Fill Block, cobblestone by default. However, the fill block can be changed in the Miner’s Hut settings. If you have a forester and lots of wood, consider using wood planks. Or perhaps now you will have a use for all that deepslate."
	]
	quest.6BB0C51EE8CA5966.quest_subtitle: "Build a Mine"
	quest.6BCEC4DFC4050076.quest_desc: ["Nether Crafting Table is a crafting-infrastructure tier in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify previous-table ancestry, matrix size, automation interface, recipe authority and prevention of lower-table substitutes; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.6BD625E5CA469914.quest_desc: ["Highly Advanced Upgrade is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6BDC8BE7ADE7767D.quest_desc: ["Infinite Pressurized Tube is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6BE97BF6EA54D48B.quest_desc: ["Dropped from &cVesper&r use these, you guessed it, for &6crafting&r."]
	quest.6BEC1C688BC24782.quest_desc: [
		"With exchangeable Drill Heads and upgrades, itsproperties are almost entirely modifiable."
		""
		"To modify it, place it in an Engineer's Workbench."
		""
		"The Drilr runs off of Biodiesel and can be filled directly in the Refinery."
	]
	quest.6BFE5D35265080E6.quest_desc: ["A sprawling underground stronghold, the Scorched Mines radiate in four cardinal directions from a central dome. Heat and shadows fill the tunnels, and danger lurks at every turn. Brave adventurers who navigate its branching paths may uncover riches, but only if they survive the hazards within."]
	quest.6BFE5D35265080E6.quest_subtitle: "Find the Scorched Mines"
	quest.6C1BBA559963B3DF.title: "Little Book o' &cDemons&r"
	quest.6C226F99E675B063.quest_desc: ["Used to fuel &6Agumenting tables&r. Put this sigil in the &lLeft-side lower slot&r below the item your upgrading."]
	quest.6C25D42C36175BF4.quest_desc: ["Purification begins the threefold ore route and depends on stable oxygen supply, predictable raw-ore intake and downstream crushing capacity.","Acceptance: process one stack of raw ore, buffer oxygen and clumps, prevent downstream saturation, and calculate whether the whole chain—not this machine alone—meets the target throughput."]
	quest.6C25D42C36175BF4.quest_subtitle: "It makes Clumps"
	quest.6C29C97FD42F9CF2.quest_desc: ["Sorcerer Robes is a magical equipment tier in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify mana or Source benefit, thread slots, defensive statistics, mobility interaction and repair path; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.6C3B025A4B223E82.quest_desc: ["Blank Pattern / Pattern Encoding Terminal is a specialized AE2 network component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify its channel, power, storage or routing contract and a safe disconnected or saturated state; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.6C3B025A4B223E82.title: "Blank Pattern / Pattern Encoding Terminal — Network Acceptance"
	quest.6C4B5F02B8A6AFD0.quest_desc: [
		"The Fuel Refinery is very important. It allou you to create fuel"
		""
		"To create Fuel, you need to input oil in the first slot and it will generate fuel that you can get by putting a bucket in the last slot"
	]
	quest.6C52C108FA9020E4.quest_subtitle: "UU sure?"
	quest.6C6417BE692EE73D.quest_desc: ["Refined and deadly. This isn’t your grandma’s peppermint stick it’s a weaponized dessert."]
	quest.6C74E5CD21611F2E.title: "Speed Upgrades"
	quest.6C76AB8A6110C0C7.quest_desc: ["Provides more &aEterna&r and &cQuanta&r then other &cHellshelves,&r but reduces the number of &dEnchant&r clues."]
	quest.6C7940D152032730.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Sourcelink is a Source generation or storage component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify input legality, Source per cycle, jar routing, generation radius, renewable boundary and overflow; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.6C8431C216A66C1F.quest_desc: ["A better tier of transporter with more storage."]
	quest.6C8431C216A66C1F.title: "&dUltimate Logistical Transporter"
	quest.6C9157A690AA5F3C.quest_subtitle: "Don't drink it."
	quest.6C93B82EEA152199.quest_desc: ["Fluid Collector is a fluid logistics machine. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify source rules, tank reserve, chunk boundaries, overflow and unintended world-fluid duplication; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.6C96992416059AC4.quest_desc: ["Ultimate Laser Drill is a cross-mod industrial integration component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material identity, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6CA01DCE1F4A0EC3.quest_desc: ["Oil Bucket is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6CA941AE132445D9.quest_desc: ["Basic Machine Hull is a machine-structure or electromechanical component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify previous-tier ancestry, material forms, motor or pump tier, reusable molds and continuous component stocking; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6CAA311E22F52EF1.quest_desc: [
		"This one’s the trickiest and most important; this trait can only be gotten from Kamikaze Bees."
		""
		"Kamikaze Bees spawn in a particular way by being attacked. Their only objective is to protect you by… well… going kamikaze on the attacker."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"While wearing a Bee Nest Helmet (a Diamond helmet with a Nest on top), if you get hit by a hostile mob, there is a 30% chance of a Kamikaze Bee spawning. The difficult part? They’re TINY and FAST so you need to have a setup inside an enclosed box, have a Catcher ready, or have good aim and cage them once they spawn."
		""
		"Get 4-5 of them then squeeze them. This should get you a 100% Very High Productivity gene."
		""
		"Now, you need to put the gene in an easy-to-breed bee (via Honey Treat + Gene) and breed them, and once an offspring is born with the Very High gene use it to breed more bees of that type. With that, you basically have infinite, Very High Productivity genes."
	]
	quest.6CAA311E22F52EF1.quest_subtitle: "(Very High Productivity)"
	quest.6CB5ACBAAED66871.quest_desc: ["Shaped from the stem and cap of a giant fungus, this whimsical dwelling offers a rare touch of charm in a perilous world. Lightly guarded and easy to claim, the mushroom house makes for a delightful refuge, perfect for any adventurer who’s ever dreamed of calling a mushroom home."]
	quest.6CB5ACBAAED66871.quest_subtitle: "Find a Mushroom House"
	quest.6CB8610599D88B8F.quest_desc: ["Double Layer Capacitor is a machine-upgrade or energy-buffer component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify capacitor tier, machine compatibility, effective speed and energy multiplier, bank capacity and safe expansion; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6CC5FE34778F0DFA.quest_desc: [
		"You're bound to have too many items playing this modpack. It's just it works, and if you haven't figured out your storage situation yet, &dDimensional Storage&r might just be right for you!"
		""
		"To get started with this magical storage solution, you'll need to craft the &dDimensional Storage Actuator&r and place it down into the world. This acts just like a Shulker Box, meaning if you break it, it won't lose any of the items stored inside."
		""
		"By default, this has 128 storage slots with each slot holding up to 16 stacks of an item, except for items with &5NBT&r data. These will not stack and will take up an entire slot, so make sure to leave those items out!"
	]
	quest.6CC5FE34778F0DFA.title: "&c&mDemonic&r &dMagical Storage&r!"
	quest.6CD0A72A42EE5F15.quest_desc: ["Sculk Crafting Table is a crafting-infrastructure tier in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify previous-table ancestry, matrix size, automation interface, recipe authority and prevention of lower-table substitutes; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.6CD2CF2142976D18.quest_desc: ["If you wish for your dragon to remain at its current size, feed it this disgusting thing, Uncle Roger will be disappointed.."]
	quest.6CD96328B7567F46.quest_desc: ["Mechanical Harvester is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6D03D3B4D83C1840.quest_desc: ["Mechanical Crafter is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6D100E60EE8BE745.quest_desc: ["They are more annoying than lethal. Make sure to kill them quick as they provide you debuffs."]
	quest.6D124ACF4AE80490.quest_desc: ["Micromissiles is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6D21D41A34D92174.quest_desc: ["Absolute Chemical Tank is a advanced chemical-processing component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify chemical phase, tank and side configuration, catalyst or secondary input, output separation, radioactive handling and clean purge; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6D4361D7A8890651.quest_desc: ["Chaotic Staff is a modular tool, weapon or portable energy item in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify module capacity, charged performance, area effect, attack or mining throughput, repair path and energy supply; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6D56AD1BEC644A10.quest_desc: [
		"The Archery is where your Archers in Training will train to become Archer. This also allows them to level up without a risk of dying to mobs. "
		""
		"The Archers in Training require a bow to practice. They will shoot at the practice targets, a target block"
		""
		"Tip: Consider setting the hiring mode to automatic so new recruits or kids growing up will automatically start training if not already attending school. "
	]
	quest.6D56AD1BEC644A10.quest_subtitle: "Build an Archery"
	quest.6D592A925D4F2981.quest_desc: ["A &bmassive bone&r from &aprehistoric beasts&r."]
	quest.6D750A38944E9B68.quest_desc: ["Infusion Altar / Infusion Pedestal is a linked agriculture system. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify component ratios, shared catalysts, legal crop tiers, output ownership and unattended completion without duplicating seeds or essences; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.6D7CABCFB50D8B0D.quest_desc: ["Made from a &aBasic Control Circuit&r this item is used in a few crafting recipes."]
	quest.6D7CC9EA47063963.quest_desc: ["A lightweight and durable metal ingot used in crafting advanced machinery and components. Its strength and conductivity make it ideal for high-tech and industrial applications."]
	quest.6D7CC9EA47063963.quest_subtitle: "Aluminium innit bruv"
	quest.6D87B5B0E13878B8.quest_desc: [
		"Pluto Info:"
		"&aGravity:&r 0.588 m/s"
		"&bOxygen:&r none"
		"&cTemperature:&r -229 °C"
	]
	quest.6DA0DA7EBBAAB1DF.quest_desc: [
		"&lRight-Clicking&r a &cBeholder&r with an &4Occult Gem&r&6 links the Gem&r to the &cBeholder&r, causing it to display the &eBeholder's coordinates&r in its tooltip. &lRight-Clicking&r while holding the &6linked Gem&r allows you to&o see through the &cBeholder&r&r. The camera can be panned &ain all directions.&r Pressing &lLeft-Shift&r exits the &6Beholder's view&r."
		""
		"A Beholder &dcannot be seen &rthrough if the player is in &canother dimension&r, but it can be seen through if the chunk containing it is &eunloaded&r. "
		"&oThe latter situation may cause mobs to not appear.&r"
	]
	quest.6DAA1F51CA09BA72.quest_desc: ["Dropped from the &agammaroach&r, which attacks you if you are &eirradiated&r, use this in &6crafting&r."]
	quest.6DB1AAAD926486BC.quest_desc: [
		"&aFluid Tanks&r are storage blocks to store fluids."
		""
		"The amount of fluid (mb) a fluid tank can store is based on its tier."
		""
		"It will retain its inventory when broken. You may use a &dMechanical Pipe&r that is set to &cPull&r in order to extract the fluid out of the tank."
		""
		"It has a &o&bbucket&r mode which can be toggled to scoop up liquids with it. Very useful for &6lava&r in the beginning!"
	]
	quest.6DE7A57143B0C88E.quest_desc: [
		"The &eUnpackager&r is the machine responsible for turning &6Recipe Packages&r back into real items."
		""
		"It distributes packaged inputs into &eadjacent inventories&r or &epackage crafting machines&r, depending on the recipe type."
		""
		"The Unpackager &crequires power&r to operate."
		""
		"&eHow the Unpackager Works&r"
		""
		"• Insert &6Recipe Packages&r into the Unpackager"
		"• Packages are placed into internal &etrackers&r"
		"• Once a tracker is filled, the package is unpackaged"
		"• Items are sent to adjacent inventories or machines"
		"• Requires an &3AE2&r channel"
		""
		"The number of trackers can be adjusted to control parallel processing."
		""
		"&eProcessing and Blocking Mode&r"
		""
		"For processing recipes, you can enable &eBlocking Mode&r."
		""
		"• Prevents unpackaging into occupied inventories"
		"• Ensures correct machine synchronization"
		""
		"Inputs can be extracted from the &etop side&r."
		""
		"&eWhy Use the Unpackager?&r"
		""
		"• Converts packages back into usable items"
		"• Essential for all &ePackagedAuto&r workflows"
		"• Supports complex multi-machine recipes"
		"• Scales cleanly with &3AE2&r automation"
	]
	quest.6DE7A57143B0C88E.title: "&eUnpackager&r"
	quest.6DE8ACA4F08C420E.quest_desc: ["Transfer stress capacity from one network to another while keeping the networks separate. Guarantees that the source network will not be affected when the destination network is overstressed."]
	quest.6DF595F9E2523C41.quest_desc: ["Dark Steel Sword is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6E14D2CF2A950157.quest_desc: ["Assembler Matrix Speed is a cross-mod AE2 integration component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, component data and the absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.6E537B08FCD57418.quest_desc: ["After completing the &aSpelunking table&r puzzle &ethree times in a row&r, you will acquire the &aToxic cave codex&r, which is used in crafting a &amap&r to the &aToxic cave codex&r or &lRight-Clicking&r for &binformation&r on the &acaves.&r"]
	quest.6E79797DBD8A54EA.quest_desc: ["Flux Crafter / Flux Alternator is a specialized powered crafting system in Extended Crafting. Its difficulty must come from integrated infrastructure, previous-tier mastery and meaningful material convergence rather than arbitrary manual repetition.","Acceptance: verify power supply, recipe isolation, paired-block topology, cycle rate, input buffer and clean shutdown under insufficient energy; complete one representative recipe with documented inputs, reusable tools and output ownership, then prove that smaller tables, alternate recipes, rewards, EMC, loot or automation aliases cannot bypass the declared tier."]
	quest.6E79797DBD8A54EA.title: "Flux Crafter / Flux Alternator — Convergence Acceptance"
	quest.6E8C6A4A07957E5A.quest_desc: ["Hose Pulley is a fluid logistics or storage component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify flow direction, pump speed, tank reserve, infinite-source boundary, moving-interface contact and overflow; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6E95E958201D50BE.quest_desc: [
		"The personal chest used to be called, \"Electric Chest\" that could lock with the use of electricity. Now it is called the Personal Chest and doesn't need electricity. You can still lock it, and set it to \"trusted\"."
		""
		"The chest can be placed down and used as a regular, normal chest. This chest has the storage of a double-chest but the space of one chest. If you right click the air, your chest's storage will open up. If used with a Logistical Transporter, items can be piped in and out of the chest."
	]
	quest.6E9B60CCAE55E387.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.6E9B60CCAE55E387.title: "&fFlux Point"
	quest.6EBB60D3CF01C03D.quest_desc: ["Item Wyvern Proj Grav Comp is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6EBFFFB567687A1E.quest_desc: ["Ingots Stainless Steel is a cross-mod industrial integration component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material identity, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6ED242739E16BFBF.quest_desc: ["The 4096k Storage Disk can store 4096000 items."]
	quest.6EE0CF1C19D181CF.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is the Package Recipe Encoder?&r"
		""
		"The &ePackage Recipe Encoder&r is the tool used to &aencode recipes&r into &ePackage Recipe Holders&r."
		""
		"These encoded holders provide recipe data to all &ePackagedAuto&r machines."
		""
		"&eEncoding Recipes&r"
		""
		"To encode a recipe:"
		""
		"• Select a &erecipe type&r"
		"• Configure &einputs&r and &eoutputs&r"
		"• Set the required &eitem counts&r"
		""
		"Once configured, insert one or more &ePackage Recipe Holders&r and press the &aSave&r button."
		""
		"You can preview which &6Recipe Packages&r will be created on the right side of the interface."
		""
		"&eLoading Existing Recipes&r"
		""
		"• Insert an encoded &ePackage Recipe Holder&r"
		"• Press the &eLoad&r button"
		"• Existing recipes will be loaded"
		"  into the encoder interface"
	]
	quest.6EE0CF1C19D181CF.title: "&ePackage Recipe Encoder&r"
	quest.6EEA012FA11C7C08.quest_desc: ["Once you have found the location for your colony, you will likely want to build either a supply camp or supply ship. You can choose one but not both. Either will provide you with some basic supplies to help you get started in the early game. &o&7(bed, food, basic tools and armor, starting resources, etc.)&r&r It’s beneficial to place your supply camp or ship near your colony as you will be traveling back and forth to it frequently in the early game. &eClose, but not in the way close.&r"]
	quest.6EF133E0EC49BC33.quest_desc: ["Rubber Sheet is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6F327F16809D96A6.quest_desc: [
		"Impossibly tough and oddly spicy. Smells like protection. And cookies. Mostly cookies."
		""
		"&6Gingerbread Men will run up to any &4Candy Canes&f, &dGumball Piles&f, &7Sweet Teeth&f, Sundaes, &cCaramel Apples&f, Hot Chocolate Bottles, &dRadiant Essences&f, &bFrostmint&f, &eSundrops&f, &4Cakes&f, &6Pumpkin Pies&f, or &8Cookies&f &6on the ground and grab them. They will also chase down any players holding any of these candies in their inventory within a 20-block radius - upon reaching a player, they will take the candy from their inventory before running away for a minimum of 6 seconds. After stealing a rare candy, a Gingerbread Man will seek out any Gingerbarrels within a 32-block radius - upon reaching one, it will deposit the candy inside the Gingerbarrel. If 9 different rare candies are deposited into a Gingerbarrel by Gingerbread Men, they will convert into a random piece of Gingerbread armor&f."
	]
	quest.6F327F16809D96A6.title: "Gingerbread set"
	quest.6F3C4259ECFFAC99.quest_desc: ["Io Port is a bulk transfer or spatial-storage component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify transfer direction, cell compatibility, area boundary, protected blocks and rollback after interruption; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.6F57A2A5AA6E3F49.quest_desc: ["Oil Drilling Rig / Chain / Steel Machine Casing / Steel Machine Casing Pipe is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6F57A2A5AA6E3F49.title: "Oil Drilling Rig / Chain / Steel Machine Casing / Steel Machine Casing Pipe — Factory Acceptance"
	quest.6F62B5510FA881CD.quest_desc: [
		"This mod introduces many different mid-to-high tier forms of machinery, power generation, and tools to the game that create a whole new element of technology to a game originally aimed at survival."
		""
		"The mod focuses on breaking down materials to their chemical makeup, and getting the best out of every material you come across. "
		""
		"This mod features Hydrogen Powered Jetpacks, a Mini Robotic friend, Reactors, a Digital Miner to automate mining, Reactors, and much more."
	]
	quest.6F62B5510FA881CD.title: "Welcome To Mekanism"
	quest.6F63B60042A7F6AE.quest_desc: ["Bronze Compressor is a early steam-machine component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify steam supply, input and output separation, recipe duration, exhaust or byproducts and unattended stack processing; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6F6898DC529D1120.quest_desc: ["Steam Quarry / Steel Machine Casing / Chain / Steel Machine Casing Pipe is a early steam-machine component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify steam supply, input and output separation, recipe duration, exhaust or byproducts and unattended stack processing; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6F6898DC529D1120.title: "Steam Quarry / Steel Machine Casing / Chain / Steel Machine Casing Pipe — Factory Acceptance"
	quest.6F71FD826C29C31A.quest_desc: ["&eYouthful&r - Spawns a baby version of the mob inside the spawner if possible."]
	quest.6F8577EACCE26F1F.quest_subtitle: "Iced out"
	quest.6F864188C6FD3638.quest_desc: ["Mob Slaughter Factory is a mob-processing machine. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify spawn ownership, essence or fluid cost, blacklist policy and unique-drop exclusion; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.6F90D56060E854A9.quest_desc: ["Essentially a &6battery,&r if you need &eEMC&r to use an item, just have a &9charged star&r in your inventory."]
	quest.6F90D56060E854A9.title: "Klein Stars"
	quest.6F978C4D561F35EC.quest_subtitle: "Can be used to bottle a few liquids"
	quest.6FD65139CD50A8C0.quest_desc: ["Compressed Iron Seeds is a cross-mod pneumatic integration component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, conversion direction, pressure or heat dependency and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6FD65139CD50A8C0.title: "Compressed Iron Seeds — Pressure-System Acceptance"
	quest.6FE2D0B83A342E64.quest_desc: ["'I need more RANGE!!!' \\n \\nWell, slap one of these bad boys in your Wireless Transmitter and you'll be able to access your network storage with infinite range. \\n \\nThis, however, does not extend to other dimensions....."]
	quest.6FE2D0B83A342E64.title: "Infinite Range Booster"
	quest.6FE2FE40C2F60183.quest_desc: ["Relays rotation in two directions independently."]
	quest.6FE386C83D27FF6F.quest_subtitle: "Don't throw it after mining 3 stones"
	quest.6FF217AD12C1523C.quest_desc: ["Better then &9Netherite,&r these are crafted in a &esmithing table&r by buffing &9Netherite&r with the &6ATM template&r and &6ATM ore&r."]
	quest.6FFC4582D3620F32.quest_desc: ["A simple control device that opens or closes an electrical circuit. It allows you to start, stop, or redirect power flow to machines, lights, and automated systems with precision."]
	quest.70112194DFFD15D3.title: "&5Tyr Armor"
	quest.702AEA76BB811DD9.quest_desc: ["Travel Anchor is a travel and teleportation component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify destination ownership, range or dimensional rule, energy cost, safe arrival and recovery from a lost anchor; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.702AEA76BB811DD9.quest_subtitle: "This block may be broken"
	quest.70327C3AC547B354.quest_desc: ["Marked by its dark prismarine and yellow terracotta roof, this temple has long since fallen to corruption. Inside, swarms of spider-like creatures creep through its halls, striking with venom and ferocity. To enter is to step into a nest where every shadow crawls."]
	quest.70327C3AC547B354.quest_subtitle: "Find an Infested Temple"
	quest.703FD6207A3C5475.quest_desc: ["Memory Card is a specialized AE2 network component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify its channel, power, storage or routing contract and a safe disconnected or saturated state; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.7040CA41C0A3C2F2.quest_desc: ["Pcb Blueprint is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7044EAB5EDF32BBC.quest_desc: ["When attached to your system, the &9Crafting Monitor&r allows you to see what items are currently in your crafting queue. \\\\n \\\\n You'll need one of these if you want to be able to cancel crafts that aren't working or are bugged."]
	quest.7044EAB5EDF32BBC.title: "Monitoring the Crafting Queue"
	quest.704E19B3EFC43E17.quest_desc: ["Another rocket that allows you to reach more planets"]
	quest.7052C9A5A804E866.quest_desc: ["A riot of color rises from the wilderness, marking the territory of a cunning band of raiders. Their homes are bright and inviting, but enter at your own risk. These defenders strike fast and often. Those who prevail will find spoils and secrets hidden among the lively façades."]
	quest.7052C9A5A804E866.quest_subtitle: "Find a Bandit Village"
	quest.7064A09B6BDBC88D.title: "Golden Furnace"
	quest.7078DD00551BF863.quest_subtitle: "Does not use Neutronium from Avaritia tho"
	quest.707EBB99AA8F4C57.quest_desc: ["Steel Wiremill is a industrial material form in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify authoritative source material, forming machine, tool or mold return, batch buffer and tag-unification direction; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.708421C2339616F3.quest_desc: ["Draconic Staff is a modular tool, weapon or portable energy item in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify module capacity, charged performance, area effect, attack or mining throughput, repair path and energy supply; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.70CC7F36C90AFAD6.quest_desc: ["&rThe LaserIO mod allows players to manage items, fluids, energy, and redstone signals using a single block face, offering flexible and efficient resource transportation."]
	quest.70DD78CE9A860AC0.quest_desc: ["Conduit is a multi-service conduit or routing component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify service type, insert-extract direction, filter exactness, channel priority, redstone mode and loop prevention; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.70DD78CE9A860AC0.title: "Conduit — Machine-System Acceptance"
	quest.70E66957E98D944D.quest_desc: ["Gateways to Eternity adds wave-based combat events where you summon portals and fight through enemy waves for rewards."]
	quest.70E66957E98D944D.quest_subtitle: "A nice way to obtain good gems"
	quest.70E66957E98D944D.title: "Gateway"
	quest.71055E7BBB337C4D.quest_desc: ["Cataclysm Encounter Checkpoint 7C4D is a boss-encounter planning checkpoint in Cataclysm. Progress must come from discovering the correct structure, preparing for its mechanics and winning the legitimate encounter rather than receiving boss progress from a reward table or simulated drop source.","Acceptance: verify documented structure route, arena preparation, equipment reserve, escape and recovery plan, first-victory evidence and post-victory automation limits; document entry, arena safety, required equipment, failure recovery and first-victory evidence, then prove that Woot, neural simulation, spawners, trades, EMC, loot aliases and quest rewards cannot grant unique or capability-changing drops early."]
	quest.7111C78368C786CD.quest_desc: ["A partially crafted coil awaiting insulation or assembly. It’s an intermediate component used in producing fully functional electromagnetic devices and generators."]
	quest.71222E3AF49A8143.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is End Crafting?&r"
		""
		"&eEnd Crafting&r is a specialized crafting recipe type used to automate recipes from the &eEnd Crafting Table&r."
		""
		"It focuses on &5End-themed&r and &elate-game&r crafting recipes."
		""
		"&eWhy Use End Crafting?&r"
		""
		"• Automates End-specific crafting mechanics"
		"• Removes manual End Crafting"
		"• Fits naturally into late-game automation"
		"• Clean integration with &ePackagedAuto&r"
	]
	quest.71222E3AF49A8143.title: "&eEnd Crafting&r"
	quest.712CB147B5873121.quest_desc: ["An upgrade to the &bElite Fluid Tank&r."]
	quest.713006AB89E43C6D.quest_desc: ["Cataclysm Encounter Checkpoint 3C6D is a boss-encounter planning checkpoint in Cataclysm. Progress must come from discovering the correct structure, preparing for its mechanics and winning the legitimate encounter rather than receiving boss progress from a reward table or simulated drop source.","Acceptance: verify documented structure route, arena preparation, equipment reserve, escape and recovery plan, first-victory evidence and post-victory automation limits; document entry, arena safety, required equipment, failure recovery and first-victory evidence, then prove that Woot, neural simulation, spawners, trades, EMC, loot aliases and quest rewards cannot grant unique or capability-changing drops early."]
	quest.713EA1BC9BAAA0AB.quest_desc: [
		"The molecular assembler takes items input into it and carries out the operation defined by an adjacent ME Pattern Provider, or the inserted Crafting Pattern, Smithing Table Pattern, or Stonecutting Pattern, then pushes the result to adjacent inventories."
		""
		"This assembler has a crafting pattern that specifies the 1 oak log = 4 oak planks recipe. When oak logs are fed into the upper hopper, the assembler crafts and spits oak planks into the lower hopper."
	]
	quest.714380DBF581725A.quest_desc: [
		"If the&9 blue side&r of this shield is facing down it will &epush mobs away&r and &cdamage them&r, while the &4red side&r &epulls them&r towards you and&c damages them&r."
		""
		"&lShift-Right-Click&r to &bswitch the mode.&r"
	]
	quest.715344C9F5C7F174.quest_desc: ["Some of the&9 best gear&r, untill &dAvaritia&r where you gain &ccontrol of the&r &0universe.&r"]
	quest.715B86DC82EA636B.quest_desc: ["Liquid Compressor is a compressed-air generation component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify fuel or energy input, heat production, maximum pressure, air output and safe unload behaviour; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7162AD63AB61136A.quest_desc: ["Laser Drill is a laser resource acquisition system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify lens weighting, dimension rules, power cost, output table and stage-sensitive blacklist; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.7167023C7FD28CF0.quest_desc: [
		"&eNether Crafting&r"
		""
		"&eNether Crafting&r is a specialized crafting recipe type used to automate recipes from the &eNether Crafting Table&r."
		""
		"It focuses on &cNether-themed&r and &elate-game&r crafting recipes."
		""
		"The Nether Package Crafter &crequires power&r to operate."
		""
		"&eWhy Use Nether Crafting?&r"
		""
		"• Automates Nether-specific crafting mechanics"
		"• Removes manual Nether Crafting"
		"• Fits naturally into late-game automation"
		"• Clean integration with &ePackagedAuto&r"
	]
	quest.7167023C7FD28CF0.title: "&eNether Crafting&r"
	quest.7174A0CEC5CCC53B.quest_desc: [
		"See, they aren't all bad!"
		""
		"If you've completed the Ritual properly, you'll now have your very own &cFoliot Crusher Demon&r. These Demons are great at crushing down items for you!"
		""
		"To give it an item to crush, just throw it nearby and it will pick up the item and crush it. You can also sneak-right click the Demon to open up the inventory."
		""
		"This is a starter Demon, so it won't last very long. This one can also double your ore output for you!"
	]
	quest.7174A0CEC5CCC53B.title: "&aTalking with our New Friend!&r"
	quest.71776A6A96EB037C.quest_desc: ["Fire Clay Brick is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7177E49BF9ECA5CF.quest_desc: ["Thermal Compressor is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.717CA8EB4DF4EDB8.quest_desc: ["Acts like a blaze burner but with fuel and CO2 additionaly you can use the blaze burners with the straw."]
	quest.717D20AEF6E02B06.quest_subtitle: "All in 1 tool."
	quest.719218CEA358D540.quest_desc: ["Track is a railway and train-system component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify track continuity, station ownership, schedule order, signal blocks, loading time, unloaded chunks and recovery from obstruction; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.71A772DE60643C45.title: "The Inscriber Presses"
	quest.71A950338C3C57DA.quest_desc: [
		"Neptune Info:"
		"&aGravity:&r 11.082 m/s"
		"&bOxygen:&r none"
		"&cTemperature:&r -218 °C"
	]
	quest.71A9A81DAD843B88.quest_desc: ["Fluid Placer is a fluid logistics machine. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify source rules, tank reserve, chunk boundaries, overflow and unintended world-fluid duplication; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.71CD58F48960B657.quest_desc: ["&fYou&r have reached the &5pinnacle&r of &ecreation&r. These items is not just &4powerful&r they are &blimitless&r. With them, you bend &0the rules&r of &athe world&r itself. Few have ever &9come this far&r, and even fewer have held &dtrue infinity&r in their hands."]
	quest.71DF296B3C1D32B4.quest_desc: ["Cosmic Chemical Tank is a advanced chemical-processing component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify chemical phase, tank and side configuration, catalyst or secondary input, output separation, radioactive handling and clean purge; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.71EDE15818D4C2A1.quest_desc: ["The blast furnace can be any height you like. Taller furnaces melt steel faster."]
	quest.71EDE15818D4C2A1.title: "Blast Furnace"
	quest.71FB3EA8CB37A038.quest_desc: ["Applie on to a Blaze Burner to enable them to burn liquid fuels, some can superheat a blaze burner for way more time."]
	quest.71FCF06A98CC66D7.quest_desc: [
		"With so many colonists working for the greater good it can be difficult to know who needs what. The clipboard is an easy way to see all the requests your workers have."
		""
		"&eSneak + right-click&r on your town hall block to register the clipboard."
	]
	quest.720E5426BFA55DF4.quest_desc: ["Latex Processing Unit is a latex and plastic production step. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify wood feed, latex rate, water supply, rubber conversion and plastic buffer; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.721C40D15B15DDC1.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Furnace is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.7234CB42AEF6C941.quest_desc: ["Introducing chaos to your enchants. Higher &cQuanta&r means more &avariation&r in the result possibly better, possibly worse. It's a &bgamble&r... but sometimes the &ejackpot&r is worth it."]
	quest.7234CB42AEF6C941.title: "Quanta"
	quest.726DF1B2F0DFE008.quest_desc: ["Quantum Ring / Quantum Link / Quantum Entangled Singularity is a late cross-dimensional networking component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify singularity production, paired ownership, chunk availability, energy reserve and loss-safe reconnection; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.7295B4B792EB5103.quest_desc: ["Conductive Alloy Ingot is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.729A16C0DF2A473B.quest_desc: ["This book is the Dragon Master handbook. Inside you will find crucial information about dragons and other creatures roaming the Overworld."]
	quest.72AE2A8DC19D3A5B.quest_desc: ["World Transporter Type is a Industrial Foregoing production component. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify its exact work area, input contract, power or fluid demand, output routing and safe shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.72BC8C4941732A6E.quest_desc: ["Smart Cable is a channel-bearing network segment in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify channel count, controller path, colour isolation, tunnel boundaries and a visible overload diagnostic; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.72C09FD89C28B1EC.quest_desc: ["Refinery / Refinery Output / Thermal Lagging is a oil, heat or plastic processing component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify temperature window, fluid separation, heat source, output tanks, byproduct routing and clean cooldown; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.72C749AD9F1C634E.quest_desc: [
		"Citizens will go to the Residence they are assigned to at night to sleep. The Residence is also a way to get more citizens for your colony. Every residence level adds another bed. More beds means more citizen capacity."
		""
		"It’s worth considering residence locations and the citizens they house. Workers get grumpy when they have to travel long distances to work. Try to move citizens into homes close to where they work. "
	]
	quest.72C749AD9F1C634E.quest_subtitle: "Build a Residence"
	quest.72E4DF206C33D50D.quest_subtitle: "The main block used to craft the rockets!"
	quest.731BAB843C26EA77.quest_desc: ["Oh oh, so you actually did it, not like I doubted you or anything. Well congratulations! I bet the fight have been epic, surely you didn't use some futuristic gear or spells to one shot it, right?"]
	quest.7322A19FDA5B78E1.quest_desc: ["Copper Valve Handle is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.732D1A96512F2BFD.quest_desc: ["Steam Engine is a kinetic power source in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify environmental input, generated stress capacity, RPM, startup condition, reserve margin and safe shutdown; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.73349B993DE69954.quest_desc: [
		"We'll be using all of that Darkstone to create the Hephaestus Forge."
		""
		"Once you have all of the blocks needed, you'll need to build the platform for the forge."
		""
		"Once built, place a Smithing Table in the center, then sneak+right-click with a piece of Mundabitur Dust."
	]
	quest.73349B993DE69954.title: "&1The Hephaestus Forge"
	quest.73350AD668200E99.quest_desc: ["Prudentium Essence is a tier or resource essence. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify upgrade and downgrade direction, infusion-crystal durability, batch ratios and prevention of recursive conversion or EMC loops; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.73362EDC984B8A0F.quest_desc: [
		"Reactor &2Moderators&r are materials placed inside of a reactor where there aren't fuel rods &o&bto change how it performs&r, based on the &nproperties&r of the moderator. These are placed inside of the reactor &o&bduring construction&r."
		""
		"The &o&9rarer&r the material is, the &nbetter&r of a &2Moderator&r it is. Leaving the reactor &o&bempty&r means you are using the &7air&r inside as a moderator, which isn't that great."
		""
		"If you are looking for something &o&acheap&r in the early game, try using &3Graphite Blocks&r!"
	]
	quest.73362EDC984B8A0F.title: "Reactor Moderators"
	quest.735412C77BE7A82A.quest_desc: [
		"Fluids are input into the mixer through the port at the bottom of its powersupply. Items can be input via the two hatches at the back. The fluid port at the front serves as the fluid output."
		""
		"Applying a redstone signal to the control panel at the front will halt the machine's process, this behavior can be inverted by use of the Engineer's Screwdriver."
	]
	quest.735412C77BE7A82A.title: "Mixer"
	quest.73688A75A466C834.quest_desc: ["Slice And Splice is a specialized processing machine in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify recipe isolation, grinding-ball or secondary input, capacitor effect, byproducts, output blocking and restart; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.73708157A391E412.quest_desc: ["Hatched from &cdetonating&r the&6 nuclear furnace&r next to this &bcreatures egg&r, this mob is &dvery powerful&r, and &acan grow&r."]
	quest.73708157A391E412.quest_subtitle: "Hatch a tremorzilla"
	quest.737570259C5A4052.quest_desc: [
		"&cThe Nuclear Furnace&r is a &bfast&r, &emultiblock structure&r created by placing &aeight Nuclear Furnace Components&r in a &lcube&r. It uses &aUranium Rods&r as fuel, with each rod capable of smelting &l60&r items. However, using the furnace produces &atoxic waste&r, which accumulates &ninside the structure&r. To manage this, players must regularly &einsert a Metal Barrel&r to purge the waste."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&lIf the waste is not purged&r, the &cNuclear Furnace &rbegins to &eoverheat&r. As it &eoverheats&r, it goes through three &nvisual and physical stages&r: it starts to turn &eyellow&r, then &6shakes violently&r, and eventually &cignites fires nearby&r. While &coverheating&r does make &9smelting faster&r, it doesn't increase the number of items &aprocessed per Uranium Rod&r."
		""
		"If the &awaste&r continues to build up and is still not removed, the furnace will eventually &4explode&r in a blast similar to a &aNucleeper's&r. This explosion scatters &bUnrefined Waste&r and can also hatch any nearby &cTremorzilla Eggs&r."
	]
	quest.738F637AE5C1ECB6.title: "Obtain an &bElytra&r"
	quest.738FF04BEE2342A0.quest_desc: ["Meka Tool is a modular MekaSuit or Meka-Tool capability in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify module host, slot or unit count, energy demand, mining or combat throughput, flight or immunity effects, repair and replacement; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7395B41685F4BC1A.quest_desc: ["Flux Compressor is a compressed-air generation component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify fuel or energy input, heat production, maximum pressure, air output and safe unload behaviour; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.73A95AF90890098C.quest_desc: ["Item Wyvern Energy Link is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.73B6E398931525BA.quest_desc: ["Crystal Sword is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.73CE7FA690FC5760.quest_desc: ["Void Chassis is a specialized Ender IO component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its alloy, capacitor, side, conduit or inventory contract and a safe blocked or disconnected state; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.73D5EE5238C37982.quest_desc: ["In the wilds rests the skeletal form of a great creature. its skeleton stretching skyward like branches of pale bone. Whether a relic of forgotten myth or a beast once hunted to extinction, none can say. Its silent frame endures as a monument to creatures long lost."]
	quest.73D5EE5238C37982.quest_subtitle: "Find a Ceryneian Hind"
	quest.73E38D6DE2295C61.quest_desc: [
		"A &cblazing planet&r full of &echallenges&r and &6high heat&r. &nRequires&r a &cJet Suit&r and &cTier 3+&r&c Rocket&r to explore safely."
		""
		""
		"Venus Info:"
		"&aGravity:&r 8.87 m/s"
		"&bOxygen:&r none"
		"&cTemperature:&r 464.0 °C"
	]
	quest.74068F67A2FC5670.quest_desc: ["Reaction Chamber is a cross-mod AE2 integration component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, component data and the absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.74092BDC7DA9BAD9.quest_desc: ["Crystal Hoe is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.740AD1C00684D5CD.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is Extreme Crafting?&r"
		""
		"&eExtreme Crafting&r is an &cextreme endgame&r crafting recipe type used to automate recipes from the &eExtreme Crafting Table&r."
		""
		"It is intended for the &cmost expensive&r and &cmost complex&r recipes available."
		""
		"&eWhy Use Extreme Crafting?&r"
		""
		"• Automates the most demanding recipes"
		"• Removes manual Extreme Crafting"
		"• Handles massive ingredient counts cleanly"
		"• Essential for true endgame automation"
	]
	quest.740AD1C00684D5CD.title: "&eExtreme Crafting&r"
	quest.74200A48498DD7F8.quest_desc: [
		"Generates power from the &6sun&r!"
		""
		"Produces about &b17.6FE/t&r."
		""
		"Needs a &aunblocked&r view of the &bsky&r to funtion, similar to beacons."
	]
	quest.742A5BB44F257D8E.quest_desc: ["Item Pipe is a industrial fluid logistics or storage component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify fluid compatibility, capacity, transfer rate, side ownership, overflow destination and prevention of accidental mixing; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7436F6599E2D79C1.quest_desc: ["Nano Gravichestplate is a cross-mod industrial integration component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material identity, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7439CFAD20E3E2BF.quest_desc: [
		"Using this bone meal on Farmland will convert it to Magical Farmland."
		""
		"Crops will produce double the output when grown on Magical Farmland."
	]
	quest.7439CFAD20E3E2BF.quest_subtitle: "Use on Farmland to make it Magical!"
	quest.743C84D1D94C5670.quest_desc: ["Brass Funnel is a item-logistics component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify direction, filter, distribution mode, belt speed, destination capacity, overflow and prevention of recirculation loops; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.744842B2AED28344.quest_desc: ["Allows you to access your grid wirelessly but with a crafting table built-in."]
	quest.744842B2AED28344.title: "Wireless Crafting Grid"
	quest.744A01000E086CC9.quest_desc: ["The Dragon Scale can be made into a Golden and Aquatic Dragon Scales."]
	quest.7463BA727C6D8148.quest_desc: ["Surely you already made some right?"]
	quest.7463BA727C6D8148.quest_subtitle: "Use that Corporeal Matter we made earlier."
	quest.746DE7FD1C2B8DBF.quest_desc: ["Reactor Stabilizer is a draconic reactor safety component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify containment field, saturation, fuel conversion, extraction rate, emergency shutdown and blast-safe placement; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.746DE905D45A396C.quest_desc: ["Cataclysm Encounter Checkpoint 396C is a boss-encounter planning checkpoint in Cataclysm. Progress must come from discovering the correct structure, preparing for its mechanics and winning the legitimate encounter rather than receiving boss progress from a reward table or simulated drop source.","Acceptance: verify documented structure route, arena preparation, equipment reserve, escape and recovery plan, first-victory evidence and post-victory automation limits; document entry, arena safety, required equipment, failure recovery and first-victory evidence, then prove that Woot, neural simulation, spawners, trades, EMC, loot aliases and quest rewards cannot grant unique or capability-changing drops early."]
	quest.7486637361FEC7A9.quest_desc: ["Can be uncovered within &bsuspicious clay&r inside of &9Ancient cites&r, this is used to craft new &aarmor&r and a &dspell book&r."]
	quest.74ADA21AEDFB9E9F.quest_subtitle: "10.000 ingots"
	quest.74BA767367F2722B.quest_subtitle: "A way to teleport between dimensions"
	quest.74C114D0C0D4D374.quest_desc: ["Remember in the beginning how it seemed that everyone was sick with Influenza and you had to keep feeding everyone carrots and potatoes? With the hospital built, they can go see the doctor and get cured by the Healer. You or the colony still needs to supply the ingredients."]
	quest.74C114D0C0D4D374.quest_subtitle: "Build a Hospital"
	quest.74DA690631920E06.quest_subtitle: "Made just like normal bricks."
	quest.74E606B6472C77F9.quest_subtitle: "This one does burn tho."
	quest.74E8D7CBD9E3157D.quest_desc: [
		"The fundamental unit of this mod is the Data Model an item which holds information about an entity that you can utilize to generate their drops. "
		""
		"To get a Data Model, you must first craft a Data Model Framework, and use it on the target entity to build the model. Once you have your model, you will have to train it."
	]
	quest.74FB93DBD3DCFC41.quest_desc: ["Relay is a Source or item logistics component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify link direction, range, priority, destination capacity, visible diagnostics and loop prevention; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.74FE4BDF6CEFAA42.quest_desc: ["A mechanical system that transfers and regulates rotational power between engines and machinery. It ensures optimal speed, torque, and efficiency across connected components."]
	quest.750B10A7ADE8DE08.quest_desc: ["Logic Processor / Calculation Processor / Engineering Processor is a processor manufacturing component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify press ownership, silicon and printed-part routing, recipe isolation and processor throughput; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.75109760BD283B33.quest_desc: ["Supreme Logistical Transporter is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.751189465F91B353.quest_desc: ["&bCrystaline Seashelves&r are generally good bookshelves,&r however these shelves have a &aaverage Max&r &aEterna,&r so get ready for stronger shelves in your setup with this one."]
	quest.7522F2DC9038ED92.quest_desc: ["A better tier of Conducter with more storage."]
	quest.7522F2DC9038ED92.title: "&cAdvanced Thermodynamic Conductor"
	quest.753775F80FFD5B2C.quest_desc: ["Factory Checkpoint 5B2C is a factory planning checkpoint. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify documented inputs, outputs, ownership, failure state and restart procedure; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.7553689BC9202E14.quest_desc: ["&bElite Universal Cables&r are a version of &cadvanced cables&r with more storage."]
	quest.7553689BC9202E14.title: "&9Elite Universal Cables"
	quest.75560045ED084900.quest_desc: ["Soul Jar / Soulium Dagger / Soul Extractor is a linked agriculture system. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify component ratios, shared catalysts, legal crop tiers, output ownership and unattended completion without duplicating seeds or essences; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.75599A9909C7A8C8.quest_desc: ["Citizens need to eat in order to work. Until you have a restaurant and a steady supply of food, you will need to put a few pieces of food in their inventory. They’ll eat when they are hungry."]
	quest.75599A9909C7A8C8.title: "Another Mouth to Feed"
	quest.7559B2C7BB3440A8.quest_desc: ["Dragon Heart is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.757D4EEC01CBB056.quest_desc: ["Absolute Pressurized Tube is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.757E1521D84AC5C8.quest_desc: ["Blood is collected by crafting Test Tubes, then killing mobs with the Mystical Dagger."]
	quest.757E1521D84AC5C8.title: "&4Blood"
	quest.7593E582FA928061.quest_desc: ["Copper Drill is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.75A28517E08FE190.quest_subtitle: "Place down a Brass Gearbox"
	quest.75A28517E08FE190.title: "Serious Organization"
	quest.75AD0CEBC1335915.quest_desc: [
		"After placing this in a &creactor&r you will be able to view its stats, including &epower controls&r fuel levels&6, and &ctemperature levels&r."
		""
		"&oA few tips:&r"
		""
		"&cHigher core heat&r means &emore fuel used.&r"
		""
		"&cHigher casing heat&r &eincreases energy production&r, and &bcoolent conversion&r."
		""
		"You can choose either &amanual&r or &bautomatic&r &ewaste ejection&r mode, &aManual&r means the pipe attached to the &dSolid port&r must call for the waste i.e &cMekanism&r p&aipes on pull mode&r, while &9automatic&r outputs the &ewaste&r to the pipe anyways."
	]
	quest.75B3AB84C74ED23F.quest_desc: ["Me P2P Tunnel is a network compression or diagnostic component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify input-output pairing, channel accounting on both sides, naming and isolation of unrelated services; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.75C0ED308F5D7417.quest_desc: ["Mekasuit Helmet / Mekasuit Bodyarmor / Mekasuit Pants / Mekasuit Boots is a modular MekaSuit or Meka-Tool capability in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify module host, slot or unit count, energy demand, mining or combat throughput, flight or immunity effects, repair and replacement; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.75C0ED308F5D7417.title: "Mekasuit Helmet / Mekasuit Bodyarmor / Mekasuit Pants / Mekasuit Boots — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.75D242FBEA58818C.quest_desc: ["Quantum Crafter is a cross-mod AE2 integration component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, component data and the absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.75D3F3C1D4A3EAA2.quest_desc: ["Heat Pipe is a heat-transfer or temperature-control component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify hot and cold sides, insulation, equilibrium temperature, air cost, adjacent-machine demand and shutdown cooling; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.75DE856385F6FB3F.quest_desc: [
		"ME Soul Card"
		"An AE2 upgrade that allows you to accelerate your machines using Souls directly from your AE2 network, without the mess of Soul Surges."
		""
		"Usage"
		""
		"Craft the Soul Card and install it in a compatible AE2 machine (Pattern Providers, Interfaces, Export Buses, and Import Buses). The upgrade is only compatible with the part variants of the corresponding machines."
	]
	quest.75E3FA5CAD3C1F66.quest_desc: ["Summon Bangle is a cross-mod arcane integration component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, data-bearing state and absence of a cheaper parallel route; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.75E7216AB5411DF6.quest_desc: ["Mechanical Saw is a kinetic processing machine in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify required RPM and stress, recipe isolation, input and output buffer, heat or fluid condition, byproducts and full-output shutdown; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.75F9C3635B91F39F.quest_desc: ["Pulsating Photovoltaic Module is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7604D8B3C9FCCFD9.quest_desc: ["It's time to create the 'Hard Drives' of Refined Storage. To do this, we'll need a &9Storage Housing&r that we'll combine with a &aStorage Part&r to create a &dStorage Disk&r. Just simply make the desired size of the part, then combine with the housing to create a disk. \\\\n \\\\n The Storage Disk is used to store your items virtually once placed inside of the Disk Drive. It has to be put in a Disk Drive. The Storage Disk won’t despawn when dropped in the world."]
	quest.7604D8B3C9FCCFD9.title: "Storage Housing"
	quest.76071C22A73A2026.quest_desc: ["Tertium Farmland is a crop-tier farmland. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify hydration, crop-tier compatibility, harvest area, replacement stock and the effect of acceleration on server load; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.7630386B70BCB814.quest_desc: ["[ { \"text\": \"Click me!\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"551B6182DC7E577B\" } } ]"]
	quest.763614F0E739C5C3.quest_desc: ["Dropped from the &ewatcher&r, which is &csummoned&r when you have a &dunderzealot&r holding a &egloomoth&r with &efive other&r &dunderzealots&r are around it, you will use this for &6crafting&r."]
	quest.76406EFFF8CBA6B4.quest_subtitle: "DIAMONDS!!"
	quest.764C79BE8CA8F5D1.quest_desc: ["Arcanist Boots is a magical equipment tier in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify mana or Source benefit, thread slots, defensive statistics, mobility interaction and repair path; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.7653935BDE025D18.quest_desc: [
		"The &dScuba Tank&r is a piece of equipment worn on the backpack (the chest armor slot) that provides underwater respiration when a Scuba Mask is worn (on the helmet armor slot)."
		""
		"Like the &cJetpack&r, the &dScuba Tank&r must be filled with &3Oxygen&r gas in order to function."
		""
		"The &eScuba Mask&r is an utility head armor piece, used in conjunction with the &dScuba Tank&r to breathe underwater."
	]
	quest.7653935BDE025D18.title: "Scuba Gear"
	quest.7655E1C6C5E5469F.quest_desc: ["Prudentium Growth Accelerator is a Prudentium growth accelerator. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify vertical stacking, effective range, diminishing benefit, chunk activity and a measured limit for accelerated crop density; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.768789FEB6EBB8F8.quest_desc: ["Blaze Burner is a heat or steam-system component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify heat tier, fuel automation, water input, boiler level, engine count, stress output and dry-run protection; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.768F9EBD3E115CA6.quest_desc: ["A better tier of Tube with more storage."]
	quest.768F9EBD3E115CA6.title: "&cAdvanced Pressurized Tubes"
	quest.76919513DA354DBC.quest_desc: ["Gearbox / Vertical Gearbox is a kinetic transmission component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify rotation direction, RPM ratio, stress capacity, branch isolation, reverse state and visible diagnostics; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.76A38CCA5816CDAD.quest_desc: ["Combining Oxygen, thylene, and a Substrate in a Pressurized Reaction Chamber will create an HDPE Pellet."]
	quest.76A38CCA5816CDAD.title: "HDPE Pellets"
	quest.76B34EEE64731991.quest_desc: ["A &l3x3&r pad where you place and launch your &crockets.&r Without it, your &crocket’s&r not going anywhere."]
	quest.76BC484FC50EAEC3.quest_desc: [
		"To enchant items, you'll need Darkstone Pedestals placed around the Forge."
		""
		"Make sure to place these on the Arcane Chiseled Polished Darkstone."
	]
	quest.76BC484FC50EAEC3.title: "Darkstone Pedestals"
	quest.76C86143497AA77E.quest_subtitle: "Allows for easy trade with villagers"
	quest.76C86143497AA77E.title: "Easy Villagers"
	quest.76E0FA2416CF0B39.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is Basic Crafting?&r"
		""
		"&eBasic Crafting&r is a simple crafting recipe type used to automate recipes craftable in a &eBasic Crafting Table&r."
		""
		"It is designed as a lightweight alternative to standard crafting systems."
		""
		"&eHow It Works&r"
		""
		"• Uses the &eBasic Package Crafter&r"
		"• Supports recipes from the &eBasic Crafting Table&r"
		"• Crafted items are &eejected&r into adjacent inventories"
		""
		"The Basic Package Crafter &crequires power&r to operate."
		""
		"&eUse Cases&r"
		""
		"• Automating simple crafting recipes"
		"• Early- to mid-game automation"
		"• Lightweight PackagedAuto setups"
		"• Compact crafting systems"
		""
		"&eWhy Use Basic Crafting?&r"
		""
		"• Simple and easy to set up"
		"• Lower complexity than full crafting systems"
		"• Works seamlessly with &ePackagedAuto&r"
		"• Integrates cleanly with &3AE2&r"
	]
	quest.76E0FA2416CF0B39.title: "&eBasic Crafting&r"
	quest.76E6C8B3F124B3B2.quest_desc: ["Draconium Dust is a tier-defining draconic material or core in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify material origin, previous-tier core, awakening or Chaos prerequisite, batch size and reusable progression permissions; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.76F22616A4D03494.quest_desc: ["Used to scan and build multiblocks and see if they are complete or missing anything."]
	quest.76F51AD1E8A28949.quest_desc: ["If you wish to tame a hippogryph feed it some rabbit feet."]
	quest.7700E08416618198.quest_desc: [
		"Interfaces act like a small chest and fluid tank that fills itself from and empties to network storage depending on what you set it to keep a stock of in its slots. It tries to complete this in a single gametick, so it can fill itself with or empty itself from up to 9 stacks per gametick, making it a fast method of import or export if you have fast item pipes."
		""
		"Another useful trait is that while most fluid tanks can only store 1 type of fluid, interfaces can store up to 9, as well as items. They're essentially just chests/multi-fluid tanks with some extra functionality, and you can prevent that extra functionality by keeping them disconnected from any networks. Thus, they are useful in some niche cases where you want to store a small amount of a bunch of different stuff."
	]
	quest.7703240374D92007.quest_desc: ["Sag Mill is a specialized processing machine in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify recipe isolation, grinding-ball or secondary input, capacitor effect, byproducts, output blocking and restart; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.773C9DA610091CFC.quest_desc: ["Push smelting to the absolute limit with extraordinary &asmelting speed&r, reconfigurable sides, &daugments&r for &csmoking&r and &2blasting&r and much more."]
	quest.773C9DA610091CFC.title: "Iron Furnace"
	quest.774AA4A99AED8B97.quest_desc: [
		"Sedna Info:"
		"&aGravity:&r 0.098 m/s"
		"&bOxygen:&r none"
		"&cTemperature:&r -240 °C"
	]
	quest.774B1D4152A0B4ED.quest_desc: ["The hammer forms and services Immersive Engineering multiblocks; it is not merely a crafting ingredient.","Acceptance: keep a spare outside the production area, leave safe access to formation faces, and document how each critical multiblock is rebuilt after failure."]
	quest.77572C546A50BE0C.quest_desc: ["Shape Card Liquid is a builder or area-operation component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify shape-card bounds, chunk ownership, filter rules, energy per operation, protected blocks and output collection; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.776451A1A5F3B2FB.quest_desc: ["Place the Electric Gauge on a section of a circuit to measure various stats. Exact values can be viewed using Goggles, and the quantity being measured can be changed with the Wrench."]
	quest.776C4F2AE494ADB1.quest_desc: ["Galactic measures involve using specialized units like parsecs (pc) and kiloparsecs (kpc) for vast distances (thousands of light-years), employing the Galactic coordinate system (latitude/longitude) for locations within our Milky Way, and determining size via D25 isophotes (brightness levels) or redshift/spectral analysis for distance, with concepts like the Kardashev scale measuring a civilization's energy use, all to quantify the enormous scales of stars, galaxies, and cosmic structures. "]
	quest.776C4F2AE494ADB1.quest_subtitle: "Are you even reading this?"
	quest.7778937DF377C1B4.quest_desc: [
		"This is a great option for generating power."
		""
		"This generates around &b40FE/t&r, and increases based on &nhow high you are&r."
		""
		"The higher the &o&bY level&r, the more &cpower&r it produces!"
	]
	quest.7778937DF377C1B4.quest_subtitle: "Generates Power from the Wind"
	quest.7798733A0ED2A8C3.quest_desc: ["Those cute looking feelas roam in deep seas, they are easy to kill, well as long as sea serpents aren't nearby."]
	quest.779C3C6B89AD2526.quest_desc: ["Analog Circuit is a industrial control-circuit tier in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify previous circuit tier, board and wire supply, clean-room or machine requirement, batch yield and stage authority; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.77B2C22D776D1B60.quest_desc: ["Connects forge energy compatible blocks with wires to transfer energy."]
	quest.77C016A83AD73399.quest_desc: ["Allows the player to controll a Brass Drone"]
	quest.77C3D285E52CCA0E.quest_desc: ["White Table Cloth is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.77DEFD511513D7CE.quest_desc: [
		"Using &9relays,&r you can create a &eEMC \"Flower\"&r to generate almost any item easily, you will make this similarly to a &bpyramid&r with a stem."
		""
		"&cFlowers&r will provide much &eEMC&r to the &6Condenser&r in the &amiddle.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&d&lFirst:&r&r Place your &6energy condenser&r, this will be the &amiddle&r of the flower."
		""
		"&d&lSecond:&r&r surround it with &9relays&r on every side &aexcept the&r &abottom.&r"
		""
		"&d&lThird:&r&r Place &benergy collectors&r on every side of the &9relays&r except the &abottom.&r"
		""
		"&d&lFourth:&r&r Place &cglowstone&r on the &atop&r of every &benergy collector&r."
		""
		"&5&lFinally:&r&r place the item you want to produce into the &6energy condenser&r and attach &cMekanism&r pipes to the &6condenser&r to transport the generated items."
	]
	quest.77E56DA3EA680F09.quest_desc: ["Otherstone / Otherrock / Otherworld Log is a Otherworld material or spirit-attuned resource in Occultism. Its value comes from a correct ritual, a bounded spirit contract or a controlled dimensional system rather than from merely possessing the item.","Acceptance: verify legal revelation method, mining or transformation route, tool requirement, batch yield and prevention of early acquisition through EMC or generic miners; perform a representative ritual, spirit task or storage cycle, record ingredients, duration, capacity and recovery, and close quest-reward, trade, loot, EMC, miner, possession and alternate-ritual shortcuts."]
	quest.77E56DA3EA680F09.quest_subtitle: "Otherworld"
	quest.77E56DA3EA680F09.title: "Otherstone / Otherrock / Otherworld Log — Ritual Acceptance"
	quest.77F07C8F789C0FA4.quest_desc: ["Arcanist Hood is a magical equipment tier in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify mana or Source benefit, thread slots, defensive statistics, mobility interaction and repair path; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.77F958F43649A746.quest_subtitle: "Make sure you have ender eyes"
