	quest.7BDBE300D4B0B1F7.quest_desc: ["Bronze Composter is a cross-mod industrial integration component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material identity, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7C074B5E2A0EAA63.quest_desc: ["Controls is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
