	quest.04AEF52600119C28.title: "Backpack — Storage-System Acceptance"
	quest.04AEF52600119C28.quest_desc: ["Backpack is a portable or stationary storage tier in the portable and stationary storage ecosystem. Its value depends on controlled inventory ownership, routing, finite capacity and recoverable configuration rather than on possessing one container or upgrade.","Acceptance: verify slot and stack capacity, previous-tier ancestry, retained contents during upgrade, placement or carrying rules and recovery after container loss; run a representative input and extraction cycle, test empty input and full destination, record capacity and priorities, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, duplication, nested-container and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
