	quest.91CD8E6BC90B72F7.quest_desc: ["Stage 1 — Field Foundations: Manual Fabrication defines part of the mandatory route toward kubejs:field_engineering_kit. This stage joins minecraft, immersiveengineering, actuallyadditions and focuses on recoverable manual work, early material identity and survival safety before automation.","Study the system before building it: identify recipe ownership, previous-tier ancestry, reusable tools and repeatable batches; list legal inputs, controlled outputs and failure boundaries, and explain why the substage belongs before the gated outputs kubejs:field_engineering_kit, kubejs:materials_analysis_matrix, kubejs:power_regulation_unit."]
	quest.0899F580BA0B94C0.title: "Field Foundations — Manual Fabrication: Infrastructure Build"
	quest.0899F580BA0B94C0.quest_desc: ["Build a bounded demonstration of Manual Fabrication using at least two stage domains from minecraft, immersiveengineering, actuallyadditions. Assign every input, output, buffer, reusable component and control signal to an explicit owner.","The design must address recipe ownership, previous-tier ancestry, reusable tools and repeatable batches. Prefer repeatable infrastructure over manual repetition, include a visible stop condition and leave enough access to replace one failed component without dismantling unrelated production."]
