	quest.BAEEB2F0B8EBCF9A.quest_desc: ["Accept the Manual Fabrication installation as a production system, not as a placed-block checklist. Run a representative cycle and record manual batch time, spare tools, protected storage and recovery after a simulated loss.","Test full output, missing input and interrupted power or transport; recover without duplication or loss, review rewards, EMC, loot, trade, simulation and alternate recipes, and confirm that progression advances only through the declared milestone kubejs:field_engineering_kit."]
