	quest.FCA0AD1358A7AB9B.quest_desc: ["Stage 1 — Field Foundations: Field Safety defines part of the mandatory route toward kubejs:field_engineering_kit. This stage joins minecraft, immersiveengineering, actuallyadditions and focuses on recoverable manual work, early material identity and survival safety before automation.","Study the system before building it: identify failure prevention, safe shutdown and documented recovery; list legal inputs, controlled outputs and failure boundaries, and explain why the substage belongs before the gated outputs kubejs:field_engineering_kit, kubejs:materials_analysis_matrix, kubejs:power_regulation_unit."]
