	quest.1B2B459CB06B3420.quest_desc: ["Build a bounded demonstration of Field Safety using at least two stage domains from minecraft, immersiveengineering, actuallyadditions. Assign every input, output, buffer, reusable component and control signal to an explicit owner.","The design must address failure prevention, safe shutdown and documented recovery. Prefer repeatable infrastructure over manual repetition, include a visible stop condition and leave enough access to replace one failed component without dismantling unrelated production."]
	quest.51FC7057BE5517EF.title: "Field Foundations — Field Safety: Production Acceptance"
	quest.51FC7057BE5517EF.quest_desc: ["Accept the Field Safety installation as a production system, not as a placed-block checklist. Run a representative cycle and record manual batch time, spare tools, protected storage and recovery after a simulated loss.","Test full output, missing input and interrupted power or transport; recover without duplication or loss, review rewards, EMC, loot, trade, simulation and alternate recipes, and confirm that progression advances only through the declared milestone kubejs:field_engineering_kit."]
	quest.CD647B7DFEF03759.title: "Steam and Metallurgy — Coke And Creosote: System Contract"
	quest.CD647B7DFEF03759.quest_desc: ["Stage 2 — Steam and Metallurgy: Coke And Creosote defines part of the mandatory route toward kubejs:structural_lattice. This stage joins modern_industrialization, immersiveengineering, create and focuses on water-secure steam, coke and creosote handling, repeatable steel and common structural standards.","Study the system before building it: identify inputs, outputs, constraints, ownership, repeatability and recovery; list legal inputs, controlled outputs and failure boundaries, and explain why the substage belongs before the gated outputs modern_industrialization:bronze_boiler, immersiveengineering:blastbrick_reinforced, kubejs:structural_lattice."]
	quest.24F744AB92E2D478.title: "Steam and Metallurgy — Coke And Creosote: Infrastructure Build"
	quest.24F744AB92E2D478.quest_desc: ["Build a bounded demonstration of Coke And Creosote using at least two stage domains from modern_industrialization, immersiveengineering, create. Assign every input, output, buffer, reusable component and control signal to an explicit owner.","The design must address inputs, outputs, constraints, ownership, repeatability and recovery. Prefer repeatable infrastructure over manual repetition, include a visible stop condition and leave enough access to replace one failed component without dismantling unrelated production."]
	quest.AFD09984615D6C64.title: "Steam and Metallurgy — Coke And Creosote: Production Acceptance"
	quest.AFD09984615D6C64.quest_desc: ["Accept the Coke And Creosote installation as a production system, not as a placed-block checklist. Run a representative cycle and record fuel, water, steam, solid and fluid yields plus clean shutdown under blocked output.","Test full output, missing input and interrupted power or transport; recover without duplication or loss, review rewards, EMC, loot, trade, simulation and alternate recipes, and confirm that progression advances only through the declared milestone kubejs:structural_lattice."]
