	quest.5877FB64648863CB.quest_desc: ["Stage 2 — Steam and Metallurgy: Bronze Steam defines part of the mandatory route toward kubejs:structural_lattice. This stage joins modern_industrialization, immersiveengineering, create and focuses on water-secure steam, coke and creosote handling, repeatable steel and common structural standards.","Study the system before building it: identify legal first sources, conversion yield, renewable limits and protected-material policy; list legal inputs, controlled outputs and failure boundaries, and explain why the substage belongs before the gated outputs modern_industrialization:bronze_boiler, immersiveengineering:blastbrick_reinforced, kubejs:structural_lattice."]
