	quest.0AFD5DC11149366E.quest_desc: ["Accept the Pack Mastery Project installation as a production system, not as a placed-block checklist. Run a representative cycle and record all stage proofs, authoritative creative recipes, safety boundaries, project throughput, controlled failure and release reports.","Test full output, missing input and interrupted power or transport; recover without duplication or loss, review rewards, EMC, loot, trade, simulation and alternate recipes, and confirm that progression advances only through the declared milestone kubejs:creative_convergence_matrix."]
	quest.C302C8F99362661E.title: "Creative Convergence — Completion Audit: System Contract"
	quest.C302C8F99362661E.quest_desc: ["Stage 18 — Creative Convergence: Completion Audit defines part of the mandatory route toward kubejs:creative_convergence_matrix. This stage joins avaritia, extendedcrafting, projecte, mekanism, ae2 and focuses on creative components, limit-removing infrastructure, an integrated mastery project and final release audit.","Study the system before building it: identify failure prevention, safe shutdown and documented recovery; list legal inputs, controlled outputs and failure boundaries, and explain why the substage belongs before the gated outputs kubejs:creative_convergence_matrix."]
	quest.761F3555B07EAC16.title: "Creative Convergence — Completion Audit: Infrastructure Build"
	quest.761F3555B07EAC16.quest_desc: ["Build a bounded demonstration of Completion Audit using at least two stage domains from avaritia, extendedcrafting, projecte, mekanism, ae2. Assign every input, output, buffer, reusable component and control signal to an explicit owner.","The design must address failure prevention, safe shutdown and documented recovery. Prefer repeatable infrastructure over manual repetition, include a visible stop condition and leave enough access to replace one failed component without dismantling unrelated production."]
	quest.F9A8BAC228480F91.title: "Creative Convergence — Completion Audit: Production Acceptance"
	quest.F9A8BAC228480F91.quest_desc: ["Accept the Completion Audit installation as a production system, not as a placed-block checklist. Run a representative cycle and record all stage proofs, authoritative creative recipes, safety boundaries, project throughput, controlled failure and release reports.","Test full output, missing input and interrupted power or transport; recover without duplication or loss, review rewards, EMC, loot, trade, simulation and alternate recipes, and confirm that progression advances only through the declared milestone kubejs:creative_convergence_matrix."]
	chapter_group.F56B9C180F65BF60.title: "v1 Main Progression — 18 Stages"
