	quest.DF796FDDC827FF1A.quest_desc: ["A professional installation must explain why it stopped. Stage 16 should expose readable input, output, reserve and error states instead of requiring blind block replacement.","Deep-dive task: turn Interrupt one large craft and verify all rare inputs remain accounted for and can resume without manual recipe reconstruction. into a diagnostic decision tree. Include empty input, blocked output, lost power or pressure, unloaded chunks, invalid recipe state and the first safe recovery action."]
	quest.B571873FB9DEFE52.title: "Capacity and Scaling"
	quest.B571873FB9DEFE52.quest_desc: ["Scaling is part of the lesson: the second batch should become faster through parallel machines, larger buffers or better logistics rather than through more repetitive clicking.","Deep-dive task: measure Record resource rate per singularity, craft duration, table occupancy, catalyst return, parallel capacity and the dominant bottleneck.. Calculate the smallest useful buffer, identify the bottleneck at 1x and 4x demand, and define the upgrade that preserves balanced upstream and downstream rates."]
	quest.AD3FD915B2CCF5A1.title: "Expert Extension Project"
	quest.AD3FD915B2CCF5A1.quest_desc: ["Complete an optional extension for Stage 16 that combines at least two of extendedcrafting, avaritia, projecte without replacing the main milestone or granting an early capability.","Project acceptance: run Use request limits and stage-specific stock targets so extreme fabrication scales infrastructure rather than repetitive clicking.; then demonstrate Restore an interrupted singularity and large-craft pipeline from stored intermediate components and recorded request state. and perform the anti-bypass review described by Close ultimate tables, extreme tables, singularities and catalysts through loot, rewards, EMC, seed or bee production, salvage and addon crafters.. Record one design lesson that should be reused in the next stage."]
	chapter.5E0D19BAF2897C8A.title: "Stage 17 — Cosmic Synthesis"
