	quest.65F9D4D917E0FB3E.title: "Domain Map and Responsibilities"
	quest.65F9D4D917E0FB3E.quest_desc: ["This optional annex expands Stage 17 — Cosmic Synthesis. Its gameplay domains are avaritia, draconicevolution, divinerpg, stellaris; assign one explicit responsibility to every domain before combining their machines or resources.","Deep-dive task: document which mod owns acquisition, transformation, storage, transport and control. Use Combine Avaritia, Draconic Evolution, DivineRPG and stellar content while preserving real first victories and scalable ordinary materials. as the integration target and identify one interface buffer between each pair of mods."]
	quest.89AB12F88041D1D8.title: "Recipe and Gate Map"
	quest.89AB12F88041D1D8.quest_desc: ["The stage controls outputs such as kubejs:cosmic_synthesis_core, avaritia:infinity_ingot. A difficult recipe is fair only when every ingredient represents already-built infrastructure and the route scales after the first successful batch.","Deep-dive task: draw the authoritative recipe path, mark reusable permissions and returned tools, list every alternate source, and explain why no later-stage ingredient or circular dependency is required. Supply focus: Maintain Infinity catalysts, awakened cores, antimatter controls, stellar or dimensional resources and reusable lunar permissions in separate vaults."]
	quest.014B2E841F08CC2B.title: "Alternative Architecture"
	quest.014B2E841F08CC2B.quest_desc: ["The main branch defines the required capability, not one mandatory block layout. Within Stage 17, alternative architectures are valid when they preserve the same inputs, outputs, rate, safety and anti-bypass boundary.","Deep-dive task: design a second implementation of Build Infinity-material, stellar-resource and cosmic-energy production as converging supply chains with no single random bottleneck.. Compare footprint, energy or fuel demand, throughput, operator effort and recovery cost without using a cheaper progression shortcut."]
	quest.03020E95A9AB1E3A.title: "Diagnostic Playbook"
	quest.03020E95A9AB1E3A.quest_desc: ["A professional installation must explain why it stopped. Stage 17 should expose readable input, output, reserve and error states instead of requiring blind block replacement.","Deep-dive task: turn Remove one cosmic input line and prove the remaining factory stops safely without consuming irreplaceable catalysts or permissions. into a diagnostic decision tree. Include empty input, blocked output, lost power or pressure, unloaded chunks, invalid recipe state and the first safe recovery action."]
	quest.243FD6BE5267CB40.title: "Capacity and Scaling"
	quest.243FD6BE5267CB40.quest_desc: ["Scaling is part of the lesson: the second batch should become faster through parallel machines, larger buffers or better logistics rather than through more repetitive clicking.","Deep-dive task: measure Record production time and bottleneck for one Infinity Ingot, energy reserve, unique permissions used and repeatable bulk inputs.. Calculate the smallest useful buffer, identify the bottleneck at 1x and 4x demand, and define the upgrade that preserves balanced upstream and downstream rates."]
	quest.378E781A908B3FEA.title: "Expert Extension Project"
	quest.378E781A908B3FEA.quest_desc: ["Complete an optional extension for Stage 17 that combines at least two of avaritia, draconicevolution, divinerpg, stellaris without replacing the main milestone or granting an early capability.","Project acceptance: run Automate ordinary cosmic components and material convergence while keeping unique encounter evidence reusable but non-generatable.; then demonstrate Resume cosmic synthesis after one supply-chain outage using protected intermediates and a written order of reconnection. and perform the anti-bypass review described by Audit Infinity materials, stellar drops and cosmic catalysts across EMC, loot, rewards, trades, simulation, seeds, bees and creative-item recipes.. Record one design lesson that should be reused in the next stage."]
